(314689, 23820, 6172, '<td valign="top">oh, you mean WET dreams!</td>', 'oh, you mean WET dreams!', '2003-06-04 03:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(314693, 23820, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I''d like to see more of the sheet for the effect to be complete. The blurring on the face is a bit off-putting although I can see why that''s intended. Anyway, who''s dream?</td>', 'Nice idea. I''d like to see more of the sheet for the effect to be complete. The blurring on the face is a bit off-putting although I can see why that''s intended. Anyway, who''s dream?', '2003-06-04 03:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(314695, 23346, 9073, '<td valign="top">Good use of strong rhythms and contrast. The mirror image is effective, and the tilting is eye-catching.</td>', 'Good use of strong rhythms and contrast. The mirror image is effective, and the tilting is eye-catching.', '2003-06-04 03:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(314697, 23709, 7653, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, and the execution is pretty decent. I just wish the tear could have been beaded more.</td>', 'I like this concept, and the execution is pretty decent. I just wish the tear could have been beaded more.', '2003-06-04 03:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(314698, 23690, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Neat shot.  Saw this exact same concept on psig today too.  Maybe it''s yours too, but if not check it out //www.photosig.com/go/photos/view?id=931844.<br/>Love the color in this shot.  I''m a huge fan of color and this take the cake.  I especially love the background.  Very nice vivid colors, and nothing distracting.<br/>I only wish that the large bubble in the middle didn''t have that white line that makes it look ''not round''.  That little tiny part is a bit distracting, but hey, what can you do?  Great job.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'Wow.  Neat shot.  Saw this exact same concept on psig today too.  Maybe it''s yours too, but if not check it out //www.photosig.com/go/photos/view?id=931844.Love the color in this shot.  I''m a huge fan of color and this take the cake.  I especially love the background.  Very nice vivid colors, and nothing distracting.I only wish that the large bubble in the middle didn''t have that white line that makes it look ''not round''.  That little tiny part is a bit distracting, but hey, what can you do?  Great job.~Heather~', '2003-06-04 03:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(314700, 23228, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but there''s a confusion of intention - the grey shadow doesn''t play well with both the space behind it and the red paint, one aspect would have been enough. Maybe a lower angle would have been more effective.</td>', 'I like the idea, but there''s a confusion of intention - the grey shadow doesn''t play well with both the space behind it and the red paint, one aspect would have been enough. Maybe a lower angle would have been more effective.', '2003-06-04 03:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(314703, 23310, 9073, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s because I''m lazy, but I have to work too hard here to get the point. The image isn''t crisp enough to be classy. The lime isn''t obvious enough to be the subject. The ice isn''t sharp enough to be a strong element. I''m sorry, but this one doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Maybe it''s because I''m lazy, but I have to work too hard here to get the point. The image isn''t crisp enough to be classy. The lime isn''t obvious enough to be the subject. The ice isn''t sharp enough to be a strong element. I''m sorry, but this one doesn''t work for me.', '2003-06-04 03:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(314705, 23147, 9073, '<td valign="top">If the top was completely sharp, this photo would be a winner for me. I think that you wanted to create motion, but the sharpness of the main shape is beautiful as is and would have made a great subject without the runny mess on top. OR, go for the runny mess as a subject. Both don''t work together.</td>', 'If the top was completely sharp, this photo would be a winner for me. I think that you wanted to create motion, but the sharpness of the main shape is beautiful as is and would have made a great subject without the runny mess on top. OR, go for the runny mess as a subject. Both don''t work together.', '2003-06-04 03:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(314707, 23688, 8970, '<td valign="top">Watch your reflections in objects</td>', 'Watch your reflections in objects', '2003-06-04 03:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(314710, 23553, 9073, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble trying to work out the relationship between these two objects. OK, one is made from water and the other needs water to survive. But, beyond that, I can''t see it. Even their shapes and colours don''t inter-related enough to suggest meaning. Nice sharpness on the metal, though.</td>', 'I''m having trouble trying to work out the relationship between these two objects. OK, one is made from water and the other needs water to survive. But, beyond that, I can''t see it. Even their shapes and colours don''t inter-related enough to suggest meaning. Nice sharpness on the metal, though.', '2003-06-04 03:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(314713, 23163, 9073, '<td valign="top">Good, strong colours, effective use of blur - you''ve tried to create the ''party'' atmosphere. Having come this far, I miss the other party signs: more external details would have helped, I feel. Also, the hand seems too strong and rather detracts from the flavour somewhat.</td>', 'Good, strong colours, effective use of blur - you''ve tried to create the ''party'' atmosphere. Having come this far, I miss the other party signs: more external details would have helped, I feel. Also, the hand seems too strong and rather detracts from the flavour somewhat.', '2003-06-04 03:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(314716, 23222, 7653, '<td valign="top">Oh my god! This is pretty insane. I like!!</td>', 'Oh my god! This is pretty insane. I like!!', '2003-06-04 03:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(314717, 23825, 9073, '<td valign="top">It might have been funnier if the title didn''t give away the punch-line. Good idea for a joke, photograph.</td>', 'It might have been funnier if the title didn''t give away the punch-line. Good idea for a joke, photograph.', '2003-06-04 03:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(314718, 23763, 9073, '<td valign="top">Very effective colour interplay here, and the background done well. Nice poster shot.</td>', 'Very effective colour interplay here, and the background done well. Nice poster shot.', '2003-06-04 03:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(314719, 23418, 7653, '<td valign="top">The fading of the yellow backdrop towards the top killed a little of the vitality of this shot. I like the composition though.</td>', 'The fading of the yellow backdrop towards the top killed a little of the vitality of this shot. I like the composition though.', '2003-06-04 03:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(314720, 23791, 7653, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Damn that is painful to look at... makes for an interesting subject.<br/> <br/>The flesh looks all blurred out. That is my main problem with this shot. Otherwise I like the idea.</td>', 'Yikes! Damn that is painful to look at... makes for an interesting subject. The flesh looks all blurred out. That is my main problem with this shot. Otherwise I like the idea.', '2003-06-04 03:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(314722, 23796, 7653, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! That''s a really great idea....<br/> <br/>Next time: Maybe change up the color of the background. A neutral white might have worked better. Getting the bottom of the blender in the shot would help too. Its a bit distracting having the bottom cropped off. Good work though.</td>', 'Oh wow! That''s a really great idea.... Next time: Maybe change up the color of the background. A neutral white might have worked better. Getting the bottom of the blender in the shot would help too. Its a bit distracting having the bottom cropped off. Good work though.', '2003-06-04 03:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(314723, 23791, 9073, '<td valign="top">This one works for me - especially the upturned lip emphasising the sense of disgust at cosmetic surgery. However, the marks on the chin and the general fuzziness of the image bother me a little.</td>', 'This one works for me - especially the upturned lip emphasising the sense of disgust at cosmetic surgery. However, the marks on the chin and the general fuzziness of the image bother me a little.', '2003-06-04 03:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(314725, 23642, 7653, '<td valign="top">Good concept. A better execution would have helped. The fire is fine as blurry, but I would have liked a better look at the bottle.</td>', 'Good concept. A better execution would have helped. The fire is fine as blurry, but I would have liked a better look at the bottle.', '2003-06-04 03:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(314726, 23834, 9073, '<td valign="top">Yuk! But funny. I like the joke, but the set-up feels a little too forced, with the shoes arranged neatly in an unnatural place (where, with a touch of bad luck, they might receive some of the liquid). Otherwise, nice tonal contrast and a good capture of the (bowel?) movement.</td>', 'Yuk! But funny. I like the joke, but the set-up feels a little too forced, with the shoes arranged neatly in an unnatural place (where, with a touch of bad luck, they might receive some of the liquid). Otherwise, nice tonal contrast and a good capture of the (bowel?) movement.', '2003-06-04 03:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(314731, 23800, 9073, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this one as the thumbnail didn''t give away any clues. Having seen the full shot, I''m still none the wiser. As for an image, I''d like the bubbles and balls to be sharper, and the dof a little deeper to cover the right-hand side.</td>', 'I had to look at this one as the thumbnail didn''t give away any clues. Having seen the full shot, I''m still none the wiser. As for an image, I''d like the bubbles and balls to be sharper, and the dof a little deeper to cover the right-hand side.', '2003-06-04 03:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(314733, 23490, 8250, '<td valign="top">its still water though</td>', 'its still water though', '2003-06-04 03:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(314735, 23754, 9073, '<td valign="top">As a Scot, I always enjoy a good dram. Here, however, the sharpness (not of the palate, of the image) leave a little to be desired. Sorry to be blunt, but the overall effect is a little banal.</td>', 'As a Scot, I always enjoy a good dram. Here, however, the sharpness (not of the palate, of the image) leave a little to be desired. Sorry to be blunt, but the overall effect is a little banal.', '2003-06-04 03:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(314736, 23796, 9073, '<td valign="top">Great image! Well captured moment. How many times did you practice to get the shutter speed? I''d like to add - a brave shot. If I tried this, my wife would give me a tongue lashing.</td>', 'Great image! Well captured moment. How many times did you practice to get the shutter speed? I''d like to add - a brave shot. If I tried this, my wife would give me a tongue lashing.', '2003-06-04 03:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(314738, 23798, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice image. 10 if it were a touch sharper and brighter. I like the interplay of colours and shapes. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice image. 10 if it were a touch sharper and brighter. I like the interplay of colours and shapes. Nice composition.', '2003-06-04 03:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(314742, 23700, 9073, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful! Sharp image, nicely balanced colours, effective composition. This makes a great poster piece. Certainly the best image I''ve seen up until now, and my only 10.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful! Sharp image, nicely balanced colours, effective composition. This makes a great poster piece. Certainly the best image I''ve seen up until now, and my only 10.', '2003-06-04 03:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(314746, 23674, 9073, '<td valign="top">The title rather gives it away, doesn''t it? I can see that you''re trying to play with colours and shapes, but, in this piece, I wouldn''t bother. Sorry to be blunt.</td>', 'The title rather gives it away, doesn''t it? I can see that you''re trying to play with colours and shapes, but, in this piece, I wouldn''t bother. Sorry to be blunt.', '2003-06-04 03:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(314751, 23125, 9073, '<td valign="top">This genre of shot has been done too often and much better for this particular photo to come off well.</td>', 'This genre of shot has been done too often and much better for this particular photo to come off well.', '2003-06-04 03:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(314752, 23157, 9073, '<td valign="top">Just looking made me hungry. Thanks for the moment. Photographically, a well-done image.</td>', 'Just looking made me hungry. Thanks for the moment. Photographically, a well-done image.', '2003-06-04 03:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(314755, 23606, 9073, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a magazine advertising shot. Too many problems, though - the diagonal line not straight enough, the (what do you call that thing that sucks up the perfume?) distracting from the logo (unforgivable in a publicity shot), black refraction unsettling the diagonal line behind the bottle, ugly blimp in the left-hand side.</td>', 'Good attempt at a magazine advertising shot. Too many problems, though - the diagonal line not straight enough, the (what do you call that thing that sucks up the perfume?) distracting from the logo (unforgivable in a publicity shot), black refraction unsettling the diagonal line behind the bottle, ugly blimp in the left-hand side.', '2003-06-04 03:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(314757, 23678, 9073, '<td valign="top">I came to this photo because the thumbnail promised a lovely sense of confusion and mess. Upon seeing the full image, though, I feel that the planning is too evident, no-one would put lovely, old pens on ink blots deliberately. I was hoping to see the result of an accidental spill. The low mark I''m giving, therefore, probably reflects my own disappointment as much as anything else.</td>', 'I came to this photo because the thumbnail promised a lovely sense of confusion and mess. Upon seeing the full image, though, I feel that the planning is too evident, no-one would put lovely, old pens on ink blots deliberately. I was hoping to see the result of an accidental spill. The low mark I''m giving, therefore, probably reflects my own disappointment as much as anything else.', '2003-06-04 04:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(314759, 23317, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like this, it would make a great postcard. Pity about the tiny blimp on the bubble itself.</td>', 'I like this, it would make a great postcard. Pity about the tiny blimp on the bubble itself.', '2003-06-04 04:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(314760, 23173, 9073, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, bleedin'' funny ha ha. Did you wash that coin before making the shot? I hope so considering how many people have touched it.</td>', 'Ha ha, bleedin'' funny ha ha. Did you wash that coin before making the shot? I hope so considering how many people have touched it.', '2003-06-04 04:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(314764, 23802, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - I like the completeness of the text on the head, good camera angle chosen. Just one point, though. I''m aware that (properly draughted) Guiness is legendary for its stillness due to its thick consistency. The glass has been titled, to allow the text to reflect onto the head, but there''s no other sign of that. Just a point that niggles me.</td>', 'Nicely done - I like the completeness of the text on the head, good camera angle chosen. Just one point, though. I''m aware that (properly draughted) Guiness is legendary for its stillness due to its thick consistency. The glass has been titled, to allow the text to reflect onto the head, but there''s no other sign of that. Just a point that niggles me.', '2003-06-04 04:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(314765, 23744, 5534, '<td valign="top">Because the soap(?) in the lower half of the photo is a bit blurry, to me it takes the focus away from the liquid and more towards the bottle. Although to it''s a pretty good photo otherwise.</td>', 'Because the soap(?) in the lower half of the photo is a bit blurry, to me it takes the focus away from the liquid and more towards the bottle. Although to it''s a pretty good photo otherwise.', '2003-06-04 04:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(314766, 23826, 9073, '<td valign="top">No, and I'' glad about that. Is it you?</td>', 'No, and I'' glad about that. Is it you?', '2003-06-04 04:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(314767, 23693, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like the imagination here. It reminds me of an Ansel Adams beach shot, only done with butter. Good, crisp details. What were you cooking?</td>', 'I like the imagination here. It reminds me of an Ansel Adams beach shot, only done with butter. Good, crisp details. What were you cooking?', '2003-06-04 04:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(314768, 23497, 9073, '<td valign="top">I suppose my reaction''s opposite to what you want. I don''t see the point of this shot.</td>', 'I suppose my reaction''s opposite to what you want. I don''t see the point of this shot.', '2003-06-04 04:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(314769, 23576, 9073, '<td valign="top">Wow! Wow! I joined this site to extend my photographic technique. I''ve seen so many interesting ideas in these past few days that I''m simply invigorated. I''ve also seen interesting ideas turn into boring pictures. Not here, I love it. Well done.</td>', 'Wow! Wow! I joined this site to extend my photographic technique. I''ve seen so many interesting ideas in these past few days that I''m simply invigorated. I''ve also seen interesting ideas turn into boring pictures. Not here, I love it. Well done.', '2003-06-04 04:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(314770, 23620, 9073, '<td valign="top">For this to work, the gloop needs to be sharp. The spoon''s done nicely, though.</td>', 'For this to work, the gloop needs to be sharp. The spoon''s done nicely, though.', '2003-06-04 04:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
