(314822, 23806, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, EWW.<br/> <br/>But, er, I suppose strictly speaking it meets the challenge. And it''s a nice close-up shot aside from the ugh factor...</td>', 'Okay, EWW. But, er, I suppose strictly speaking it meets the challenge. And it''s a nice close-up shot aside from the ugh factor...', '2003-06-04 06:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(314823, 23163, 8530, '<td valign="top">I really dislike the red tone. The blur is unfortunate -- would have worked with a martini shaker but not this way IMO. And the lighting is way too bright on the glass by comparison to the rest.</td>', 'I really dislike the red tone. The blur is unfortunate -- would have worked with a martini shaker but not this way IMO. And the lighting is way too bright on the glass by comparison to the rest.', '2003-06-04 06:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(314824, 23457, 8533, '<td valign="top">Distracting background</td>', 'Distracting background', '2003-06-04 06:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(314825, 23295, 8530, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat idea, but the way the letters get blurred is not visually pleasing.</td>', 'It''s a neat idea, but the way the letters get blurred is not visually pleasing.', '2003-06-04 06:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(314827, 23828, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, if I drank beer, which I don''t, I would think of this as a very enticing commercial shot, so nice job. A bit too much bright blur on the label and that funky flame-like artifact at the top is, well, funky,  but the way the light hits the glass is great.</td>', 'Okay, if I drank beer, which I don''t, I would think of this as a very enticing commercial shot, so nice job. A bit too much bright blur on the label and that funky flame-like artifact at the top is, well, funky,  but the way the light hits the glass is great.', '2003-06-04 06:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(314828, 23160, 8533, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems to be in sharp focus</td>', 'Nothing seems to be in sharp focus', '2003-06-04 06:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(314829, 23758, 8530, '<td valign="top">I anticipate a lot of people-drinking photos. It''s on-topic. The shot is good, interesting play of shades of grey, good lighting and sharp focus.</td>', 'I anticipate a lot of people-drinking photos. It''s on-topic. The shot is good, interesting play of shades of grey, good lighting and sharp focus.', '2003-06-04 06:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(314830, 23820, 6783, '<td valign="top">Beautiful interpretation of the contest theme.</td>', 'Beautiful interpretation of the contest theme.', '2003-06-04 06:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(314831, 23282, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wellllll... it looks sort of like a planet photo, though it''s not quite perfectly round enough for it -- I''m not really sure what it is, and so I can''t tell how liquidy it really is.</td>', 'Wellllll... it looks sort of like a planet photo, though it''s not quite perfectly round enough for it -- I''m not really sure what it is, and so I can''t tell how liquidy it really is.', '2003-06-04 06:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(314832, 23802, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow. Looks like your Guiness glass has actual guiness in it too from the tone and the foam, though that''s harder to tell in B&amp;W since you can''t see the chewy brown colour. I like the tilt. Top right there''s some light reflection that''s a little distracting, and not sure what that background is but I think a more solid colour would have suited slightly better.</td>', 'Nice shadow. Looks like your Guiness glass has actual guiness in it too from the tone and the foam, though that''s harder to tell in B&W since you can''t see the chewy brown colour. I like the tilt. Top right there''s some light reflection that''s a little distracting, and not sure what that background is but I think a more solid colour would have suited slightly better.', '2003-06-04 06:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(314833, 23282, 7570, '<td valign="top">what is this actually?</td>', 'what is this actually?', '2003-06-04 06:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(314834, 23836, 8530, '<td valign="top">Erm. Is this a non-water thing? Looks vaguely bubbly, so probably. Interesting concept but it doesn''t do much for me, and that strange fuschia highlight sort of ruins the blue-toned look.</td>', 'Erm. Is this a non-water thing? Looks vaguely bubbly, so probably. Interesting concept but it doesn''t do much for me, and that strange fuschia highlight sort of ruins the blue-toned look.', '2003-06-04 06:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(314835, 23710, 7570, '<td valign="top">wow, liquid!</td>', 'wow, liquid!', '2003-06-04 06:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(314836, 23574, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Chai.<br/> <br/>Darn it! Starbucks is CLOSED this time of night! I hate you! I hate you and everyone who looks like you!<br/> <br/>*ahem* Right. Comments on the PICTURE, right. Um. My only real complaint is the very bright background and the way the logo almost fades into it. I like the focus on the condensation, and the close-up shot.</td>', 'Mmm. Chai. Darn it! Starbucks is CLOSED this time of night! I hate you! I hate you and everyone who looks like you! *ahem* Right. Comments on the PICTURE, right. Um. My only real complaint is the very bright background and the way the logo almost fades into it. I like the focus on the condensation, and the close-up shot.', '2003-06-04 06:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(314837, 23805, 7570, '<td valign="top">the cropping could be improved.</td>', 'the cropping could be improved.', '2003-06-04 06:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(314838, 23629, 7570, '<td valign="top">wicked</td>', 'wicked', '2003-06-04 06:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(314839, 23809, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting aspect ratio, kind of door-postery. The half-glass shot doesn''t thrill me although at least it''s different. Nice foamy beer, and I like the choice of background.</td>', 'Interesting aspect ratio, kind of door-postery. The half-glass shot doesn''t thrill me although at least it''s different. Nice foamy beer, and I like the choice of background.', '2003-06-04 06:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(314840, 23738, 8530, '<td valign="top">Ooo. Lava lamp. Nice subject choice.<br/> <br/>I don''t care for the angle, though. I like my lava lamps vertical. Some strange reflections in the glass -- clouds? They sure look like clouds.</td>', 'Ooo. Lava lamp. Nice subject choice. I don''t care for the angle, though. I like my lava lamps vertical. Some strange reflections in the glass -- clouds? They sure look like clouds.', '2003-06-04 06:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(314841, 23300, 8530, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s... different. Interesting; I''m sure there''ll be other paint photos but probably none anything like this. I like the colour choice as it''s reminiscent of the martini+olive and would guess that''s deliberate (or your serendipity levels are up). I think I would have preferred w/o the coaster or saucer.</td>', 'Well, that''s... different. Interesting; I''m sure there''ll be other paint photos but probably none anything like this. I like the colour choice as it''s reminiscent of the martini+olive and would guess that''s deliberate (or your serendipity levels are up). I think I would have preferred w/o the coaster or saucer.', '2003-06-04 06:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(314842, 23630, 7570, '<td valign="top">the stuff appears our of focus on the bottom of the pic.</td>', 'the stuff appears our of focus on the bottom of the pic.', '2003-06-04 06:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(314843, 23535, 8530, '<td valign="top">Is that clotted cream? Hard to tell. I like the swirl; not big on abstracts generally but that''s sorta pretty. The extra drops to the right sort of kill the ''spilled bottle'' effect if that''s what you were after; I think I would''ve placed the bottle differently, but then, judging from my running scores so far you probably don''t really want my advice on staging. :)</td>', 'Is that clotted cream? Hard to tell. I like the swirl; not big on abstracts generally but that''s sorta pretty. The extra drops to the right sort of kill the ''spilled bottle'' effect if that''s what you were after; I think I would''ve placed the bottle differently, but then, judging from my running scores so far you probably don''t really want my advice on staging. :)', '2003-06-04 06:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(314844, 23661, 8530, '<td valign="top">How could you do that to that poor ice cream! It''s STRAWBERRY. (Or, er, I suppose something else pink, but it looks strawberry.) You HEATHEN. HEATHEN, HEATHEN, HEATHEN.<br/> <br/>I probably really shouldn''t comment on pictures when I have insomnia.<br/> <br/>I like the shot and the way it''s movie-aspect framed, kind of looks like a still from an arty film or maybe a sort of ominous "look what the kidnapper left behind" moment from a thriller. Some people will probably complain that ice cream is a solid but there''s more than enough melt to justify the topic.</td>', 'How could you do that to that poor ice cream! It''s STRAWBERRY. (Or, er, I suppose something else pink, but it looks strawberry.) You HEATHEN. HEATHEN, HEATHEN, HEATHEN. I probably really shouldn''t comment on pictures when I have insomnia. I like the shot and the way it''s movie-aspect framed, kind of looks like a still from an arty film or maybe a sort of ominous "look what the kidnapper left behind" moment from a thriller. Some people will probably complain that ice cream is a solid but there''s more than enough melt to justify the topic.', '2003-06-04 06:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(314846, 23473, 7570, '<td valign="top">i like the lower part of the photo.</td>', 'i like the lower part of the photo.', '2003-06-04 06:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(314847, 23754, 8530, '<td valign="top">Darker background or different lighting would have helped the pouring... hmm, is it whiskey or scotch? Anyhow, would have helped the stream of liquid show up better and not made the top of the glass rim fade so badly into obscurity. (The label''s too unclear to be sure, but it half looks like it says Malt, which would imply scotch, hmm....) I like the capture of the swirl of the added liquid, and the fact that you used an actual old-fashioned glass. (Okay, that''s going to drive me nuts all night. I know Uisge is pronounced pretty much as ''whiskey'' but it''s also the right language to be, well, Scotch...)</td>', 'Darker background or different lighting would have helped the pouring... hmm, is it whiskey or scotch? Anyhow, would have helped the stream of liquid show up better and not made the top of the glass rim fade so badly into obscurity. (The label''s too unclear to be sure, but it half looks like it says Malt, which would imply scotch, hmm....) I like the capture of the swirl of the added liquid, and the fact that you used an actual old-fashioned glass. (Okay, that''s going to drive me nuts all night. I know Uisge is pronounced pretty much as ''whiskey'' but it''s also the right language to be, well, Scotch...)', '2003-06-04 06:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(314848, 23330, 8530, '<td valign="top">Erp. Blurry, and kinda strange lighting on your background. Setup is good, but crisper shot would''ve been nicer.</td>', 'Erp. Blurry, and kinda strange lighting on your background. Setup is good, but crisper shot would''ve been nicer.', '2003-06-04 06:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(314849, 23766, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject. I, er. Well, it meets the challenge, and it goes well with the site... doesn''t do much for me personally.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject. I, er. Well, it meets the challenge, and it goes well with the site... doesn''t do much for me personally.', '2003-06-04 06:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(314850, 23552, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... the inclusion of the top glass but the focus on the bottom one does give this sort of big blurry spot at top left that I don''t care for. I like the idea, the capture of the drips, the spreading drops through the glass.</td>', 'Hmmm.... the inclusion of the top glass but the focus on the bottom one does give this sort of big blurry spot at top left that I don''t care for. I like the idea, the capture of the drips, the spreading drops through the glass.', '2003-06-04 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(314851, 23289, 8530, '<td valign="top">That is a very interesting shot, with the whole reminsicent-of-sunset thing going on which from the title I presume was deliberate. The material the bottle is on looks like waves, nice touch.</td>', 'That is a very interesting shot, with the whole reminsicent-of-sunset thing going on which from the title I presume was deliberate. The material the bottle is on looks like waves, nice touch.', '2003-06-04 06:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(314852, 23457, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very ad-like photo, particularly given the stainless steel underneath which is very commercial-kitchen looking. Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very ad-like photo, particularly given the stainless steel underneath which is very commercial-kitchen looking. Meets the challenge.', '2003-06-04 06:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(314853, 23187, 8530, '<td valign="top">Challenge rules specified "not water".</td>', 'Challenge rules specified "not water".', '2003-06-04 06:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(314854, 23690, 8530, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t really look all that liquidy to me except for the very bottom of the top center droplet. It''s an interesting idea, though, and would make a great abstract piece.</td>', 'It doesn''t really look all that liquidy to me except for the very bottom of the top center droplet. It''s an interesting idea, though, and would make a great abstract piece.', '2003-06-04 06:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(314855, 23508, 8530, '<td valign="top">Kinda blurry, even on the plane, which detracts from the shot in general.</td>', 'Kinda blurry, even on the plane, which detracts from the shot in general.', '2003-06-04 06:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(314856, 23725, 7570, '<td valign="top">okay, i see some tree sap there.<br/>but please, dont harm the trees</td>', 'okay, i see some tree sap there.but please, dont harm the trees', '2003-06-04 06:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(314857, 23829, 8530, '<td valign="top">I presume that''s cider, then. <br/> <br/>I like the idea overall. I like the condensation being not only on the glass but on the straw, but I think I would have preferred it not be on the apple. Using the straw container as the stand for the apple is a nice touch.</td>', 'I presume that''s cider, then.  I like the idea overall. I like the condensation being not only on the glass but on the straw, but I think I would have preferred it not be on the apple. Using the straw container as the stand for the apple is a nice touch.', '2003-06-04 06:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(314859, 23735, 8530, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title.<br/> <br/>Glass falling over, okay, meets the challenge. The extreme focal blur for the background would be fine if it weren''t for that very overly red spot. Also the glass looks a little dirty to be in use...</td>', 'I don''t get the title. Glass falling over, okay, meets the challenge. The extreme focal blur for the background would be fine if it weren''t for that very overly red spot. Also the glass looks a little dirty to be in use...', '2003-06-04 06:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(314860, 23732, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very overly grainy. Interesting setup and idea and placement of elements.</td>', 'Very overly grainy. Interesting setup and idea and placement of elements.', '2003-06-04 06:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(314861, 23643, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the oil is hard to see and that detracts a bit from the topic-meeting aspect. Good shot of the gears and the thingie, I have no idea what this in specific but it''s obvious machinery so a natural setting for the oil.</td>', 'Hmm, the oil is hard to see and that detracts a bit from the topic-meeting aspect. Good shot of the gears and the thingie, I have no idea what this in specific but it''s obvious machinery so a natural setting for the oil.', '2003-06-04 06:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(314863, 23317, 8140, '<td valign="top">excellent idea &amp; shot!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! = 10</td>', 'excellent idea & shot!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! = 10', '2003-06-04 06:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
