(314909, 23822, 4591, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been awesome if the top right corner would smooth out or fade into nothing - that white vertical object distracts me, but it''s a good image for liguid.</td>', 'I think this would have been awesome if the top right corner would smooth out or fade into nothing - that white vertical object distracts me, but it''s a good image for liguid.', '2003-06-04 08:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
