(315237, 23802, 2344, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice picture, you dont really see any of the liquid. (oh ok, a small portion at the bottom) Since this is a liquids challenge the emphasis of the image should be placed on the liquid, not the label on the glass holding the liquid.</td>', 'While this is a nice picture, you dont really see any of the liquid. (oh ok, a small portion at the bottom) Since this is a liquids challenge the emphasis of the image should be placed on the liquid, not the label on the glass holding the liquid.', '2003-06-04 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(315240, 23763, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the colours in this shot but I dont like the cropping or the arrangement of the glass within the frame.  I would have photographed it either from above or from a lower point and cropped it in tighter so as not to include much background</td>', 'I like the effect of the colours in this shot but I dont like the cropping or the arrangement of the glass within the frame.  I would have photographed it either from above or from a lower point and cropped it in tighter so as not to include much background', '2003-06-04 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
