(315393, 23699, 3080, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong, but this looks like water, and the challenge called for NO water, however, you could have sprayed coolaid all over your car.<br/>About the shot itself, I think it''s ok.  Neat effect, and good angle on the car. Lighting looks good for the effect as well.  focus and clarity are good in my opinion.  <br/>~Heather~<br/>*Revision*<br/>Made to LOOK like water, a lot of people will probably just jump on that and run.  Unfortunately I think that will hurt the score.  No one expects cooking oil on a VW. lol.  Oh well.  I try to assume that the challenge has been met, and go from there.<br/>This will be an 8 from me.  I noticed some horizontal shadows(?) to the left of the VW sign that I find to be a bit distracting.  Otherwise, as I said before.  Good shot.</td>', 'I could be wrong, but this looks like water, and the challenge called for NO water, however, you could have sprayed coolaid all over your car.About the shot itself, I think it''s ok.  Neat effect, and good angle on the car. Lighting looks good for the effect as well.  focus and clarity are good in my opinion.  ~Heather~*Revision*Made to LOOK like water, a lot of people will probably just jump on that and run.  Unfortunately I think that will hurt the score.  No one expects cooking oil on a VW. lol.  Oh well.  I try to assume that the challenge has been met, and go from there.This will be an 8 from me.  I noticed some horizontal shadows(?) to the left of the VW sign that I find to be a bit distracting.  Otherwise, as I said before.  Good shot.', '2003-06-04 15:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
