(315634, 23187, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lovel shot - especially with the moon. Could have done with a little neatimage or something to get rid of the noise. The problem is the connection with the challenge. Unlucky,</td>', 'Lovel shot - especially with the moon. Could have done with a little neatimage or something to get rid of the noise. The problem is the connection with the challenge. Unlucky,', '2003-06-04 17:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(315637, 23745, 7653, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is remarkable soft lighting. The milk looks a little off-white, what liquid is this? It looks as if great care was taken in all aspects of the set up, and for that reason the odd-shaped droplet throws me off. Not to say that all the pools should have been uinformly round, the odd shape is crucial, but just that in a shot with a studio feel such as this, even the irregular or randomly shaped elements need special care to preserve harmony. Something about the way the left tail kind of narrows to a point? I can''t really finger it. I KNOW it sounds like nitpicking, Im just relaying what my eyes told me. It was the ''only'' thing that detracted. Fabulous shot. (9)</td>', 'Wow, this is remarkable soft lighting. The milk looks a little off-white, what liquid is this? It looks as if great care was taken in all aspects of the set up, and for that reason the odd-shaped droplet throws me off. Not to say that all the pools should have been uinformly round, the odd shape is crucial, but just that in a shot with a studio feel such as this, even the irregular or randomly shaped elements need special care to preserve harmony. Something about the way the left tail kind of narrows to a point? I can''t really finger it. I KNOW it sounds like nitpicking, Im just relaying what my eyes told me. It was the ''only'' thing that detracted. Fabulous shot. (9)', '2003-06-04 18:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(315638, 23662, 7758, '<td valign="top">great shot, fits the topic perfectly. Love the splashing effect! One of my faves this week. Good Luck, Todd.</td>', 'great shot, fits the topic perfectly. Love the splashing effect! One of my faves this week. Good Luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 18:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(315639, 23806, 7653, '<td valign="top">This is great! Like the square crop too. Even the eyes look a little ''misty'', which was an added bonus.</td>', 'This is great! Like the square crop too. Even the eyes look a little ''misty'', which was an added bonus.', '2003-06-04 18:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(315642, 23282, 7653, '<td valign="top">I really wish I knew what I was looking at on this photo. Normally with abstracts I dont always care, but this looks so much like a planet that I wonder too much about what it really is. How was this taken?</td>', 'I really wish I knew what I was looking at on this photo. Normally with abstracts I dont always care, but this looks so much like a planet that I wonder too much about what it really is. How was this taken?', '2003-06-04 18:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(315643, 23810, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think shots like this need something really special on the lighting to make an impact. There''s nothing exactly wrong with it - all technical elements are fine, but it lacks a certain inspiration.</td>', 'I think shots like this need something really special on the lighting to make an impact. There''s nothing exactly wrong with it - all technical elements are fine, but it lacks a certain inspiration.', '2003-06-04 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(315645, 23699, 7653, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the simplicity, the color, curves, and composition of this shot. Having it wet is just an excuse to see it in this challenge. Nice work. A favorite.</td>', 'Nice. I like the simplicity, the color, curves, and composition of this shot. Having it wet is just an excuse to see it in this challenge. Nice work. A favorite.', '2003-06-04 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
