(315657, 23748, 6999, '<td valign="top">A shame the pool of liquid couldn''t be as intensely coloured as that in the bottle - lets the shot down a bit. Good clean well lit stuff though - but a little lacking in more elements than design</td>', 'A shame the pool of liquid couldn''t be as intensely coloured as that in the bottle - lets the shot down a bit. Good clean well lit stuff though - but a little lacking in more elements than design', '2003-06-04 18:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
