(315662, 23629, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. Great colour range - you''ve kept both the greys cool and the browns warm, which is a delicate balancing act. Not wholly convinced with the composition - would perhaps have liked to see more of the balance between the two colours. Only just reads as liquid - but ''just'' in this case is enough.</td>', 'Good. Great colour range - you''ve kept both the greys cool and the browns warm, which is a delicate balancing act. Not wholly convinced with the composition - would perhaps have liked to see more of the balance between the two colours. Only just reads as liquid - but ''just'' in this case is enough.', '2003-06-04 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
