(315697, 23393, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh, liquid soap: took me a moment. couple of problems: light hitting the background seems accidental, and that edge of the cloth or whatever on the right. Light''s intriguing though - I guess a small lamp ad a window to get those two colours (it''d be less of a guess if I couldn''t see the refelction of the window.</td>', 'Oh, liquid soap: took me a moment. couple of problems: light hitting the background seems accidental, and that edge of the cloth or whatever on the right. Light''s intriguing though - I guess a small lamp ad a window to get those two colours (it''d be less of a guess if I couldn''t see the refelction of the window.', '2003-06-04 18:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
