(315713, 23385, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow, kind of cool.  I assume you''ve turned it upside down to achieve the weird effect.  Good lighting and highlights that give a real "fluid" feeling to this shot.  It would be really cool if the entire thing were in focus, but as it is, you''ve at least placed the focus in the perfect spot.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Wow, kind of cool.  I assume you''ve turned it upside down to achieve the weird effect.  Good lighting and highlights that give a real "fluid" feeling to this shot.  It would be really cool if the entire thing were in focus, but as it is, you''ve at least placed the focus in the perfect spot.  Cool shot.', '2003-06-04 19:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(315717, 23806, 7758, '<td valign="top">Good one! I swear I laughed out loud at this! Not something I do often while sitting in front of the computer on my own! Good crop too, no doubting that most of that snot is liquid! I tell you, he/she has great eyes!<br/>I like the ''in your face'' (pun intended) feel of this too.....</td>', 'Good one! I swear I laughed out loud at this! Not something I do often while sitting in front of the computer on my own! Good crop too, no doubting that most of that snot is liquid! I tell you, he/she has great eyes!I like the ''in your face'' (pun intended) feel of this too.....', '2003-06-04 19:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
