(315784, 23474, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a pic - the shadows are really nasty and the lighting is a bit direct/hard.  Try to diffuse your light or bounce the flash off something other than the metal frame.</td>', 'Great idea for a pic - the shadows are really nasty and the lighting is a bit direct/hard.  Try to diffuse your light or bounce the flash off something other than the metal frame.', '2003-06-04 19:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
