(315972, 23781, 7758, '<td valign="top">I think this shot works quite well. You might want to look at the shadows your lighting is throwing under the bottle. Personally I would have shot tighter on the brush and the end of the bottle.... the shot is meant to be about the liquid after all.... nice shot though..... Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'I think this shot works quite well. You might want to look at the shadows your lighting is throwing under the bottle. Personally I would have shot tighter on the brush and the end of the bottle.... the shot is meant to be about the liquid after all.... nice shot though..... Good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 22:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(315973, 23740, 7800, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked neat w/ a simple black border. Neat idea. Love the texture.</td>', 'I think this would have looked neat w/ a simple black border. Neat idea. Love the texture.', '2003-06-04 22:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(315976, 23766, 7758, '<td valign="top">personally, I don''t like the lettering..... I think you could have perhaps created a better design with the paint, I think this would have worked better with the surface oil(?) to create that disjointed effect...... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'personally, I don''t like the lettering..... I think you could have perhaps created a better design with the paint, I think this would have worked better with the surface oil(?) to create that disjointed effect...... good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 22:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
