(315986, 23346, 7758, '<td valign="top">not sure how you have enterpreted this as liquid..... I can''t find it..... hope I haven''t missed a vital clue...... sorry......</td>', 'not sure how you have enterpreted this as liquid..... I can''t find it..... hope I haven''t missed a vital clue...... sorry......', '2003-06-04 22:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(315989, 23757, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I almost feel the stickiness oozing onto my screen.... I like the crop and the angle.... very good. Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice shot, I almost feel the stickiness oozing onto my screen.... I like the crop and the angle.... very good. Good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 22:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(315998, 23375, 7758, '<td valign="top">sorry, this doesn''t meet the challenge in my books.... if the challenge said fluid you might have snuck in...... even with that the image is not overly strong... it appears too sort of messy and distracting with all the design in the flag and the bushes in the background and the fold in the flag.... a bit too busy for my liking.... stick with it though.... technically it''s not too bad, sharp and the colours are good, maybe just a fraction more saturation.... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'sorry, this doesn''t meet the challenge in my books.... if the challenge said fluid you might have snuck in...... even with that the image is not overly strong... it appears too sort of messy and distracting with all the design in the flag and the bushes in the background and the fold in the flag.... a bit too busy for my liking.... stick with it though.... technically it''s not too bad, sharp and the colours are good, maybe just a fraction more saturation.... good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 23:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316002, 23554, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice shot, would have maybe liked to see a little more of the red in the bottom of the glass.... I feel the composition seems a little disjointed..... the little balls of oil look really cool though. Good luck, Todd. 8</td>', 'nice shot, would have maybe liked to see a little more of the red in the bottom of the glass.... I feel the composition seems a little disjointed..... the little balls of oil look really cool though. Good luck, Todd. 8', '2003-06-04 23:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(316003, 23635, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice shot, could perhaps have been a little brighter perhaps. But it is a nice composition. I think this should do quite well this weel. I''m not marking you down on the border, but I would ditch it personally....<br/>Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'nice shot, could perhaps have been a little brighter perhaps. But it is a nice composition. I think this should do quite well this weel. I''m not marking you down on the border, but I would ditch it personally....Good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(316005, 23738, 7758, '<td valign="top">not bad..... might have thought about dusting the lamp before you took this though!<br/>Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'not bad..... might have thought about dusting the lamp before you took this though!Good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 23:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(316011, 23396, 7758, '<td valign="top">is it just my imagination, or are risking spilling some of that black gold! seems to me that it might be leaning slightly to the left...... or perhaps this was the tenth take ;)<br/>Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'is it just my imagination, or are risking spilling some of that black gold! seems to me that it might be leaning slightly to the left...... or perhaps this was the tenth take ;)Good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 23:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(316012, 23222, 9100, '<td valign="top">Easily the most unique photo out of the bunch and well done to boot.  Excellent job! 10</td>', 'Easily the most unique photo out of the bunch and well done to boot.  Excellent job! 10', '2003-06-04 23:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(316013, 23316, 7758, '<td valign="top">Good to see that a flower has been incorporated into this challenge. Technically the shot looks great but the chocolate really doesn''t look so hot sitting on the rose...... tell me, did you eat it afterwards...... perhaps you could market it as potpourri snacks, when the smell starts to fade you can eat the petals ;)<br/>Seriously, nice shot... just not overly appealing in my opinion....... Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Good to see that a flower has been incorporated into this challenge. Technically the shot looks great but the chocolate really doesn''t look so hot sitting on the rose...... tell me, did you eat it afterwards...... perhaps you could market it as potpourri snacks, when the smell starts to fade you can eat the petals ;)Seriously, nice shot... just not overly appealing in my opinion....... Good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(316017, 23715, 7758, '<td valign="top">huh! so that''s how they make it ;)<br/>nice shot. nice tight crop and well lit..... good luck, Todd.</td>', 'huh! so that''s how they make it ;)nice shot. nice tight crop and well lit..... good luck, Todd.', '2003-06-04 23:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
