(316087, 23806, 4122, '<td valign="top">hahaha... i like this one. might look nicer with more light.</td>', 'hahaha... i like this one. might look nicer with more light.', '2003-06-05 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(316097, 23813, 3419, '<td valign="top">Dish soap suds does not a liquid shot make. Neat idea, but this photo doesn''t really appeal to me. Not sure why, but maybe its the lighting. Some details seem soft.</td>', 'Dish soap suds does not a liquid shot make. Neat idea, but this photo doesn''t really appeal to me. Not sure why, but maybe its the lighting. Some details seem soft.', '2003-06-05 00:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(316099, 23221, 3419, '<td valign="top">The lipstick on the glass and the label on the bottle really draw attention away from the main subject, which is supposed to be the liquid inside the glass. Your title suggests that the glass might have been broken when it hit the floor, but maybe "you" hit the floor? Did you have fun? Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'The lipstick on the glass and the label on the bottle really draw attention away from the main subject, which is supposed to be the liquid inside the glass. Your title suggests that the glass might have been broken when it hit the floor, but maybe "you" hit the floor? Did you have fun? Nice composition and lighting.', '2003-06-05 01:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(316104, 23791, 3419, '<td valign="top">Yow! What an unpleasant concept! I don''t really care for the lighting in this photo - it''s not very attractive. But then again, the idea of pumping one''s lips full of stuff is not an attractive idea, and does not always yield attractive results.</td>', 'Yow! What an unpleasant concept! I don''t really care for the lighting in this photo - it''s not very attractive. But then again, the idea of pumping one''s lips full of stuff is not an attractive idea, and does not always yield attractive results.', '2003-06-05 01:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(316105, 23154, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the drops. I almost did not notice the reflection of the face inside them! Nice lighting, and good capture of detail in the wood grain.</td>', 'Nice capture of the drops. I almost did not notice the reflection of the face inside them! Nice lighting, and good capture of detail in the wood grain.', '2003-06-05 01:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(316107, 23685, 3419, '<td valign="top">What did you do to this lilac, one of my favorite spring flowers?   :-(</td>', 'What did you do to this lilac, one of my favorite spring flowers?   :-(', '2003-06-05 01:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(316110, 23754, 3419, '<td valign="top">Lighting is way too bright - it washes out detail on the edges of the glass. Detail could be sharper, especially on the rim of the bottle. Good composition.</td>', 'Lighting is way too bright - it washes out detail on the edges of the glass. Detail could be sharper, especially on the rim of the bottle. Good composition.', '2003-06-05 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(316112, 23317, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and nicely executed! Looks like a good candidate for the matrix challenge!</td>', 'Very creative, and nicely executed! Looks like a good candidate for the matrix challenge!', '2003-06-05 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(316113, 23779, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, composition, and capture of detail.</td>', 'Nice lighting, composition, and capture of detail.', '2003-06-05 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(316117, 23678, 3419, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, and nice composition. The colors seem just a little bland, but that does not detract too much.</td>', 'Creative idea, and nice composition. The colors seem just a little bland, but that does not detract too much.', '2003-06-05 01:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(316118, 23724, 3419, '<td valign="top">The liquid on the spoon is just a little too dark to identify.</td>', 'The liquid on the spoon is just a little too dark to identify.', '2003-06-05 01:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(316120, 23764, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking shot - abstract. Nice colors, and good capture of the bubbles.</td>', 'Very cool looking shot - abstract. Nice colors, and good capture of the bubbles.', '2003-06-05 01:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(316121, 23796, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action. I dont'' really like the use of the yellow.. just a personal opinion. I''d like to see the whole base rather than have it cut off at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice stop action. I dont'' really like the use of the yellow.. just a personal opinion. I''d like to see the whole base rather than have it cut off at the bottom.', '2003-06-05 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(316122, 23462, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition. Would prefer the label on the bottle to be more in focus as well. Would make a great stock shot for Coca Cola.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition. Would prefer the label on the bottle to be more in focus as well. Would make a great stock shot for Coca Cola.', '2003-06-05 01:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(316123, 23557, 3419, '<td valign="top">Novel idea - capture from beneath! Capturing the pool of "white out" from above may have caught more "liquid" detail. As it is now, it looks very flat.</td>', 'Novel idea - capture from beneath! Capturing the pool of "white out" from above may have caught more "liquid" detail. As it is now, it looks very flat.', '2003-06-05 01:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(316125, 23817, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot, and very creative too. I love the colors. Good capture of detail on everything. Is this yours Jacko?</td>', 'Very beautiful shot, and very creative too. I love the colors. Good capture of detail on everything. Is this yours Jacko?', '2003-06-05 01:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(316128, 23354, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good composition and capture of the splash, but would prefer crisper detail. Perhaps brighter lighting would help to bring the subject into better focus, as well as to brighten background which has a dingy grey look to it.</td>', 'Good composition and capture of the splash, but would prefer crisper detail. Perhaps brighter lighting would help to bring the subject into better focus, as well as to brighten background which has a dingy grey look to it.', '2003-06-05 01:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(316132, 23408, 9097, '<td valign="top">Would be a great photo if lighting was better and focus on liquid ( tear ) was solid enough to make it appear part of the image, and not an afterthought.</td>', 'Would be a great photo if lighting was better and focus on liquid ( tear ) was solid enough to make it appear part of the image, and not an afterthought.', '2003-06-05 01:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(316140, 23411, 7969, '<td valign="top">Yummy snack too, one of my favorites.  Sharp and clear image too, nice composition.</td>', 'Yummy snack too, one of my favorites.  Sharp and clear image too, nice composition.', '2003-06-05 02:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(316145, 23806, 7969, '<td valign="top">LOL  -- thx for the giggle, like your crop choice.</td>', 'LOL  -- thx for the giggle, like your crop choice.', '2003-06-05 02:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(316147, 23839, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, and colors.</td>', 'I like your composition, and colors.', '2003-06-05 02:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(316148, 23774, 7969, '<td valign="top">Fab composition, simple and elegant, great lighting.</td>', 'Fab composition, simple and elegant, great lighting.', '2003-06-05 02:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(316153, 23211, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the drama of this image!  The stark white goes so well against the green, and everything stands out so nicely!  This is a really intriguing image, and very creative in execution.  Is it really sap, or did you hand-place droplets of glue?  Natural or not, it''s beautiful!</td>', 'I love the drama of this image!  The stark white goes so well against the green, and everything stands out so nicely!  This is a really intriguing image, and very creative in execution.  Is it really sap, or did you hand-place droplets of glue?  Natural or not, it''s beautiful!', '2003-06-05 02:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(316154, 23796, 6565, '<td valign="top">I find the yellow a little bright (okay, a lot bright), but that''s the only negative thing I have to say.  It definitely SCREAMS out "liquid" and is interesting in a sort of "how''d they do THAT?" kind of way.  I especially like that the liquid''s spray is utilizing the space nicely, and doesn''t feel uneven.</td>', 'I find the yellow a little bright (okay, a lot bright), but that''s the only negative thing I have to say.  It definitely SCREAMS out "liquid" and is interesting in a sort of "how''d they do THAT?" kind of way.  I especially like that the liquid''s spray is utilizing the space nicely, and doesn''t feel uneven.', '2003-06-05 02:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(316155, 23817, 6565, '<td valign="top">Of the gazillion honey shots this week, I like yours the best.  It looks very sensual, almost obscene in subject composition, which gives it a "story" or personality that the standard honey shots are missing.  The background is clean and the image is crisp.  Nice work!</td>', 'Of the gazillion honey shots this week, I like yours the best.  It looks very sensual, almost obscene in subject composition, which gives it a "story" or personality that the standard honey shots are missing.  The background is clean and the image is crisp.  Nice work!', '2003-06-05 02:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(316157, 23154, 6565, '<td valign="top">I didn''t notice the faces until I came back to the picture again.  Cool!  The reason I like this photo is the sharpness of it, plus the fact that if you were trying to explain the word "liquid" to someone who had never seen it before, this picture would help them to understand it pretty quickly, I think.  Also, the diagonal dark areas in upper left and lower right add nice symmetry.  I don''t know exactly what I''m looking at, but I like it.  Nice job!</td>', 'I didn''t notice the faces until I came back to the picture again.  Cool!  The reason I like this photo is the sharpness of it, plus the fact that if you were trying to explain the word "liquid" to someone who had never seen it before, this picture would help them to understand it pretty quickly, I think.  Also, the diagonal dark areas in upper left and lower right add nice symmetry.  I don''t know exactly what I''m looking at, but I like it.  Nice job!', '2003-06-05 02:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(316160, 23774, 6565, '<td valign="top">This image is just so... pretty!  The composition, with all that white space, is very unusual.  But it WORKS because of the symmetry and formality of the subject!<br/> <br/>It doesn''t exactly scream "liquid" to me, but it definitely meets the challenge requirements and leaves an impression, in a positive way.</td>', 'This image is just so... pretty!  The composition, with all that white space, is very unusual.  But it WORKS because of the symmetry and formality of the subject! It doesn''t exactly scream "liquid" to me, but it definitely meets the challenge requirements and leaves an impression, in a positive way.', '2003-06-05 03:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(316161, 23309, 6565, '<td valign="top">The fact that the butter LOOKS liquid is what makes this count as a valid interpretation of the challenge in my opinion.  I''d have maybe tried for a stark contrast in the bowl, like a deep cobalt blue or other color, to offset the white/yellow of the popcorn.  But I like the DOF and composition of the image overall.  And it makes me want popcorn, which is a feat when I''m not hungry!</td>', 'The fact that the butter LOOKS liquid is what makes this count as a valid interpretation of the challenge in my opinion.  I''d have maybe tried for a stark contrast in the bowl, like a deep cobalt blue or other color, to offset the white/yellow of the popcorn.  But I like the DOF and composition of the image overall.  And it makes me want popcorn, which is a feat when I''m not hungry!', '2003-06-05 03:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(316162, 23690, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract -- the colors are really rich and the cropping is done well.  The minuses for me are that it''s hard to say that this describes or explains liquid to me (even though it IS liquid, you''d have to tell someone for them to know it), and that the reflection-in-a-bubble-over-blurry-background thing has really been played in the last few challenges, making it feel a touch cliche to me through no fault of your own.  Overall, it''s a very nice photo and I''ve scored you pretty high. :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract -- the colors are really rich and the cropping is done well.  The minuses for me are that it''s hard to say that this describes or explains liquid to me (even though it IS liquid, you''d have to tell someone for them to know it), and that the reflection-in-a-bubble-over-blurry-background thing has really been played in the last few challenges, making it feel a touch cliche to me through no fault of your own.  Overall, it''s a very nice photo and I''ve scored you pretty high. :)', '2003-06-05 03:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(316163, 23396, 6565, '<td valign="top">Overall, the image itself is a little bland, with it being neutral upon neutral and not 100% crisp.  I''d like a background/base that contrast more with the subject tonally.  However, the "story" of the cloud moving through the beer makes this feel like an object in motion, and the thing you notice about the image is the liquid in the glass.  Overall, I definitely like this photo and I think it meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Overall, the image itself is a little bland, with it being neutral upon neutral and not 100% crisp.  I''d like a background/base that contrast more with the subject tonally.  However, the "story" of the cloud moving through the beer makes this feel like an object in motion, and the thing you notice about the image is the liquid in the glass.  Overall, I definitely like this photo and I think it meets the challenge well.', '2003-06-05 03:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316165, 23560, 6565, '<td valign="top">There''s something so playful about this image!  I love the perspective, and how it almost makes the iced cap feel like it''s being humanized.  It''s probably accidental, but I also like how the clouds sort of feel as though they''ve floated right out of the straw and into the sky.  A fun representation of liquid as beach-dweller, and a very nice shot from a technical standpoint! :)</td>', 'There''s something so playful about this image!  I love the perspective, and how it almost makes the iced cap feel like it''s being humanized.  It''s probably accidental, but I also like how the clouds sort of feel as though they''ve floated right out of the straw and into the sky.  A fun representation of liquid as beach-dweller, and a very nice shot from a technical standpoint! :)', '2003-06-05 03:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(316166, 23694, 8530, '<td valign="top">Not a drink I would mix, I must admit.<br/> <br/>I like this concept, and the composition with the reflection. I think there''s a bit too much glare off the front of the glass, particularly on the stem. The focal point is interestingly centered but I think it fades into foreground blur a little too quickly; the base of the glass is much blurrier than I would have expected given an eye''s view of this, for instance.</td>', 'Not a drink I would mix, I must admit. I like this concept, and the composition with the reflection. I think there''s a bit too much glare off the front of the glass, particularly on the stem. The focal point is interestingly centered but I think it fades into foreground blur a little too quickly; the base of the glass is much blurrier than I would have expected given an eye''s view of this, for instance.', '2003-06-05 03:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(316167, 23666, 6565, '<td valign="top">Knew there''d the the requisite droplet in here somewhere (not that I know how to shoot one myself).  I think what really makes this photo unique is the use of color.  What a dramatic shade!  In the land of allowable spot edits, the specks in the black band should probably go, but overall everything, even the reflection, is so precise and beautiful!  Nice work!</td>', 'Knew there''d the the requisite droplet in here somewhere (not that I know how to shoot one myself).  I think what really makes this photo unique is the use of color.  What a dramatic shade!  In the land of allowable spot edits, the specks in the black band should probably go, but overall everything, even the reflection, is so precise and beautiful!  Nice work!', '2003-06-05 03:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(316168, 23666, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, well, my only real problem with this is it''s been done so often that it''s lost some of its interest to me. I like the choice of purple for your contrast. There''s a kinda neat planetary thing going on here that may or may not be intentional, but does help a bit to counteract that "seen it" reaction.</td>', 'Hmm, well, my only real problem with this is it''s been done so often that it''s lost some of its interest to me. I like the choice of purple for your contrast. There''s a kinda neat planetary thing going on here that may or may not be intentional, but does help a bit to counteract that "seen it" reaction.', '2003-06-05 03:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(316169, 23720, 8530, '<td valign="top">Tea, not coffee? Or just a fairly light brew of cofee?<br/> <br/>I think w/o the bubbles would have been more interesting as more of the swirl could have been seen then. I like the framing of the shot, and the border is thankfully very inobtrusive.</td>', 'Tea, not coffee? Or just a fairly light brew of cofee? I think w/o the bubbles would have been more interesting as more of the swirl could have been seen then. I like the framing of the shot, and the border is thankfully very inobtrusive.', '2003-06-05 03:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(316170, 23756, 6565, '<td valign="top">This image would be interesting if it weren''t so very out of focus!  I don''t know if that was deliberate, but it doesn''t work for me personally.  I think of coffee and I think of crisp, alert, snapping to attention.  This is a little too dreamy for my taste.</td>', 'This image would be interesting if it weren''t so very out of focus!  I don''t know if that was deliberate, but it doesn''t work for me personally.  I think of coffee and I think of crisp, alert, snapping to attention.  This is a little too dreamy for my taste.', '2003-06-05 03:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(316171, 23396, 8530, '<td valign="top">A different coloured backdrop would have highlighted the glass and contents more but I think I kind of like the close match between it and the foam; you''ve got a nice shades-of-yellow/brown going on here, although the table (pine, I''d guess) is a little bright in that case. Not as dramatic as the other Guinness shot I''ve seen so far but I like the slowly rising foam effect.</td>', 'A different coloured backdrop would have highlighted the glass and contents more but I think I kind of like the close match between it and the foam; you''ve got a nice shades-of-yellow/brown going on here, although the table (pine, I''d guess) is a little bright in that case. Not as dramatic as the other Guinness shot I''ve seen so far but I like the slowly rising foam effect.', '2003-06-05 03:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(316172, 23760, 6565, '<td valign="top">The blue is very rich and clean, but I don''t see the "liquid" connection.  The motion of the string appears to be rather fluid, but to me that''s just not the same thing as liquid.  Sorry...</td>', 'The blue is very rich and clean, but I don''t see the "liquid" connection.  The motion of the string appears to be rather fluid, but to me that''s just not the same thing as liquid.  Sorry...', '2003-06-05 03:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(316173, 23784, 8530, '<td valign="top">Shots of the refraction of oil on water... if so that''s a little iffy on the challenge topic but I suppose something+water is not the same as just water.<br/> <br/>I don''t at all care for that bright green colour, something else would have been preferable. Too bad you couldn''t get the iridiscent effect. The bright spots (light reflections, I assume) are a little distracting.</td>', 'Shots of the refraction of oil on water... if so that''s a little iffy on the challenge topic but I suppose something+water is not the same as just water. I don''t at all care for that bright green colour, something else would have been preferable. Too bad you couldn''t get the iridiscent effect. The bright spots (light reflections, I assume) are a little distracting.', '2003-06-05 03:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(316174, 23640, 8530, '<td valign="top">If I make it through even half the photos in this challenge I''m probably going to be really sick of the person-drinking theme. Luckily for you I''m not YET but it''s not the world''s most original interpretation as I''m sure you''re aware.<br/> <br/>Inasmuch as the shot goes... I like the focus, the shot is very crisp on the bottle and the face. Side view is reasonable; a slight angle might have been a little nicer. The kid looks to not be drinking but rather just holding the bottle for the shot -- some of that is how flat the soda looks, some is just placement of both hands and lips. I don''t know if that''s the case or just the impression.</td>', 'If I make it through even half the photos in this challenge I''m probably going to be really sick of the person-drinking theme. Luckily for you I''m not YET but it''s not the world''s most original interpretation as I''m sure you''re aware. Inasmuch as the shot goes... I like the focus, the shot is very crisp on the bottle and the face. Side view is reasonable; a slight angle might have been a little nicer. The kid looks to not be drinking but rather just holding the bottle for the shot -- some of that is how flat the soda looks, some is just placement of both hands and lips. I don''t know if that''s the case or just the impression.', '2003-06-05 03:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(316177, 23834, 8530, '<td valign="top">....<br/>....it, I suppose, qualifies as meeting the challenge, though not by much, and also I''m dubious that it''s really what it depicts and that the B&amp;W wasn''t just to cover that up.<br/>...<br/>You know, it really takes a lot to qualify as tasteless on my personal metric of that standard, but I do think you''ve managed.</td>', '........it, I suppose, qualifies as meeting the challenge, though not by much, and also I''m dubious that it''s really what it depicts and that the B&W wasn''t just to cover that up....You know, it really takes a lot to qualify as tasteless on my personal metric of that standard, but I do think you''ve managed.', '2003-06-05 03:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(316179, 23708, 8530, '<td valign="top">So much of this involves ice that I feel it doesn''t do a good job of capturing either the ''liquid'' or the ''non-water'' parts. The liquid in the glass does appear to be something other than water, though it''s hard to tell.<br/> <br/>Now, if this were just a glass of wine, shot at that same level of lighting, angle, same backdrop, etc., I would probably have thought it was quite pretty and on topic, but the ice also sort of mars the ''pretty'' part.<br/> <br/>Looks like you have a minor ''hot pixel'' or lighting artifact problem just over from the glass base., by the way.</td>', 'So much of this involves ice that I feel it doesn''t do a good job of capturing either the ''liquid'' or the ''non-water'' parts. The liquid in the glass does appear to be something other than water, though it''s hard to tell. Now, if this were just a glass of wine, shot at that same level of lighting, angle, same backdrop, etc., I would probably have thought it was quite pretty and on topic, but the ice also sort of mars the ''pretty'' part. Looks like you have a minor ''hot pixel'' or lighting artifact problem just over from the glass base., by the way.', '2003-06-05 03:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(316181, 23560, 4767, '<td valign="top">Oh.  Canada.  Tim Horton rules.</td>', 'Oh.  Canada.  Tim Horton rules.', '2003-06-05 03:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(316182, 23810, 8530, '<td valign="top">I had to check and see if that dust was on my monitor or on your (table|counter), and I suspect that qualifies it as officially distracting.<br/> <br/>Interesting choice for the topic, haven''t seen one like it yet. Good staging aside from the dust; the reflection is interesting. W/o a reflection might have been nice too.</td>', 'I had to check and see if that dust was on my monitor or on your (table|counter), and I suspect that qualifies it as officially distracting. Interesting choice for the topic, haven''t seen one like it yet. Good staging aside from the dust; the reflection is interesting. W/o a reflection might have been nice too.', '2003-06-05 03:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(316183, 23292, 8530, '<td valign="top">WAY. Too. Bright. A. Glare. VERY distracting.<br/> <br/>Interesting thought on topic. Execution not so great.</td>', 'WAY. Too. Bright. A. Glare. VERY distracting. Interesting thought on topic. Execution not so great.', '2003-06-05 03:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(316185, 23408, 8530, '<td valign="top">...oh, I hate to say this, I really do, because this is a beautiful shot, but... <br/> <br/>I really think of tears as ''water''.<br/> <br/>As there''s an argument for that not being the case it won''t detract a lot from my vote, but it does affect it to some extent.<br/> <br/>Let''s see. Other minor flaws: a little shift of focus or angle might have helped make the title less necessary to me to see what you''re doing; I think I would have missed it at first otherwise simply BECAUSE the close-up on the eye is so nicely done. And the lighting is just a bit too bright on the left part of the skin, I wish you could have adjusted that slightly.<br/> <br/>Also, kudos on entering a B&amp;W photo I think really really ought to have been; normally I''m either ambivalent or outright prefer colour.</td>', '...oh, I hate to say this, I really do, because this is a beautiful shot, but...  I really think of tears as ''water''. As there''s an argument for that not being the case it won''t detract a lot from my vote, but it does affect it to some extent. Let''s see. Other minor flaws: a little shift of focus or angle might have helped make the title less necessary to me to see what you''re doing; I think I would have missed it at first otherwise simply BECAUSE the close-up on the eye is so nicely done. And the lighting is just a bit too bright on the left part of the skin, I wish you could have adjusted that slightly. Also, kudos on entering a B&W photo I think really really ought to have been; normally I''m either ambivalent or outright prefer colour.', '2003-06-05 03:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(316186, 23309, 4767, '<td valign="top">LOVE the idea!</td>', 'LOVE the idea!', '2003-06-05 03:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(316187, 23804, 8530, '<td valign="top">You almost triggered my "hey, NOT water" reaction but then I saw the bubbles. (Yeah, I looked at it from bottom upwards for some reason, probably because the more intense colour is there.)<br/> <br/>Is this a pun? A literal shot of Dawn detergent meant to mimic the sun over water effect? Okay, if so, I like it. If I''m reading into the title, then, er, well, now you know.</td>', 'You almost triggered my "hey, NOT water" reaction but then I saw the bubbles. (Yeah, I looked at it from bottom upwards for some reason, probably because the more intense colour is there.) Is this a pun? A literal shot of Dawn detergent meant to mimic the sun over water effect? Okay, if so, I like it. If I''m reading into the title, then, er, well, now you know.', '2003-06-05 03:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(316188, 23756, 4767, '<td valign="top">Great concept - seems somewhat out of focus tho...</td>', 'Great concept - seems somewhat out of focus tho...', '2003-06-05 03:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(316189, 23702, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmmm. That looks yummy even if I''m not entirely certain what is being poured -- syrupy something, but it looks too thin to be actual caramel sauce.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately I think the tone is a little too dark -- I can''t tell if it''s just too-focussed lighting (the way the glass edges dim out sort of suggests this) or if the background contributes. There''s a decided colour difference between the pouring liquid and the bulk of the bottle, which is what makes me fairly certain that''s a lighting issue.<br/> <br/>But the composition is good, framed well, and it meets the topic.</td>', 'Mmmm. That looks yummy even if I''m not entirely certain what is being poured -- syrupy something, but it looks too thin to be actual caramel sauce. Unfortunately I think the tone is a little too dark -- I can''t tell if it''s just too-focussed lighting (the way the glass edges dim out sort of suggests this) or if the background contributes. There''s a decided colour difference between the pouring liquid and the bulk of the bottle, which is what makes me fairly certain that''s a lighting issue. But the composition is good, framed well, and it meets the topic.', '2003-06-05 03:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(316190, 23180, 4767, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo!  Focus is perfect, exposure is spot on, challenge met magnificently, imho.  I love the archway that frames the vintner - an extraordinary photo!  10</td>', 'Gorgeous photo!  Focus is perfect, exposure is spot on, challenge met magnificently, imho.  I love the archway that frames the vintner - an extraordinary photo!  10', '2003-06-05 03:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(316191, 23830, 8530, '<td valign="top">That''s a clever thought, definitely. Although not bad as is by any means, I think the imperfections present in the tips of corn cobs, while unavoidable, are distracting, and wonder if you could have gotten a better effect by tilting the cob differently and taking the shot so the syrup ran over the ''sides'' of the cob so you could highlight the more perfect kernels. That is really a nitpick, which is a good sign from me, really. :)</td>', 'That''s a clever thought, definitely. Although not bad as is by any means, I think the imperfections present in the tips of corn cobs, while unavoidable, are distracting, and wonder if you could have gotten a better effect by tilting the cob differently and taking the shot so the syrup ran over the ''sides'' of the cob so you could highlight the more perfect kernels. That is really a nitpick, which is a good sign from me, really. :)', '2003-06-05 03:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(316192, 23713, 7510, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the monkey thing here.  Maybe a little too much white.  Not very interesting. 4</td>', 'I don''t understand the monkey thing here.  Maybe a little too much white.  Not very interesting. 4', '2003-06-05 03:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(316193, 23779, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I think too bright of lighting for your subject. I know that just the candlelight might not have sufficed to capture the melting, but I think you could have toned it down somewhat -- I''m kind of surprised the flame is still so visible, in fact, so I''m wondering a bit how you did up the lighting.</td>', 'Hmm... I think too bright of lighting for your subject. I know that just the candlelight might not have sufficed to capture the melting, but I think you could have toned it down somewhat -- I''m kind of surprised the flame is still so visible, in fact, so I''m wondering a bit how you did up the lighting.', '2003-06-05 03:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316194, 23834, 4767, '<td valign="top">This can''t be rated 1 - 10.  It should be alphabetical.  I give it a ''P''.</td>', 'This can''t be rated 1 - 10.  It should be alphabetical.  I give it a ''P''.', '2003-06-05 03:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(316195, 23822, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it doesn''t hold my attention.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it doesn''t hold my attention.', '2003-06-05 03:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(316196, 23783, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with the idea, but it doesn''t really look very natural. If I''m not completely mistaken, this is shot inside a sink right? I mean, that is a drain in the center? That''s okay in itself but I would have liked the cup not obscuring it. Also, either you make fairly weak coffee or the whole photo is slightly washed out.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with the idea, but it doesn''t really look very natural. If I''m not completely mistaken, this is shot inside a sink right? I mean, that is a drain in the center? That''s okay in itself but I would have liked the cup not obscuring it. Also, either you make fairly weak coffee or the whole photo is slightly washed out.', '2003-06-05 03:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(316197, 23661, 4767, '<td valign="top">Love the photo in every way except the black bars top and bottom.  Should have been an 8.</td>', 'Love the photo in every way except the black bars top and bottom.  Should have been an 8.', '2003-06-05 03:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(316198, 23317, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2003-06-05 03:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(316199, 23779, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  My first thought was that the background is the sky.  But then how do you shot down onto a candle and still have sky in the background?  If I was to nit-pick, the edge of the candle holder is king of messy.</td>', 'Interesting.  My first thought was that the background is the sky.  But then how do you shot down onto a candle and still have sky in the background?  If I was to nit-pick, the edge of the candle holder is king of messy.', '2003-06-05 03:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(316200, 23650, 4767, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Too bad the straw disappeared - it should have been a 9.</td>', 'Great shot!  Too bad the straw disappeared - it should have been a 9.', '2003-06-05 03:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
