(316204, 23699, 7510, '<td valign="top">I think this one is going to score generally low, because it looks like rain water.  Aside from that, I don''t find this one a very interesting shot of ''liquid''.  I not fond of the shadow border either.  3</td>', 'I think this one is going to score generally low, because it looks like rain water.  Aside from that, I don''t find this one a very interesting shot of ''liquid''.  I not fond of the shadow border either.  3', '2003-06-05 03:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(316205, 23805, 4767, '<td valign="top">Makes me hungry...</td>', 'Makes me hungry...', '2003-06-05 03:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(316206, 23788, 7510, '<td valign="top">This place looks familar, but I have been to so many places...  I like I would have liked to have seen a wider shot, but you must have had your reasons.  To boarder is a tad too thick too, but over all a nice shot.</td>', 'This place looks familar, but I have been to so many places...  I like I would have liked to have seen a wider shot, but you must have had your reasons.  To boarder is a tad too thick too, but over all a nice shot.', '2003-06-05 03:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
