(316208, 23093, 8056, '<td valign="top">yes, this pic had make me paused from moving to next pic. very nice constrast, even in b&amp;w mode. give me very clean and sharp feel. u have a sharp eyes and good observation. a big 8 for u ^ ^</td>', 'yes, this pic had make me paused from moving to next pic. very nice constrast, even in b&w mode. give me very clean and sharp feel. u have a sharp eyes and good observation. a big 8 for u ^ ^', '2003-06-05 03:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
