(316214, 23827, 8056, '<td valign="top">I would rather take off the applica juice bottle, and let the glass be the stand alone object, more focus on the glass, coz the tcace of the glass was so unique. this pic lead me losing focus on liquid...too bad</td>', 'I would rather take off the applica juice bottle, and let the glass be the stand alone object, more focus on the glass, coz the tcace of the glass was so unique. this pic lead me losing focus on liquid...too bad', '2003-06-05 04:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
