(316218, 23786, 4767, '<td valign="top">"Film?  Film is what you get on your teeth when you don''t brush them." - Vincent Versace   <br/> <br/>HOWEVER, imho,  a better title might be "Rodinol" or "D-76", since this is a photographic site.</td>', '"Film?  Film is what you get on your teeth when you don''t brush them." - Vincent Versace    HOWEVER, imho,  a better title might be "Rodinol" or "D-76", since this is a photographic site.', '2003-06-05 04:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
