(316228, 23721, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The grainyness takes away from an interesting photo.  And too bad there is that sun spot in the top right too.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The grainyness takes away from an interesting photo.  And too bad there is that sun spot in the top right too.', '2003-06-05 04:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(316231, 23688, 7510, '<td valign="top">You work at a Coffee shop?  Nice composition.  I think a higher shutter speed would have ''frozen'' the liquid better, but you might not have had enough light.</td>', 'You work at a Coffee shop?  Nice composition.  I think a higher shutter speed would have ''frozen'' the liquid better, but you might not have had enough light.', '2003-06-05 04:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(316232, 23784, 7510, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little soft.</td>', 'The focus is a little soft.', '2003-06-05 04:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(316233, 23198, 7510, '<td valign="top">Looks a little dangerous.  That glass might crack from the heat.  But any ways Interesting idea.  A little too bright in the center of the flame, but I imaging it is a hard shot to get perfect.</td>', 'Looks a little dangerous.  That glass might crack from the heat.  But any ways Interesting idea.  A little too bright in the center of the flame, but I imaging it is a hard shot to get perfect.', '2003-06-05 04:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(316235, 23375, 7510, '<td valign="top">This is more fluid than liquid.  There is a difference, and I think your overall score will probably be lower because people don''t make the connection.  Aside from that, this isn''t really an exciting banner/flag to look at.  I think it is cropped a little too tight. 3</td>', 'This is more fluid than liquid.  There is a difference, and I think your overall score will probably be lower because people don''t make the connection.  Aside from that, this isn''t really an exciting banner/flag to look at.  I think it is cropped a little too tight. 3', '2003-06-05 04:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(316236, 23497, 7885, '<td valign="top">Easy on the eyes!</td>', 'Easy on the eyes!', '2003-06-05 04:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
