(316238, 23829, 7510, '<td valign="top">Weird.  If I were to nit-pick..  I like the lighting on the apple, but not the light on the straws below.  I know it is hard to get the lighting just right, though.  Maybe a little more light on the drink.  If it is suppose to look like apple juice, it looks too dark.  I not particularly fond of the boarder.</td>', 'Weird.  If I were to nit-pick..  I like the lighting on the apple, but not the light on the straws below.  I know it is hard to get the lighting just right, though.  Maybe a little more light on the drink.  If it is suppose to look like apple juice, it looks too dark.  I not particularly fond of the boarder.', '2003-06-05 04:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(316239, 23650, 7885, '<td valign="top">Great angle and lighting. Probably the most interesting-looking of the cold beverage in glass pics.</td>', 'Great angle and lighting. Probably the most interesting-looking of the cold beverage in glass pics.', '2003-06-05 04:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
