(316557, 23383, 7339, '<td valign="top">I would have giving this a 6 or 7 if you had taken it from the other side. Not that I really want to see her puke. Also I think a tighter crop of the overall image might have helped, like from the left pole to the center of the crosswalk, because there is too much distracting action going on.</td>', 'I would have giving this a 6 or 7 if you had taken it from the other side. Not that I really want to see her puke. Also I think a tighter crop of the overall image might have helped, like from the left pole to the center of the crosswalk, because there is too much distracting action going on.', '2003-06-05 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(316558, 23690, 2350, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  Good job.</td>', 'Very colorful.  Good job.', '2003-06-05 12:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(316560, 23724, 8522, '<td valign="top">You seem to have gone to a lot of trouble in getting this shot, so it''s a shame that you didn''t capture it better! Nice idea, but there is too much going on in the rest of the picture in the way of textures that takes away from the subject. I think you could have benefited from more lighting on the spoon. 4</td>', 'You seem to have gone to a lot of trouble in getting this shot, so it''s a shame that you didn''t capture it better! Nice idea, but there is too much going on in the rest of the picture in the way of textures that takes away from the subject. I think you could have benefited from more lighting on the spoon. 4', '2003-06-05 12:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(316562, 23346, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great photo, nicely rotated and cropped. Where''s the liquid? (Don''t say in the title). 5</td>', 'Great photo, nicely rotated and cropped. Where''s the liquid? (Don''t say in the title). 5', '2003-06-05 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(316564, 23830, 2350, '<td valign="top">You captured it all.  Another 10 for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'You captured it all.  Another 10 for me.  Good luck.', '2003-06-05 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(316565, 23715, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice color green from the backlighting but I find the frame to be crowding the glass and would have liked some kind of contrasting color to the background, which I think would have added more interest.  I find the glass too plain and would have preferred a more interesting olive oil bottle(s) instead.</td>', 'Nice color green from the backlighting but I find the frame to be crowding the glass and would have liked some kind of contrasting color to the background, which I think would have added more interest.  I find the glass too plain and would have preferred a more interesting olive oil bottle(s) instead.', '2003-06-05 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(316576, 23624, 5822, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what liquid is this color, but I would have liked to have seen a wider angled shot so that you could have gotten into the picture what appears to be the multi-colord glass containing the liquid. Also, the specular highlights in the liquid are distracting.</td>', 'Don''t know what liquid is this color, but I would have liked to have seen a wider angled shot so that you could have gotten into the picture what appears to be the multi-colord glass containing the liquid. Also, the specular highlights in the liquid are distracting.', '2003-06-05 12:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
