(317164, 23711, 9136, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on this and it''s very original. Everything about it deserves the 10 I gave it.</td>', 'I love the colors on this and it''s very original. Everything about it deserves the 10 I gave it.', '2003-06-05 18:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
