(317168, 23693, 9136, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, I gave it a 9. I think I would of liked it better if the butter was centered, but still a good shot.</td>', 'I like this picture, I gave it a 9. I think I would of liked it better if the butter was centered, but still a good shot.', '2003-06-05 18:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
