(317172, 23640, 9136, '<td valign="top">The kid is cute and the two main objects stand out. Reminds me of an old Coca Cola commercial... 10.</td>', 'The kid is cute and the two main objects stand out. Reminds me of an old Coca Cola commercial... 10.', '2003-06-05 18:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(317173, 23817, 9136, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I love the honey drops all over the flower. 10. Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea, I love the honey drops all over the flower. 10. Good luck.', '2003-06-05 18:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(317174, 23752, 9136, '<td valign="top">I like it. 9.</td>', 'I like it. 9.', '2003-06-05 18:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(317177, 23606, 9136, '<td valign="top">Good photo. 9.</td>', 'Good photo. 9.', '2003-06-05 18:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(317178, 23826, 3697, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a creative take on the assignment! Great focus, nice lighting, and the use of selective color works well here. In my opinion, one of the week''s best.</td>', 'Wow, what a creative take on the assignment! Great focus, nice lighting, and the use of selective color works well here. In my opinion, one of the week''s best.', '2003-06-05 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(317180, 23317, 3697, '<td valign="top">I LIKE IT! Your use of DOF is perfect, and the idea is very unique. Nicely done. :)</td>', 'I LIKE IT! Your use of DOF is perfect, and the idea is very unique. Nicely done. :)', '2003-06-05 18:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(317181, 23745, 9136, '<td valign="top">Great photo... 8.</td>', 'Great photo... 8.', '2003-06-05 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(317183, 23711, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo. Your use of a syringe and also making the photo look like an "x-ray" were both great ideas to go along with the medicine.</td>', 'Very interesting photo. Your use of a syringe and also making the photo look like an "x-ray" were both great ideas to go along with the medicine.', '2003-06-05 18:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317186, 23710, 3697, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but where is the liquid?</td>', 'Interesting shot, but where is the liquid?', '2003-06-05 19:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(317187, 23744, 3697, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but maybe having the background further from your subject might look even better. It would keep the "joint" where the background and bottom surface meet one another from showing.</td>', 'Good concept, but maybe having the background further from your subject might look even better. It would keep the "joint" where the background and bottom surface meet one another from showing.', '2003-06-05 19:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(317190, 23779, 3697, '<td valign="top">Definately one of the best candle shots I''ve seen! Nicely done.</td>', 'Definately one of the best candle shots I''ve seen! Nicely done.', '2003-06-05 19:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(317218, 23666, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of tired of the macro/stop action/splash images, but I have to give you a 10 anyway.  This is a great shot and I especially like the milk and purple liquid.  I would clone out the tiny splash droplets as they are distracting (I realize it was against the rules for spot editing, though).<br/>Great example of this technique...<br/>10<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'I''m kind of tired of the macro/stop action/splash images, but I have to give you a 10 anyway.  This is a great shot and I especially like the milk and purple liquid.  I would clone out the tiny splash droplets as they are distracting (I realize it was against the rules for spot editing, though).Great example of this technique...10JD Anderson', '2003-06-05 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(317223, 23834, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is not one of my favorites for the week based upon visual appeal and technical specs.  But... I give it a 10 anyway.  It is very creative, well executed, and I have three little boys myself --- been there, done that, but without the pictures!!  LOL</td>', 'This is not one of my favorites for the week based upon visual appeal and technical specs.  But... I give it a 10 anyway.  It is very creative, well executed, and I have three little boys myself --- been there, done that, but without the pictures!!  LOL', '2003-06-05 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(317284, 23806, 8864, '<td valign="top">That was my idea!</td>', 'That was my idea!', '2003-06-05 20:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(317293, 23125, 8056, '<td valign="top">Able to catch the movement of the red drop from high to the greenish liquid was a very excellent. Just the background to me, seem too grey, not bright enuff, thus the whole pic look very grainy, also the blank area on the top was too much</td>', 'Able to catch the movement of the red drop from high to the greenish liquid was a very excellent. Just the background to me, seem too grey, not bright enuff, thus the whole pic look very grainy, also the blank area on the top was too much', '2003-06-05 21:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317294, 23754, 8056, '<td valign="top">the background was too bright, it does distract me from seeing the object captured inside the pic.</td>', 'the background was too bright, it does distract me from seeing the object captured inside the pic.', '2003-06-05 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317295, 23300, 8056, '<td valign="top">background.....dark. pic look dull.</td>', 'background.....dark. pic look dull.', '2003-06-05 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(317297, 23788, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- looks like Iceland!  I love the S-curve at the top, and the clarity of everything from the foreground on back... just wonderful!  An all-around interesting shot. - 10</td>', 'Wow -- looks like Iceland!  I love the S-curve at the top, and the clarity of everything from the foreground on back... just wonderful!  An all-around interesting shot. - 10', '2003-06-05 21:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317313, 23522, 2158, '<td valign="top">I find the yellow of the table a bit distracting.  A slight change of angle would have solved this.</td>', 'I find the yellow of the table a bit distracting.  A slight change of angle would have solved this.', '2003-06-05 22:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(317316, 23837, 8597, '<td valign="top">Really great composition.  How many attempts did it take to get this one?  I like the lighting too.</td>', 'Really great composition.  How many attempts did it take to get this one?  I like the lighting too.', '2003-06-05 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(317335, 23833, 2158, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but the liquid doesn''t really show even though it''s obvious that it''s there.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but the liquid doesn''t really show even though it''s obvious that it''s there.', '2003-06-05 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(317337, 23200, 2158, '<td valign="top">Wow, you''ve really made me hungry.</td>', 'Wow, you''ve really made me hungry.', '2003-06-05 22:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(317340, 23297, 6325, '<td valign="top">You have to squeeze those nectarines and cheeries really hard to get a glass of juice - your forearms must be huge! I like the composition with the fruits and juice - the jucier thingies don''t add anything for me. The colors are very good. A simplier surface would have enhanced the subjects.</td>', 'You have to squeeze those nectarines and cheeries really hard to get a glass of juice - your forearms must be huge! I like the composition with the fruits and juice - the jucier thingies don''t add anything for me. The colors are very good. A simplier surface would have enhanced the subjects.', '2003-06-05 23:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317346, 23827, 6325, '<td valign="top">The liquid in the glass is nice. The color balance seems off - a bit warm from the lighting.</td>', 'The liquid in the glass is nice. The color balance seems off - a bit warm from the lighting.', '2003-06-05 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(317347, 23839, 2158, '<td valign="top">Pity the stem of the glass doesn''t show.</td>', 'Pity the stem of the glass doesn''t show.', '2003-06-05 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317349, 23606, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like th elighting and the way it is picked up in the stopper.</td>', 'I like th elighting and the way it is picked up in the stopper.', '2003-06-05 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(317358, 23700, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the glassware and the colors. I think you added one or two too many objects. A seven, but could have bben higher.</td>', 'I like the glassware and the colors. I think you added one or two too many objects. A seven, but could have bben higher.', '2003-06-05 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(317359, 23805, 6325, '<td valign="top">Now I''m hungry. The ice cream and carmel are exposed and focused well. The table surfaace and left edge of the bowl don''t add much - a tighter crop would have been helpful.</td>', 'Now I''m hungry. The ice cream and carmel are exposed and focused well. The table surfaace and left edge of the bowl don''t add much - a tighter crop would have been helpful.', '2003-06-05 23:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(317363, 23721, 6325, '<td valign="top">This had a lot of potential. The clouds as background obscure the bubbles (which could have been in better focus).</td>', 'This had a lot of potential. The clouds as background obscure the bubbles (which could have been in better focus).', '2003-06-05 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(317397, 23510, 7885, '<td valign="top">This shot captures the essence of the honey experience well, as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'This shot captures the essence of the honey experience well, as far as I''m concerned.', '2003-06-06 01:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(317400, 23700, 7556, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, colors, visual appeal &amp; composition...<br/>JB</td>', 'Nice focus, colors, visual appeal & composition...JB', '2003-06-06 01:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(317403, 23200, 7556, '<td valign="top">mmmmm.....pancakes.....I''m gettin'' hungry....</td>', 'mmmmm.....pancakes.....I''m gettin'' hungry....', '2003-06-06 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(317404, 23180, 7556, '<td valign="top">nice photo...</td>', 'nice photo...', '2003-06-06 01:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(317406, 23829, 7556, '<td valign="top">cute...</td>', 'cute...', '2003-06-06 01:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(317413, 23770, 7885, '<td valign="top">This would be an excellent topic for a challenge (cheese), since a lot of shots on this site are halfway there already. Good use of curtains in supporting role. The strong lighting brings it all home!</td>', 'This would be an excellent topic for a challenge (cheese), since a lot of shots on this site are halfway there already. Good use of curtains in supporting role. The strong lighting brings it all home!', '2003-06-06 01:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(317427, 23666, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and dark curves along the top. Nice composition. Near perfect capture (tiny bit soft on the focus maybe). I''d get rid of that bright white spot post challenge. The reflection is really cool too.</td>', 'I really like the light and dark curves along the top. Nice composition. Near perfect capture (tiny bit soft on the focus maybe). I''d get rid of that bright white spot post challenge. The reflection is really cool too.', '2003-06-06 01:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(317431, 23576, 1143, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Rorschach ink blot test... I see birds  :)  cool abstract idea. Not sure yellow is the best frame color.</td>', 'Looks like a Rorschach ink blot test... I see birds  :)  cool abstract idea. Not sure yellow is the best frame color.', '2003-06-06 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317458, 23289, 7885, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at something different but I think it might work better with a closer, tighter crop. Not bad, though.</td>', 'Good attempt at something different but I think it might work better with a closer, tighter crop. Not bad, though.', '2003-06-06 03:59:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(317459, 23662, 7885, '<td valign="top">There is a great sense of energy in this shot from the globules and their shadows. The colours are an interesting combination, too.</td>', 'There is a great sense of energy in this shot from the globules and their shadows. The colours are an interesting combination, too.', '2003-06-06 04:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(317461, 23292, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea.  I might have closed the driver door and tood the person sitting behind the wheel to take his fingers out of their mouth.  =o)  (Assuming this is a set up shot not a candid shot)<br/>Aside from that...  The flare on the windshild is an abvious distraction.  I might have tried to get more creative with the angle.  Another thing to think about is the DoF.  A shorter Depth of Focus would have reduced the attention of the background.  Points for originallity.</td>', 'Interesting Idea.  I might have closed the driver door and tood the person sitting behind the wheel to take his fingers out of their mouth.  =o)  (Assuming this is a set up shot not a candid shot)Aside from that...  The flare on the windshild is an abvious distraction.  I might have tried to get more creative with the angle.  Another thing to think about is the DoF.  A shorter Depth of Focus would have reduced the attention of the background.  Points for originallity.', '2003-06-06 04:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(317464, 23731, 7885, '<td valign="top">The fuzzy texture to this image probably does convey a good sense of excess fruit/fizz/sugar intake. Pleasant colour assortment.</td>', 'The fuzzy texture to this image probably does convey a good sense of excess fruit/fizz/sugar intake. Pleasant colour assortment.', '2003-06-06 04:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(317470, 23803, 7885, '<td valign="top">Sort of abstract, sort of not, but pleasant enough to look at.</td>', 'Sort of abstract, sort of not, but pleasant enough to look at.', '2003-06-06 04:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(317471, 23733, 7510, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a terific photo is the center wasn''t so blurry.  The surrounding ripples look awsome.  The Center looks a little like some kind of blender.  It has interesting colours, and streaks of light. 8</td>', 'I think this would have been a terific photo is the center wasn''t so blurry.  The surrounding ripples look awsome.  The Center looks a little like some kind of blender.  It has interesting colours, and streaks of light. 8', '2003-06-06 04:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(317473, 23660, 7510, '<td valign="top">Weird idea.  I might not have cropped this one so small/close.  A little bit of grain on the lower half.</td>', 'Weird idea.  I might not have cropped this one so small/close.  A little bit of grain on the lower half.', '2003-06-06 04:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(317474, 23211, 7510, '<td valign="top">Very original.  Nice texture, but I think that some of that is lost because the leaf is so dark.  I like the DoF.  Overall a very good photo. 8</td>', 'Very original.  Nice texture, but I think that some of that is lost because the leaf is so dark.  I like the DoF.  Overall a very good photo. 8', '2003-06-06 04:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(317477, 23636, 7510, '<td valign="top">LoL  Nice Shot.  He doesn''t look too happy.  Not much to say that I think can be changed in this Candid shot.</td>', 'LoL  Nice Shot.  He doesn''t look too happy.  Not much to say that I think can be changed in this Candid shot.', '2003-06-06 04:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(317480, 23383, 7510, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this one.  Payphone???  Solid to Liquid?  Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t understand this one.  Payphone???  Solid to Liquid?  Sorry.', '2003-06-06 04:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(317482, 23796, 7510, '<td valign="top">Whow.  Yellow.  Very cool idea.  I like the high speed Capture here.  Looks like a lot of mess to clean up after...</td>', 'Whow.  Yellow.  Very cool idea.  I like the high speed Capture here.  Looks like a lot of mess to clean up after...', '2003-06-06 04:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(317483, 23747, 7510, '<td valign="top">Kool shot.  I might have gotten rid of the blanket (or whatever it is) in the top right.</td>', 'Kool shot.  I might have gotten rid of the blanket (or whatever it is) in the top right.', '2003-06-06 04:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(317484, 23752, 7510, '<td valign="top">very cool shot,  nicely done.  If I was to nit pick, I might have moved the pouring liquid to the lowest point of the chocolate bar.  It would look more natural.  Or pour the liquid down the back of the bar, if that was possible.</td>', 'very cool shot,  nicely done.  If I was to nit pick, I might have moved the pouring liquid to the lowest point of the chocolate bar.  It would look more natural.  Or pour the liquid down the back of the bar, if that was possible.', '2003-06-06 04:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(317486, 23482, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the grainyness of the shadows.  Reminds me of the ''Kitchen Guest'' in the Fauna challenge.  The shadow effect is similar, but the pottery is different. 8</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the grainyness of the shadows.  Reminds me of the ''Kitchen Guest'' in the Fauna challenge.  The shadow effect is similar, but the pottery is different. 8', '2003-06-06 04:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(317487, 23683, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition.  I like the lighting effect here, and the framing.</td>', 'Nice Composition.  I like the lighting effect here, and the framing.', '2003-06-06 04:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(317488, 23222, 7510, '<td valign="top">Well, not particularly my favorate shot, but technically I think it is flawless.  How did you do it? 10</td>', 'Well, not particularly my favorate shot, but technically I think it is flawless.  How did you do it? 10', '2003-06-06 04:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(317489, 23317, 7510, '<td valign="top">Wow.  In the thumbnail this shot didn''t look that interesting, but the full image it like explodes off the screen.  I love the DoF.  Very crisp.  I think I would have liked to have seen this one with either the words straight, or a little more crooked.  It seems a little inbetween as it is. 10</td>', 'Wow.  In the thumbnail this shot didn''t look that interesting, but the full image it like explodes off the screen.  I love the DoF.  Very crisp.  I think I would have liked to have seen this one with either the words straight, or a little more crooked.  It seems a little inbetween as it is. 10', '2003-06-06 04:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(317491, 23385, 7151, '<td valign="top">My guess is this photo was flipped upside down!  Hope to find out after the challenge is over...<br/> <br/>It''s a sort of interesting image, colors, lighting and composition are OK.  I think a little more of the foreground in focus would work better - the blur hurts the eyes a little.  I think if you could have brought a little more out of that center drip - through light, better focus, something - it would have helped a lot.  5</td>', 'My guess is this photo was flipped upside down!  Hope to find out after the challenge is over... It''s a sort of interesting image, colors, lighting and composition are OK.  I think a little more of the foreground in focus would work better - the blur hurts the eyes a little.  I think if you could have brought a little more out of that center drip - through light, better focus, something - it would have helped a lot.  5', '2003-06-06 05:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(317503, 23173, 9075, '<td valign="top">Well it''s certainly original</td>', 'Well it''s certainly original', '2003-06-06 06:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(317505, 23725, 9075, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture, just not for the challenge</td>', 'It''s a nice picture, just not for the challenge', '2003-06-06 06:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(317520, 23442, 8140, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, nice composition and colors! = 9</td>', 'very nice photo, nice composition and colors! = 9', '2003-06-06 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(317538, 23724, 8140, '<td valign="top">it looks like out of focus. IMO you should be making some better composition and perspective. In this case it is not so obviously what is in the spoon. = 4</td>', 'it looks like out of focus. IMO you should be making some better composition and perspective. In this case it is not so obviously what is in the spoon. = 4', '2003-06-06 07:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(317579, 23577, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not very inspired choice of subject. Poor lighting. Appears that no thought went into the shot at all. Doesn;t explore the properties of your chosen liquid. 2</td>', 'Not very inspired choice of subject. Poor lighting. Appears that no thought went into the shot at all. Doesn;t explore the properties of your chosen liquid. 2', '2003-06-06 09:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(317582, 23770, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting liquid, but nothing is in focus. Your background is terrible! If you wanted this picture to work, I think you should have put a lot of thought into what was visible in the background. The spoon is too harshly lit. I like the vapour that is rising above the spoon... maybe this could have been enhanced more. 4</td>', 'An interesting liquid, but nothing is in focus. Your background is terrible! If you wanted this picture to work, I think you should have put a lot of thought into what was visible in the background. The spoon is too harshly lit. I like the vapour that is rising above the spoon... maybe this could have been enhanced more. 4', '2003-06-06 09:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317585, 23674, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject and composition. I believe this could have been better lit though, it looks a little harsh and your highlights are a bit burnt out. A quick levels adjustment could have increased the tonal range so it douesn''t look so washed out.  Interesting colours. 5</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject and composition. I believe this could have been better lit though, it looks a little harsh and your highlights are a bit burnt out. A quick levels adjustment could have increased the tonal range so it douesn''t look so washed out.  Interesting colours. 5', '2003-06-06 09:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(317588, 23723, 8522, '<td valign="top">Is liquidify a word? Some interesting things going on in this picture, spoilt by a few things... Nothing appears to be in focus. I think some creative cropping could have helped, as it stands it appears that not much thought went into composition. There is too much grey for my taste. The highlights are too burnt out. I like the colours and idea though!</td>', 'Is liquidify a word? Some interesting things going on in this picture, spoilt by a few things... Nothing appears to be in focus. I think some creative cropping could have helped, as it stands it appears that not much thought went into composition. There is too much grey for my taste. The highlights are too burnt out. I like the colours and idea though!', '2003-06-06 09:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(317591, 23198, 8522, '<td valign="top">Could have been a really good picture with better lighting and in focus! 4<br/>ps, I forgot to mention... it doesn''t look good when it appears you haven''t been bothered to use spell-check...</td>', 'Could have been a really good picture with better lighting and in focus! 4ps, I forgot to mention... it doesn''t look good when it appears you haven''t been bothered to use spell-check...', '2003-06-06 09:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
