(317836, 23411, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Good layout.  I like the way that the colors go well together and you can tell the textures of the objects by the clarity and quality of the photo.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Good layout.  I like the way that the colors go well together and you can tell the textures of the objects by the clarity and quality of the photo.  Good job.', '2003-06-06 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(317837, 23752, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot, but it''s a little too easy to figure out how you did it because the colors aren''t quite matched up.  A thicker stream of the chocolate would help -- also, I''d bring the left side out a bit so the cup handle''s not cut off.  Overall, though, the feel is engaging and appetizing!</td>', 'I like this image a lot, but it''s a little too easy to figure out how you did it because the colors aren''t quite matched up.  A thicker stream of the chocolate would help -- also, I''d bring the left side out a bit so the cup handle''s not cut off.  Overall, though, the feel is engaging and appetizing!', '2003-06-06 15:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(317839, 23474, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good lighting.  I like the way the background and the way it makes the objects stand out.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good lighting.  I like the way the background and the way it makes the objects stand out.  Good job.', '2003-06-06 15:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(317840, 23522, 6451, '<td valign="top">This image seems a little blurry I like the colors and the texture of the liquid.  Good job.</td>', 'This image seems a little blurry I like the colors and the texture of the liquid.  Good job.', '2003-06-06 15:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(317841, 23829, 6565, '<td valign="top">Pluses: I like the concept, the background is clean and non-intrusive, the composition is pretty solid.  Minuses: the lighting is a bit harsh/uneven for my taste, and the glass is SO sweaty it looks like it''s been there a while.  Might have been your intention but to me it says "this is shot #150 of this setup," which ruins the sort of "just happened upon this scene" feel.</td>', 'Pluses: I like the concept, the background is clean and non-intrusive, the composition is pretty solid.  Minuses: the lighting is a bit harsh/uneven for my taste, and the glass is SO sweaty it looks like it''s been there a while.  Might have been your intention but to me it says "this is shot #150 of this setup," which ruins the sort of "just happened upon this scene" feel.', '2003-06-06 15:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(317842, 23666, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I like the colors and the way that the image is arranged.  Very creative.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I like the colors and the way that the image is arranged.  Very creative.', '2003-06-06 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(317845, 23506, 6451, '<td valign="top">How did you make this image. Very cool, I like all of the textures and the way that they go together in the image with the colors.  Good job.</td>', 'How did you make this image. Very cool, I like all of the textures and the way that they go together in the image with the colors.  Good job.', '2003-06-06 15:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(317846, 23554, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like this image because of the harmony of the two substances in real life (a natural mixing of liquids), plus the colors are rich and the bubbles are clean.  There''s quite a bit of black in this photo, which might hurt you a little but looks fine on my monitor.  I like the border, daring of you to go black-on-black but it works!</td>', 'I like this image because of the harmony of the two substances in real life (a natural mixing of liquids), plus the colors are rich and the bubbles are clean.  There''s quite a bit of black in this photo, which might hurt you a little but looks fine on my monitor.  I like the border, daring of you to go black-on-black but it works!', '2003-06-06 15:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(317847, 23738, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  The angle of this photo is a little distracting though.  I like the colors and the texture fo the liquids.  Good job.</td>', 'Very cool.  The angle of this photo is a little distracting though.  I like the colors and the texture fo the liquids.  Good job.', '2003-06-06 15:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(317848, 23775, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good pic quality. I like the black background that you used also.  It provides for a nice image.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good pic quality. I like the black background that you used also.  It provides for a nice image.  Good job.', '2003-06-06 15:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(317849, 23125, 6565, '<td valign="top">My most favorite thing about this image is the action captured.  The contrast of the two colors is also nice, adds interest.  Minus: the lighting.  Because it''s not very warm, it washes out the background and looks like paper rather than a background.  Oh, the shadow with the green in it is also very nice!</td>', 'My most favorite thing about this image is the action captured.  The contrast of the two colors is also nice, adds interest.  Minus: the lighting.  Because it''s not very warm, it washes out the background and looks like paper rather than a background.  Oh, the shadow with the green in it is also very nice!', '2003-06-06 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317851, 23802, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant image, especially the reflected shadow of "Guinness" in the head.</td>', 'Excellant image, especially the reflected shadow of "Guinness" in the head.', '2003-06-06 15:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(317854, 23309, 5792, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. Smothered in butter works for me. I would like to see more contrast in this image. Looks mighty tasty!</td>', 'I like your idea. Smothered in butter works for me. I would like to see more contrast in this image. Looks mighty tasty!', '2003-06-06 15:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(317855, 23662, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the action in this photo!  There''s a lot going on visually, and I like the metallic feel as well as the shadows under the drops.  The composition is nice, too, very active and unusual.  I''m more and more impressed, the more I look at this!  The ONLY thing I can think of to suggest is perhaps to add some color in the background, where it''s white.  If that''s possible.  Nice work!</td>', 'I love the action in this photo!  There''s a lot going on visually, and I like the metallic feel as well as the shadows under the drops.  The composition is nice, too, very active and unusual.  I''m more and more impressed, the more I look at this!  The ONLY thing I can think of to suggest is perhaps to add some color in the background, where it''s white.  If that''s possible.  Nice work!', '2003-06-06 15:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(317856, 23300, 5792, '<td valign="top">The green liquid (paoint?) gives this image color in a way that fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'The green liquid (paoint?) gives this image color in a way that fits the challenge very well.', '2003-06-06 15:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(317859, 23316, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and very well executed.</td>', 'Interesting concept and very well executed.', '2003-06-06 15:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(317861, 23835, 6565, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo says "bubbles" more than it says "liquid."  I love the lighting, very dramatic without being overpowering.  Wish I could tell from the photo what kind of glass it was, and how the berry was floating on the bubbles.  A wider shot might have done this one some good.</td>', 'To me, this photo says "bubbles" more than it says "liquid."  I love the lighting, very dramatic without being overpowering.  Wish I could tell from the photo what kind of glass it was, and how the berry was floating on the bubbles.  A wider shot might have done this one some good.', '2003-06-06 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(317862, 23552, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very good use of pink and yellow and nice framing.</td>', 'Very good use of pink and yellow and nice framing.', '2003-06-06 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(317865, 23702, 5792, '<td valign="top">Solid black background works well with the deep read. Technically well done. Nice use of ROT for the spout.</td>', 'Solid black background works well with the deep read. Technically well done. Nice use of ROT for the spout.', '2003-06-06 15:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(317866, 23779, 6565, '<td valign="top">I lvoe the clarity of the image, and the way the light plays off the different surfaces.  Background is subtle enough to not detract from the subject.  Nice!</td>', 'I lvoe the clarity of the image, and the way the light plays off the different surfaces.  Background is subtle enough to not detract from the subject.  Nice!', '2003-06-06 15:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(317877, 23788, 3296, '<td valign="top">At last! QUALITY. A picture with no HONEY to be found. Nice Job.</td>', 'At last! QUALITY. A picture with no HONEY to be found. Nice Job.', '2003-06-06 15:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
