(317915, 23160, 7920, '<td valign="top">I use it, and I love it.  The shine on the lips is what really makes the photo.  Beautiful work.  10.</td>', 'I use it, and I love it.  The shine on the lips is what really makes the photo.  Beautiful work.  10.', '2003-06-06 16:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(317919, 23833, 7920, '<td valign="top">I really like this. You''ve set a very nice definition of femininity in this photo.  And the bracelet complementing the shoe adds a nice touch to the composition.  High marks for you.  =)</td>', 'I really like this. You''ve set a very nice definition of femininity in this photo.  And the bracelet complementing the shoe adds a nice touch to the composition.  High marks for you.  =)', '2003-06-06 16:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(317920, 23745, 7920, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo, and definitely one of my favorites.  There''s such a softness about it, and what a striking title...  10</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo, and definitely one of my favorites.  There''s such a softness about it, and what a striking title...  10', '2003-06-06 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(317931, 23813, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this one a lot!  The noisemaker looks a bit out of focus to me, but the overall look is very nice and polished.</td>', 'I like the composition of this one a lot!  The noisemaker looks a bit out of focus to me, but the overall look is very nice and polished.', '2003-06-06 17:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(317933, 23385, 6565, '<td valign="top">Is this displayed upside-down?  It almost looks like a hard resin that was flipped after it cooled.  I like the liquid feel of this photo, and the composition is interesting.  I might have left a tiny bit more black on the right edge, so the eye doesn''t leave the photo before it swings back in for that other curve.</td>', 'Is this displayed upside-down?  It almost looks like a hard resin that was flipped after it cooled.  I like the liquid feel of this photo, and the composition is interesting.  I might have left a tiny bit more black on the right edge, so the eye doesn''t leave the photo before it swings back in for that other curve.', '2003-06-06 17:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317934, 23180, 6565, '<td valign="top">While technically not a picture where the subject is OF a liquid, this still says "liquid" to me.  I like the dramatic lighting!</td>', 'While technically not a picture where the subject is OF a liquid, this still says "liquid" to me.  I like the dramatic lighting!', '2003-06-06 17:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317936, 23309, 6597, '<td valign="top">good idea  I like the appearance of the melted butter 8</td>', 'good idea  I like the appearance of the melted butter 8', '2003-06-06 17:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(317937, 23457, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the collander in the background, adding interest without being distracting!</td>', 'I like the collander in the background, adding interest without being distracting!', '2003-06-06 17:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(317938, 23830, 6565, '<td valign="top">This photo has a very dramatic look to it -- kind of unnerving, the unusual twist of source and product together.  I like the lighting, composition, everything!  Only constructive thing I can think of is that it would be interesting to see the background in a color other than black, to see if that cuts the harshness a little.</td>', 'This photo has a very dramatic look to it -- kind of unnerving, the unusual twist of source and product together.  I like the lighting, composition, everything!  Only constructive thing I can think of is that it would be interesting to see the background in a color other than black, to see if that cuts the harshness a little.', '2003-06-06 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(317939, 23700, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the definite display of liquid in this image, and the studio feel of the background and lighting.</td>', 'I like the definite display of liquid in this image, and the studio feel of the background and lighting.', '2003-06-06 17:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(317940, 23798, 6565, '<td valign="top">Photo looks a little blurry to me, but I like the bubbles'' placement and the colors.</td>', 'Photo looks a little blurry to me, but I like the bubbles'' placement and the colors.', '2003-06-06 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(317941, 23763, 6565, '<td valign="top">Dramatic!  Says "ice" or "blue" to me more than "liquid" but it definitely meets the challenge.  Hope there''s a how-to comment in your notes!</td>', 'Dramatic!  Says "ice" or "blue" to me more than "liquid" but it definitely meets the challenge.  Hope there''s a how-to comment in your notes!', '2003-06-06 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(317942, 23376, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lime rickey to me. Don''t really know what kind of liquid this is, but the reflections in the glass of you and the other objects is distracting and confusing and reduces the contrast.</td>', 'Looks like a lime rickey to me. Don''t really know what kind of liquid this is, but the reflections in the glass of you and the other objects is distracting and confusing and reduces the contrast.', '2003-06-06 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(317943, 23745, 6565, '<td valign="top">There''s something almost painterly about the lighting in this.  I like the way the pitcher sort of disappears into the background.  Would consider either no frame or making the frame off-white instead of pure white.</td>', 'There''s something almost painterly about the lighting in this.  I like the way the pitcher sort of disappears into the background.  Would consider either no frame or making the frame off-white instead of pure white.', '2003-06-06 17:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(317944, 23837, 6565, '<td valign="top">This definitely says "liquid" to me and is very clear.  I think this photo would look better in color, though.</td>', 'This definitely says "liquid" to me and is very clear.  I think this photo would look better in color, though.', '2003-06-06 17:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317945, 23497, 6565, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, this is pretty dramatic, but I don''t see liquid.</td>', 'As an abstract, this is pretty dramatic, but I don''t see liquid.', '2003-06-06 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(317947, 23215, 6565, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the connection with "liquid" here.  Like the perspective, but the image would have more impact when the sky was clear and blue, in my opinion.</td>', 'I don''t understand the connection with "liquid" here.  Like the perspective, but the image would have more impact when the sky was clear and blue, in my opinion.', '2003-06-06 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(317949, 23636, 6565, '<td valign="top">Neat action (hope nobody was in any danger!) but it says NOT water, and this looks like water to me.</td>', 'Neat action (hope nobody was in any danger!) but it says NOT water, and this looks like water to me.', '2003-06-06 17:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(317950, 23506, 6565, '<td valign="top">This image is very striking in itself, and I like the color choices.  Haunting.  However, I don''t understand the connection to "liquid."</td>', 'This image is very striking in itself, and I like the color choices.  Haunting.  However, I don''t understand the connection to "liquid."', '2003-06-06 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(317951, 23710, 6565, '<td valign="top">I don''t see "liquid" here.  Nice lighting and perspective, though.</td>', 'I don''t see "liquid" here.  Nice lighting and perspective, though.', '2003-06-06 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(317953, 23510, 6565, '<td valign="top">The blur on this just isn''t working for me.  Can''t really tell that it''s liquid.  The little sparky things, whatever they are, actually look kind of cool. :)</td>', 'The blur on this just isn''t working for me.  Can''t really tell that it''s liquid.  The little sparky things, whatever they are, actually look kind of cool. :)', '2003-06-06 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
