(317958, 23375, 6565, '<td valign="top">Title tells me that you were in fact interpreting the challenge.  But while I''d buy "fluid" movement, I just don''t get "liquid" from this.</td>', 'Title tells me that you were in fact interpreting the challenge.  But while I''d buy "fluid" movement, I just don''t get "liquid" from this.', '2003-06-06 17:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(317959, 23733, 6565, '<td valign="top">Colors are cool (I''m partial to blues and purples), but the blur isn''t working for me.</td>', 'Colors are cool (I''m partial to blues and purples), but the blur isn''t working for me.', '2003-06-06 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(317960, 23490, 6565, '<td valign="top">At the moment, it''s water, and the challenge said NOT water.  Go stand at the other end of the plant and photograph the beer. ;)  I like the movement in the composition, though.</td>', 'At the moment, it''s water, and the challenge said NOT water.  Go stand at the other end of the plant and photograph the beer. ;)  I like the movement in the composition, though.', '2003-06-06 17:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(317962, 23346, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation, I suppose the building steps reflected are supposed to look like waves?  Doesn''t quite portray "liquid" but it''s an interesting photo.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation, I suppose the building steps reflected are supposed to look like waves?  Doesn''t quite portray "liquid" but it''s an interesting photo.', '2003-06-06 17:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(317964, 23173, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is one of those "the title matters" photos. :)  I hope someone cleaned the coin off before licking it, blech!  From a technical standpoint, pumping up the saturation a bit would make the image more interesting to me, and I like the cropping as it is.</td>', 'This is one of those "the title matters" photos. :)  I hope someone cleaned the coin off before licking it, blech!  From a technical standpoint, pumping up the saturation a bit would make the image more interesting to me, and I like the cropping as it is.', '2003-06-06 17:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(317965, 23833, 6565, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have worked better if you could actually see the liquid.  I get what you were going for, but the liquid''s not very prominent.  As a general study, I like the composition, and the contrast of the bracelets with the shoe straps is a nice touch.  Might want to check border widths, doesn''t look even to me.</td>', 'I think this photo would have worked better if you could actually see the liquid.  I get what you were going for, but the liquid''s not very prominent.  As a general study, I like the composition, and the contrast of the bracelets with the shoe straps is a nice touch.  Might want to check border widths, doesn''t look even to me.', '2003-06-06 17:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(317966, 23781, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up!  Only gripe would be if you had stood just a couple inches to the left, it would have brought the image to a more appealing angle.  The edge of the bottle shouldn''t be cropped out, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nicely set up!  Only gripe would be if you had stood just a couple inches to the left, it would have brought the image to a more appealing angle.  The edge of the bottle shouldn''t be cropped out, in my opinion.', '2003-06-06 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(317975, 23163, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of this shot, but think you included just too much red and the focus is too soft for my tastes. Has alot of potential though.</td>', 'I really like the angle of this shot, but think you included just too much red and the focus is too soft for my tastes. Has alot of potential though.', '2003-06-06 18:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(317978, 23310, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and I like the blue streak and the texture of the ice.</td>', 'Nice abstract and I like the blue streak and the texture of the ice.', '2003-06-06 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(317979, 23574, 5822, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the harsh lighting and there is nothing of interest in the right side of the image.</td>', 'I don''t like the harsh lighting and there is nothing of interest in the right side of the image.', '2003-06-06 18:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(317980, 23662, 8865, '<td valign="top">I just want to say, I love this photo. The shadows and the shine on the mercury[?] turned out really nice. Good one :)</td>', 'I just want to say, I love this photo. The shadows and the shine on the mercury[?] turned out really nice. Good one :)', '2003-06-06 18:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(317983, 23835, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve captured the bubbles and the color.  Interesting abstract.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve captured the bubbles and the color.  Interesting abstract.', '2003-06-06 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(317984, 23791, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the message is here but this photo really had an emotional impact on me. It''s kind of gross and drained the blood out of me but  I like the way you''ve isolated the lips with a very narrow DOF.  I also like the pale colors of the face.  Is this really an injection of some kind? It looks so real I''m wondering where the drop of blood is? Very effective!</td>', 'I''m not sure what the message is here but this photo really had an emotional impact on me. It''s kind of gross and drained the blood out of me but  I like the way you''ve isolated the lips with a very narrow DOF.  I also like the pale colors of the face.  Is this really an injection of some kind? It looks so real I''m wondering where the drop of blood is? Very effective!', '2003-06-06 18:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(317985, 23774, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautifully clear photo with good focus and I like the way the foreground fades into the background. I just wish there was more of an interesting background to look at as there is so much empty space in the top half of the image. In addition, I find the red of the tomato soup to be lacking pizzazz.  Maybe a spot light on the soup alone would have brought that out some more or some increased saturation in an image editor. Well done.</td>', 'Beautifully clear photo with good focus and I like the way the foreground fades into the background. I just wish there was more of an interesting background to look at as there is so much empty space in the top half of the image. In addition, I find the red of the tomato soup to be lacking pizzazz.  Maybe a spot light on the soup alone would have brought that out some more or some increased saturation in an image editor. Well done.', '2003-06-06 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(317987, 23553, 5822, '<td valign="top">Simple but classy shot. I like the tones of gold and tan but find the specular highlight in the gold to be distracting.</td>', 'Simple but classy shot. I like the tones of gold and tan but find the specular highlight in the gold to be distracting.', '2003-06-06 18:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(317988, 23375, 5822, '<td valign="top">I guess wind is technically and scientifically speaking considered a liquid, but I think it''s a stretch in this challenge. I do find that your capture of the flag without any apparent blurring is good but also find the colors to be lacking in luster.</td>', 'I guess wind is technically and scientifically speaking considered a liquid, but I think it''s a stretch in this challenge. I do find that your capture of the flag without any apparent blurring is good but also find the colors to be lacking in luster.', '2003-06-06 18:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(317990, 23713, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think image is a bit overexposed to the point that the stuffed animal is lacking in detail.</td>', 'I think image is a bit overexposed to the point that the stuffed animal is lacking in detail.', '2003-06-06 18:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(317991, 23735, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good DOF</td>', 'Good DOF', '2003-06-06 18:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(317992, 23620, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh and creates an overexposed upper half and underexposed lower half of the image. The specular highlight is distracting and needs to be diffused, IMO.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh and creates an overexposed upper half and underexposed lower half of the image. The specular highlight is distracting and needs to be diffused, IMO.', '2003-06-06 18:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(317994, 23482, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this simple composition and the mug and pitcher are interesting to look at as is the shaded background. I do however, wish your colors were more saturated and brighter. The liquid itself, which should be prominent is uninteresting and lackluster.</td>', 'I like this simple composition and the mug and pitcher are interesting to look at as is the shaded background. I do however, wish your colors were more saturated and brighter. The liquid itself, which should be prominent is uninteresting and lackluster.', '2003-06-06 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(317995, 23829, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve made the point too empatically with your lighting on the orange. I''m not crazy about the spot on the orange without much diffuse lighting to illuminate other parts of the photo.</td>', 'I think you''ve made the point too empatically with your lighting on the orange. I''m not crazy about the spot on the orange without much diffuse lighting to illuminate other parts of the photo.', '2003-06-06 18:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
