(318001, 23833, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the contrast here, but wish this was one of those shots that showed only one color (of the nail polish) and the rest was as is. Still, very well done.</td>', 'I like the tones and the contrast here, but wish this was one of those shots that showed only one color (of the nail polish) and the rest was as is. Still, very well done.', '2003-06-06 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
