(318118, 23497, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering what this is - I''m afraid the title doesn''t clue me in, either. Nice colors, but that''s about all I''m sure I know about it.</td>', 'I''m wondering what this is - I''m afraid the title doesn''t clue me in, either. Nice colors, but that''s about all I''m sure I know about it.', '2003-06-07 02:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318119, 23643, 8911, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the oil, to have a sense of something liquid in the picture, and it seems like you let your focus land so tightly in the foreground that even most of the second gear is blurred, and the upper half of the picture is blurry enough to be highly distracting. I like the concept of the shot, but I''m not sure the angle/focus/crop/something was quite right.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the oil, to have a sense of something liquid in the picture, and it seems like you let your focus land so tightly in the foreground that even most of the second gear is blurred, and the upper half of the picture is blurry enough to be highly distracting. I like the concept of the shot, but I''m not sure the angle/focus/crop/something was quite right.', '2003-06-07 02:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(318120, 23787, 8911, '<td valign="top">I have trouble making this one out, I think because the left side looks awfully granular for liquid - so that I wonder what it is - and because the dish (?) at the right side being so bright, the left side is dark and seems a bit off. Maybe it wouldn''t if I''d seen the original scene.</td>', 'I have trouble making this one out, I think because the left side looks awfully granular for liquid - so that I wonder what it is - and because the dish (?) at the right side being so bright, the left side is dark and seems a bit off. Maybe it wouldn''t if I''d seen the original scene.', '2003-06-07 02:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318121, 23710, 8911, '<td valign="top">Really cool concept, though I''m not sure if I buy it as liquid. I wonder what it would have looked like with one edge (Somewhere) straight to an edge of teh photo, or at a 45 degree angle...as it is, they don''t seem to quite square off with or strike against the edges, and I wonder if it might have heightened the drama.</td>', 'Really cool concept, though I''m not sure if I buy it as liquid. I wonder what it would have looked like with one edge (Somewhere) straight to an edge of teh photo, or at a 45 degree angle...as it is, they don''t seem to quite square off with or strike against the edges, and I wonder if it might have heightened the drama.', '2003-06-07 02:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(318122, 23173, 8911, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the pun - good for a solid giggle!</td>', 'Thank you for the pun - good for a solid giggle!', '2003-06-07 02:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(318124, 23731, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but you got yourself and the camera in the shot, by way of the reflections, and a fair bit of glare reflection off to the right - it might have been worth trying some different angles, shooting high or low, or blocking some of the light if you could.</td>', 'I like the concept, but you got yourself and the camera in the shot, by way of the reflections, and a fair bit of glare reflection off to the right - it might have been worth trying some different angles, shooting high or low, or blocking some of the light if you could.', '2003-06-07 02:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318125, 23829, 8911, '<td valign="top">This was good for a definite laugh - somewhere in the midst of the appreciation. Besides being funny and original, this shot is really well-balanced - I like the way you''ve placed the objects, splitting it across, but not bound it to being the same height on both sides. It works really nicely - and the lighting is well-placed, too, setting focus on the joining and the liquid more than on the support case of straws, without obscuring them. Nice shot.</td>', 'This was good for a definite laugh - somewhere in the midst of the appreciation. Besides being funny and original, this shot is really well-balanced - I like the way you''ve placed the objects, splitting it across, but not bound it to being the same height on both sides. It works really nicely - and the lighting is well-placed, too, setting focus on the joining and the liquid more than on the support case of straws, without obscuring them. Nice shot.', '2003-06-07 02:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(318126, 23763, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this on two levels - first, the lighting / colors (how did you get those to work so perfectly - are the cubes themselves colored, or...?). But also the composition. My first response was "just gorgeous, just perfect," and analyzing it, I think it''s because you managed to touch on the 2/3 height &amp; width, and 1/3 height and width, with the "upper" corners of the glass, balancing the picture with the glass itself without just framing it square on. Really attractive.</td>', 'I like this on two levels - first, the lighting / colors (how did you get those to work so perfectly - are the cubes themselves colored, or...?). But also the composition. My first response was "just gorgeous, just perfect," and analyzing it, I think it''s because you managed to touch on the 2/3 height & width, and 1/3 height and width, with the "upper" corners of the glass, balancing the picture with the glass itself without just framing it square on. Really attractive.', '2003-06-07 02:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(318127, 23354, 8911, '<td valign="top">Love this one. I''ve seen enough liquid splashes to make me want my mop, but the way this curtains up and the inclusion of its shadow both make this really stand out - the placement of the two so that they just appear to touch, and balance each other in the picture, is great.</td>', 'Love this one. I''ve seen enough liquid splashes to make me want my mop, but the way this curtains up and the inclusion of its shadow both make this really stand out - the placement of the two so that they just appear to touch, and balance each other in the picture, is great.', '2003-06-07 02:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(318128, 23454, 8911, '<td valign="top">Really liked this. The composition, the tight focus on your subject, the expression are all great. The bubble being blown, and the sense of movement/creation/wind that it gives - all of these combine to makethis an excellent photo. Nice!</td>', 'Really liked this. The composition, the tight focus on your subject, the expression are all great. The bubble being blown, and the sense of movement/creation/wind that it gives - all of these combine to makethis an excellent photo. Nice!', '2003-06-07 02:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(318132, 23666, 6696, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Would like to know how you got the liquid in the bowl purple but not the drop - physics?  Only complaint is that the shot does not look level. 10</td>', 'Great shot.  Would like to know how you got the liquid in the bowl purple but not the drop - physics?  Only complaint is that the shot does not look level. 10', '2003-06-07 02:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318135, 23317, 6696, '<td valign="top">Great dof.  Best honey shot in this contest.  :)  9<br/></td>', 'Great dof.  Best honey shot in this contest.  :)  9', '2003-06-07 03:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(318136, 23147, 6696, '<td valign="top">I love the symetry of subject and black space.  Great job.  8</td>', 'I love the symetry of subject and black space.  Great job.  8', '2003-06-07 03:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(318138, 23620, 6172, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Could maybe have a deeper DOF?  And the subject seems just a little too centered to me.  Nice idea, though!</td>', 'I like it.  Could maybe have a deeper DOF?  And the subject seems just a little too centered to me.  Nice idea, though!', '2003-06-07 03:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(318139, 23725, 6696, '<td valign="top">where''s the blood?</td>', 'where''s the blood?', '2003-06-07 03:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(318140, 23806, 6172, '<td valign="top">I had this same idea!  But then I thought,"No, that is just TOO gross!".</td>', 'I had this same idea!  But then I thought,"No, that is just TOO gross!".', '2003-06-07 03:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(318141, 23506, 6696, '<td valign="top">Would like to see how this was done.  Still, it does not speak liquid very well</td>', 'Would like to see how this was done.  Still, it does not speak liquid very well', '2003-06-07 03:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318142, 23791, 6172, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and nice execution of it.</td>', 'Good idea, and nice execution of it.', '2003-06-07 03:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(318143, 23375, 6696, '<td valign="top">Not really appealing an any level.</td>', 'Not really appealing an any level.', '2003-06-07 03:20:47.000000', NULL, 1);
