(318186, 23738, 8500, '<td valign="top">i thought of this but maybe with a better lighting , you''re picture is good it''s just missing something ...=4</td>', 'i thought of this but maybe with a better lighting , you''re picture is good it''s just missing something ...=4', '2003-06-07 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
