(318198, 23735, 1202, '<td valign="top">good use of complimentary colors in this shot.  The bottom is quite grainy and is distracting against the blurred background.   Might have been better if it were clearer.  IMO  7</td>', 'good use of complimentary colors in this shot.  The bottom is quite grainy and is distracting against the blurred background.   Might have been better if it were clearer.  IMO  7', '2003-06-07 11:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(318199, 23710, 1202, '<td valign="top">Where is the liquid?  I am confused.  2</td>', 'Where is the liquid?  I am confused.  2', '2003-06-07 11:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(318200, 23510, 1202, '<td valign="top">I think you had a wonderful idea, but it needs a lot of work to be a success.  You have a lot of noise, nothing is in focus and the subject matter is not easily identified.  3</td>', 'I think you had a wonderful idea, but it needs a lot of work to be a success.  You have a lot of noise, nothing is in focus and the subject matter is not easily identified.  3', '2003-06-07 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(318201, 23828, 806, '<td valign="top">the lighting is very harsh on this. perhaps moving the light a bit further away, and using a reflector to fil in the light on the bottle would help? Or did you use a flash? The composition is good, and seems pretty clear and sharp. Just the lighting would improve this.</td>', 'the lighting is very harsh on this. perhaps moving the light a bit further away, and using a reflector to fil in the light on the bottle would help? Or did you use a flash? The composition is good, and seems pretty clear and sharp. Just the lighting would improve this.', '2003-06-07 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(318203, 23624, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice pour!  I think it might be cropped a little close, more of the container might have helped.   Good none the less.  7</td>', 'Nice pour!  I think it might be cropped a little close, more of the container might have helped.   Good none the less.  7', '2003-06-07 11:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(318204, 23710, 806, '<td valign="top">I am trying to understand the "liquid" in this. Perhaps the sunlight?<br/>Neat perspective, and capture of the light in contrast to the angles.</td>', 'I am trying to understand the "liquid" in this. Perhaps the sunlight?Neat perspective, and capture of the light in contrast to the angles.', '2003-06-07 11:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(318206, 23763, 1202, '<td valign="top">You are a magician with light.  Superb!   Just one little dark spot in your background, on the left.  10</td>', 'You are a magician with light.  Superb!   Just one little dark spot in your background, on the left.  10', '2003-06-07 11:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(318208, 23715, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nicely done.... could be a bit straighter, or if it was intentional, a bit more angled or else it looks like a mistake. I love the natural duotones, and it has interest.</td>', 'Nice idea, nicely done.... could be a bit straighter, or if it was intentional, a bit more angled or else it looks like a mistake. I love the natural duotones, and it has interest.', '2003-06-07 11:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(318209, 23765, 1202, '<td valign="top">It sure looks liquid to me.  The only thing I don''t like is the close cropped, round object in the rectangular frame.   They just don''t go together well.   7</td>', 'It sure looks liquid to me.  The only thing I don''t like is the close cropped, round object in the rectangular frame.   They just don''t go together well.   7', '2003-06-07 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318211, 23796, 1202, '<td valign="top">I hope you pulled this one of in one shot!  Great job, excellent result.  10</td>', 'I hope you pulled this one of in one shot!  Great job, excellent result.  10', '2003-06-07 11:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(318212, 23317, 806, '<td valign="top">nice perspective/leading lines. love the simplicity. The focus and dof are perfect... and it is difficult to focus thru a viscous liquid! good work!</td>', 'nice perspective/leading lines. love the simplicity. The focus and dof are perfect... and it is difficult to focus thru a viscous liquid! good work!', '2003-06-07 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(318213, 23574, 1202, '<td valign="top">Tricky, the water drop probably makes the picture, but the drink is there to save you.  Nice composition.  7</td>', 'Tricky, the water drop probably makes the picture, but the drink is there to save you.  Nice composition.  7', '2003-06-07 11:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(318214, 23125, 806, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a bit dim/flat.. and I may have moved this to one side.. like the lower right corner... or is that becoming cliche? LOL Just musing.<br/>Nice capture of the red drops in the greed liquid.</td>', 'the lighting is a bit dim/flat.. and I may have moved this to one side.. like the lower right corner... or is that becoming cliche? LOL Just musing.Nice capture of the red drops in the greed liquid.', '2003-06-07 11:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(318215, 23703, 1202, '<td valign="top">Blown out subjects make this picture.  Good job!  8</td>', 'Blown out subjects make this picture.  Good job!  8', '2003-06-07 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(318217, 23173, 1202, '<td valign="top">Technically great.  Subject????  7</td>', 'Technically great.  Subject????  7', '2003-06-07 11:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(318219, 23442, 1202, '<td valign="top">This comes across as mostly just colors, with not much to hold my interest.  It is liquid though.  5</td>', 'This comes across as mostly just colors, with not much to hold my interest.  It is liquid though.  5', '2003-06-07 11:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(318220, 23761, 1202, '<td valign="top">your lighting plays a big part in this shot.  It doesn''t make me want to hang it though.   6</td>', 'your lighting plays a big part in this shot.  It doesn''t make me want to hang it though.   6', '2003-06-07 11:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(318221, 23757, 1202, '<td valign="top">Hup, and well done too.  I can see this in a coffee shop.   9</td>', 'Hup, and well done too.  I can see this in a coffee shop.   9', '2003-06-07 11:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318223, 23508, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, too bad you didn''t have the lens to help you out a bit.  The plane blends in with the buildings, it might have been better if you could have caught it with just the trees in the background.   6</td>', 'Nice shot, too bad you didn''t have the lens to help you out a bit.  The plane blends in with the buildings, it might have been better if you could have caught it with just the trees in the background.   6', '2003-06-07 11:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(318224, 23752, 806, '<td valign="top">Now, here is a fine idea... Allow me to  take some time to comment on this one. ;)<br/> <br/>Initial: Clean, interesting, emotive (for those of us who love chocolate)<br/> <br/>Composition: I like the way this is composed. My eye bounces back and forth between the foaming/bubbling liquid and the chocolate bar - all the time connected by the chocolate that is seemingly endlessly pouring into the cup... giving me a sense that at some point it might over flow. I know this will not happen, but emotionally, I fear it might and wait in anticipation anyway.<br/> <br/>Technical: The focus and lighting is good, making the colors true to their own. <br/> <br/>What I would suggest: Though it sort of looks like you broke the chocolate bar open.. like it was a container ... allowing the contents to flow out, I am (in my reality) not convinced it is coming from the chocolate bar. it seems too thin a line, and from behind. I wonder if you had run the chocolate down the back of the bar allowing it to more freely fall from the bar rather than from behind it if it would be more convincing that it is actually coming from the bar.<br/>This is the only nit pick I have of this image. <br/> <br/>Overall: I enjoy looking at this image. As I said, I am waiting in anticipation.... :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Now, here is a fine idea... Allow me to  take some time to comment on this one. ;) Initial: Clean, interesting, emotive (for those of us who love chocolate) Composition: I like the way this is composed. My eye bounces back and forth between the foaming/bubbling liquid and the chocolate bar - all the time connected by the chocolate that is seemingly endlessly pouring into the cup... giving me a sense that at some point it might over flow. I know this will not happen, but emotionally, I fear it might and wait in anticipation anyway. Technical: The focus and lighting is good, making the colors true to their own.  What I would suggest: Though it sort of looks like you broke the chocolate bar open.. like it was a container ... allowing the contents to flow out, I am (in my reality) not convinced it is coming from the chocolate bar. it seems too thin a line, and from behind. I wonder if you had run the chocolate down the back of the bar allowing it to more freely fall from the bar rather than from behind it if it would be more convincing that it is actually coming from the bar.This is the only nit pick I have of this image.  Overall: I enjoy looking at this image. As I said, I am waiting in anticipation.... :) ', '2003-06-07 11:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(318225, 23829, 806, '<td valign="top">What a very bizarre but cool concept/image! what was your thought process that led you to this?<br/> <br/>lighting, clarity, focus, composition.. all good. tells a story... and keeps me pondering and interested.</td>', 'What a very bizarre but cool concept/image! what was your thought process that led you to this? lighting, clarity, focus, composition.. all good. tells a story... and keeps me pondering and interested.', '2003-06-07 11:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
