(318229, 23825, 1202, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but the flash didn''t help you much.  You might try diffusing your flash to get rid of the blown out area on the bottle, or just do it in daylight. It would also help if you didn''t center the subject.   5</td>', 'I like your idea but the flash didn''t help you much.  You might try diffusing your flash to get rid of the blown out area on the bottle, or just do it in daylight. It would also help if you didn''t center the subject.   5', '2003-06-07 11:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
