(318360, 23796, 7504, '<td valign="top">Neat!  I really like the colors here, very nice stop-action.  I bet this took a really long time to catch!</td>', 'Neat!  I really like the colors here, very nice stop-action.  I bet this took a really long time to catch!', '2003-06-07 15:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(318361, 23559, 7504, '<td valign="top">I can see what you''re trying to accomplish, and the star filter works well here.  I wish the focus were a bit better.</td>', 'I can see what you''re trying to accomplish, and the star filter works well here.  I wish the focus were a bit better.', '2003-06-07 15:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
