(318364, 23791, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Nice catch.</td>', 'Ouch!  Nice catch.', '2003-06-07 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318365, 23829, 7504, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, this works well.</td>', 'Cute idea, this works well.', '2003-06-07 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(318366, 23157, 9232, '<td valign="top">Wow.<br/> <br/>The symmetry of the egg is offset by the lack of centering the subject.  The colors are intense and the link between the light yellow of the egg cup and the darker yolk provide a link.  The running of the soft yolk is visceral and gives the picture some "live action".  I think this is an unusual subject and  just a great composition.</td>', 'Wow. The symmetry of the egg is offset by the lack of centering the subject.  The colors are intense and the link between the light yellow of the egg cup and the darker yolk provide a link.  The running of the soft yolk is visceral and gives the picture some "live action".  I think this is an unusual subject and  just a great composition.', '2003-06-07 16:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318368, 23154, 9232, '<td valign="top">The face in the drops makes this whole composition work.</td>', 'The face in the drops makes this whole composition work.', '2003-06-07 16:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(318370, 23781, 9232, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the white balance is off in this picture.  The lefthand pool of spilled liquid blends into the background at the bottom edge.  I''m intrigued by the subject matter and the color of the liquid.</td>', 'In my opinion the white balance is off in this picture.  The lefthand pool of spilled liquid blends into the background at the bottom edge.  I''m intrigued by the subject matter and the color of the liquid.', '2003-06-07 16:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(318374, 23748, 9232, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t have any good focal point in my opinion.  The red cap draws the eye but it doesn''t seem to have any action.  The action seems to exist in the liquid spilled (because of the bubbles) or in the brilliant green refraction just under the bottle.</td>', 'This image doesn''t have any good focal point in my opinion.  The red cap draws the eye but it doesn''t seem to have any action.  The action seems to exist in the liquid spilled (because of the bubbles) or in the brilliant green refraction just under the bottle.', '2003-06-07 16:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(318375, 23128, 9232, '<td valign="top">The color drew my eye initially.  The white background provides a good setting for the contrast between the blue and brass colors.</td>', 'The color drew my eye initially.  The white background provides a good setting for the contrast between the blue and brass colors.', '2003-06-07 16:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(318376, 23629, 9232, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  I think I would like a tighter composition.  I think cropping out everything from just about the center of the screen to the top would leave the picture with the charred lines to contrast against the liquid texture of the bubbles in the bottom of the photo.  I feel that the extra brown/copper color at teh top of the image detracts from the focus.  Overall I like the picture composition.</td>', 'Nice subject.  I think I would like a tighter composition.  I think cropping out everything from just about the center of the screen to the top would leave the picture with the charred lines to contrast against the liquid texture of the bubbles in the bottom of the photo.  I feel that the extra brown/copper color at teh top of the image detracts from the focus.  Overall I like the picture composition.', '2003-06-07 16:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(318378, 23744, 9232, '<td valign="top">Now this uses the same subject matter as another picture in this challenge.  This image, however, makes use of the rigid red cap as a backdrop for the lively green liquid.  Moving the red cap out of the center of the frame helps to draw the attention to the bubbles in the green liquid.  The liquid has a soft, alive contour as opposed to the sharp, distinct outline of the bottle and cap.  This composition seems much more alive and interesting to me than the previous post.</td>', 'Now this uses the same subject matter as another picture in this challenge.  This image, however, makes use of the rigid red cap as a backdrop for the lively green liquid.  Moving the red cap out of the center of the frame helps to draw the attention to the bubbles in the green liquid.  The liquid has a soft, alive contour as opposed to the sharp, distinct outline of the bottle and cap.  This composition seems much more alive and interesting to me than the previous post.', '2003-06-07 16:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318379, 23796, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  Bet the cleanup was a pain.</td>', 'Great action shot.  Bet the cleanup was a pain.', '2003-06-07 16:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(318381, 23557, 9232, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this angle makes or breaks this photo and because the challenge is "liquid" and this angle doesn''t demonstrate the "live" nature of the subject matter.  In a different challenge this picture could be very impressive.</td>', 'In my opinion this angle makes or breaks this photo and because the challenge is "liquid" and this angle doesn''t demonstrate the "live" nature of the subject matter.  In a different challenge this picture could be very impressive.', '2003-06-07 16:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(318384, 23215, 9232, '<td valign="top">While the composition of this image is impressive, what does it have to do with liquid?</td>', 'While the composition of this image is impressive, what does it have to do with liquid?', '2003-06-07 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(318385, 23631, 9232, '<td valign="top">This displays one property of semi-transparent liquids: refraction.  I happen to like this.</td>', 'This displays one property of semi-transparent liquids: refraction.  I happen to like this.', '2003-06-07 16:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(318386, 23535, 9232, '<td valign="top">I love that the inside of the bottle is mainly white while the spilled liquied has such a homogenous mixture of colors.  The swirls add life and action.</td>', 'I love that the inside of the bottle is mainly white while the spilled liquied has such a homogenous mixture of colors.  The swirls add life and action.', '2003-06-07 16:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318388, 23805, 9232, '<td valign="top">My opinion is that this would have worked as a still life composition of liquid where the reflection off the caramel implied the action of the the liquid but the still-running stream at the right of the image kills the message inherent in the glittering liquid.</td>', 'My opinion is that this would have worked as a still life composition of liquid where the reflection off the caramel implied the action of the the liquid but the still-running stream at the right of the image kills the message inherent in the glittering liquid.', '2003-06-07 16:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(318389, 23125, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good action shot</td>', 'Good action shot', '2003-06-07 16:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(318391, 23160, 9232, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject matter</td>', 'Pretty subject matter', '2003-06-07 16:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(318393, 23700, 9232, '<td valign="top">Superb subject matter and composition</td>', 'Superb subject matter and composition', '2003-06-07 16:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318394, 23457, 9232, '<td valign="top">The color of the liquid makes it seem warm and alilve, reinforcing the liquidity.  The contrast of the lined surface beneath the can and the clean lines and distinct areas of the can help to emphasize the liquid''s nature.  The out of focus mixing bowl also reinforces liquidity with is flowing lines and refections.</td>', 'The color of the liquid makes it seem warm and alilve, reinforcing the liquidity.  The contrast of the lined surface beneath the can and the clean lines and distinct areas of the can help to emphasize the liquid''s nature.  The out of focus mixing bowl also reinforces liquidity with is flowing lines and refections.', '2003-06-07 16:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(318395, 23740, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great choice of backgrounds for this.</td>', 'Great choice of backgrounds for this.', '2003-06-07 16:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(318397, 23837, 9232, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The action around the outside of the picture is grounded by the solid impression that the liquid stream lends to the center of the image.  This is a fantastic demonstration of utilizing one color almost exclusively.  Great composition for this challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  The action around the outside of the picture is grounded by the solid impression that the liquid stream lends to the center of the image.  This is a fantastic demonstration of utilizing one color almost exclusively.  Great composition for this challenge.', '2003-06-07 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(318398, 23636, 9232, '<td valign="top">Fun submission for this challenge</td>', 'Fun submission for this challenge', '2003-06-07 16:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(318399, 23180, 9232, '<td valign="top">Different take on the challenge.  By making the liquid such a smaller part, it gets a special emphasis.  Impressive submission.</td>', 'Different take on the challenge.  By making the liquid such a smaller part, it gets a special emphasis.  Impressive submission.', '2003-06-07 16:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(318401, 23510, 9232, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see the artistic value of this picture based on the warmth of its color and the contrasts between the light lines and the dark corners.  It doesn''t demonstrate liquidity to me though.</td>', 'I can definitely see the artistic value of this picture based on the warmth of its color and the contrasts between the light lines and the dark corners.  It doesn''t demonstrate liquidity to me though.', '2003-06-07 17:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(318402, 23449, 9232, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective.  It seems to miss the point of the challenge.  All-in-all, I like it.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective.  It seems to miss the point of the challenge.  All-in-all, I like it.', '2003-06-07 17:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(318403, 23629, 7758, '<td valign="top">good take on the theme, nicely composed too.</td>', 'good take on the theme, nicely composed too.', '2003-06-07 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
