(318677, 23740, 8530, '<td valign="top">Huh. I can''t decide if the textured surface is a plus -- it''s certainly more interesting than a plain one would be -- or a minus, in that it''s a little distracting at the same time. I like the idea.</td>', 'Huh. I can''t decide if the textured surface is a plus -- it''s certainly more interesting than a plain one would be -- or a minus, in that it''s a little distracting at the same time. I like the idea.', '2003-06-08 05:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(318678, 23831, 8530, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre bottle shape! Very interesting, better than a plain bottle would be. A bit bright overall.</td>', 'What a bizarre bottle shape! Very interesting, better than a plain bottle would be. A bit bright overall.', '2003-06-08 05:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(318679, 23393, 8530, '<td valign="top">Maybe a touch on the dark side. The bit of black in the bottom corner I presume is the edge of something; it might have been better without that visible. Otherwise the framing is good. It''s also overall pretty in a slightly abstract way, the mix of colours is nice.</td>', 'Maybe a touch on the dark side. The bit of black in the bottom corner I presume is the edge of something; it might have been better without that visible. Otherwise the framing is good. It''s also overall pretty in a slightly abstract way, the mix of colours is nice.', '2003-06-08 05:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(318680, 23297, 8530, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the idea but the fruit is a little unappealing with the spout chunked into it, it looks more wounded than pierced for juicing. I do like the cap to the side, and the framing and angle.</td>', 'I appreciate the idea but the fruit is a little unappealing with the spout chunked into it, it looks more wounded than pierced for juicing. I do like the cap to the side, and the framing and angle.', '2003-06-08 05:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(318681, 23462, 8530, '<td valign="top">Way too many people on this site like Coke. What''s wrong with Dr. Pepper? :)<br/> <br/>That having been said, I like you have a coke bottle and a coke glass. I haven''t seen a glass bottle of coke in a long time, though I know they still make them, and it''s much more interesting than the plastic ones in terms of a shot like this. The white background seems a little bright; maybe a countertop or a wooden table might have been better?</td>', 'Way too many people on this site like Coke. What''s wrong with Dr. Pepper? :) That having been said, I like you have a coke bottle and a coke glass. I haven''t seen a glass bottle of coke in a long time, though I know they still make them, and it''s much more interesting than the plastic ones in terms of a shot like this. The white background seems a little bright; maybe a countertop or a wooden table might have been better?', '2003-06-08 05:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(318682, 23781, 8530, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting choice of liquid but the shot itself would interest me more with more of a focus on the liquid, or it covering a greater area. Possibly given the paleness of the nail polish, a less-intensely-bright backdrop would have worked better; I''m curious what it would have looked like against black, in fact.</td>', 'It''s an interesting choice of liquid but the shot itself would interest me more with more of a focus on the liquid, or it covering a greater area. Possibly given the paleness of the nail polish, a less-intensely-bright backdrop would have worked better; I''m curious what it would have looked like against black, in fact.', '2003-06-08 05:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(318683, 23474, 8530, '<td valign="top">You will probably get some people who think this was too dark, but I like the light levels a lot. The idea is sound, but the wax in the upper container is a little bland -- I think this would be super-cool with a swirl of several colours of wax.</td>', 'You will probably get some people who think this was too dark, but I like the light levels a lot. The idea is sound, but the wax in the upper container is a little bland -- I think this would be super-cool with a swirl of several colours of wax.', '2003-06-08 05:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(318684, 23765, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is a bit abstract for my tastes although it is at least fairly clearly on topic. I am curious what the liquid is -- something carbonated, one presumes?</td>', 'This is a bit abstract for my tastes although it is at least fairly clearly on topic. I am curious what the liquid is -- something carbonated, one presumes?', '2003-06-08 05:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(318685, 23211, 8530, '<td valign="top">Aww, poor leaf. Neat idea, though. Is this the leaf from a rubber tree? It kind of reminds me of the type of sap you get from one. I like the lighting in this, highlighting the pale colour of the sap against the darkness of the leaf, and the depth of focus is quite good.</td>', 'Aww, poor leaf. Neat idea, though. Is this the leaf from a rubber tree? It kind of reminds me of the type of sap you get from one. I like the lighting in this, highlighting the pale colour of the sap against the darkness of the leaf, and the depth of focus is quite good.', '2003-06-08 05:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(318686, 23375, 8530, '<td valign="top">Inasmuch as silk starts out a liquid and this looks like it could be silk I''m afraid I don''t really consider this terribly on topic; ice cubes start out a liquid too, after all. The flag is pretty, but the background doesn''t do much to highlight it.</td>', 'Inasmuch as silk starts out a liquid and this looks like it could be silk I''m afraid I don''t really consider this terribly on topic; ice cubes start out a liquid too, after all. The flag is pretty, but the background doesn''t do much to highlight it.', '2003-06-08 05:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(318687, 23747, 8530, '<td valign="top">Is there actually liquid in this? Refraction isn''t clear enough to be sure if it''s that or simply cut glass. Also, is the liquid non-water as per challenge rules? I''m afraid with these things unclear I am not sure this really meets the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting-looking frog, a reasonable subject for a photo, though.</td>', 'Is there actually liquid in this? Refraction isn''t clear enough to be sure if it''s that or simply cut glass. Also, is the liquid non-water as per challenge rules? I''m afraid with these things unclear I am not sure this really meets the challenge topic. It''s an interesting-looking frog, a reasonable subject for a photo, though.', '2003-06-08 05:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(318688, 23693, 8530, '<td valign="top">Butter. Butter. ParKAAAAY. No, it looks like actual butter. Interesting idea. Good dark/light balance in terms of subject matter; maybe a touch bright in terms of lighting but not distractingly so.</td>', 'Butter. Butter. ParKAAAAY. No, it looks like actual butter. Interesting idea. Good dark/light balance in terms of subject matter; maybe a touch bright in terms of lighting but not distractingly so.', '2003-06-08 05:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(318690, 23827, 8530, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Slightly strange angle; the bottle and glass being cut off feels a bit awkward to me.</td>', 'Good idea. Slightly strange angle; the bottle and glass being cut off feels a bit awkward to me.', '2003-06-08 05:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(318691, 23625, 8530, '<td valign="top">The crusties on the bottle are a little unappetizing but overall it''s a solid topic-meeting shot. I like the spread of the moisture (or oil?) through what I''m presuming is a paper or thin cloth that the liquid is spilled on, helps with the feel of ''liquid''.</td>', 'The crusties on the bottle are a little unappetizing but overall it''s a solid topic-meeting shot. I like the spread of the moisture (or oil?) through what I''m presuming is a paper or thin cloth that the liquid is spilled on, helps with the feel of ''liquid''.', '2003-06-08 05:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(318693, 23557, 8530, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the hang-in-mid-air feel the shot gives off -- I presume you shot up through glass. Possibly without the cap/applicator it would have not felt so vertiginous. The lighting being de-emphasized on the liquid paper spill from the bottom also detracts a bit as it makes it a rather darkish shade of grey instead of the white I''m used to. The idea is sound, it''s the specific excecution I''m having some trouble with.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the hang-in-mid-air feel the shot gives off -- I presume you shot up through glass. Possibly without the cap/applicator it would have not felt so vertiginous. The lighting being de-emphasized on the liquid paper spill from the bottom also detracts a bit as it makes it a rather darkish shade of grey instead of the white I''m used to. The idea is sound, it''s the specific excecution I''m having some trouble with.', '2003-06-08 05:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(318694, 23624, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Chocolatey waterfall....<br/> <br/>Well, the lighting seems a little bright but I actually like the pattern it makes in the liquid, so only a ''little'' bright. I like the framing. The background is very slightly distracting but I don''t know you could have done much with that.</td>', 'Mmm. Chocolatey waterfall.... Well, the lighting seems a little bright but I actually like the pattern it makes in the liquid, so only a ''little'' bright. I like the framing. The background is very slightly distracting but I don''t know you could have done much with that.', '2003-06-08 05:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(318697, 23808, 8530, '<td valign="top">Inasmuch as I like the lighting and the glowy effect, I''m not convinced this is not water.</td>', 'Inasmuch as I like the lighting and the glowy effect, I''m not convinced this is not water.', '2003-06-08 05:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(318698, 23560, 8530, '<td valign="top">It just seems out of place, unfortunately. It''s one of those things where I like the hsot of the water and hills (though it''s a bit bright to the left) and I like the closeup of the cup in the grass but when you put the two together it doesn''t work for me, kinda like I like potatoes and I like mayonnaise but I hate potato salad.</td>', 'It just seems out of place, unfortunately. It''s one of those things where I like the hsot of the water and hills (though it''s a bit bright to the left) and I like the closeup of the cup in the grass but when you put the two together it doesn''t work for me, kinda like I like potatoes and I like mayonnaise but I hate potato salad.', '2003-06-08 05:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(318699, 23674, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mustard and ketchup, one presumes? How long did it take you to set this up? You have far more dedication than I do. :)<br/> <br/>It''s a very neat idea. Er, make that a very messy one. Er. You know. I hope. The whole shot concentrates on the liquid, which has been unusual this round, so that''s a plus. I''m not a big fan of abstracty stuff, which this is, but that''s personal taste and you can''t really account for that.</td>', 'Mustard and ketchup, one presumes? How long did it take you to set this up? You have far more dedication than I do. :) It''s a very neat idea. Er, make that a very messy one. Er. You know. I hope. The whole shot concentrates on the liquid, which has been unusual this round, so that''s a plus. I''m not a big fan of abstracty stuff, which this is, but that''s personal taste and you can''t really account for that.', '2003-06-08 05:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318700, 23198, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hah, excellent idea. Unfortunately, this more concentrates on the gaseous element than the liqiud one, but I will concede it is not OFF-topic. <br/> <br/>I think a bit more focus on the glass and flame would have been better. You could have set it up so the lighter fluid container was still partially visible and let us realize what it was; giving it equal time detracts a bit. Maybe by setting it back a few inches and moving the angle slightly?</td>', 'Hah, excellent idea. Unfortunately, this more concentrates on the gaseous element than the liqiud one, but I will concede it is not OFF-topic.  I think a bit more focus on the glass and flame would have been better. You could have set it up so the lighter fluid container was still partially visible and let us realize what it was; giving it equal time detracts a bit. Maybe by setting it back a few inches and moving the angle slightly?', '2003-06-08 05:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(318701, 23723, 8530, '<td valign="top">I cannot tell what this is -- something melting, presumably, but I can''t tell if despite the colour it''s water (that does rather look like rock salt) or what. This makes it hard to judge how on topic it is ("not water"). <br/> <br/>In terms of the setup, I think the blue-to-white like a wave-to-foam thing is a neat idea, though.</td>', 'I cannot tell what this is -- something melting, presumably, but I can''t tell if despite the colour it''s water (that does rather look like rock salt) or what. This makes it hard to judge how on topic it is ("not water").  In terms of the setup, I think the blue-to-white like a wave-to-foam thing is a neat idea, though.', '2003-06-08 05:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(318702, 23650, 8530, '<td valign="top">Blurred glass rim is very distracting. Either a different focal point or a different angle to avoid this would have been better. The fade into bright light that eradicates the straw looks a bit odd, like that half of the glass just doesn''t exist, which is a little disconcerting. I think the choice of angle was a good thought, it just didn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'Blurred glass rim is very distracting. Either a different focal point or a different angle to avoid this would have been better. The fade into bright light that eradicates the straw looks a bit odd, like that half of the glass just doesn''t exist, which is a little disconcerting. I think the choice of angle was a good thought, it just didn''t quite work for me.', '2003-06-08 05:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(318703, 23764, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping the bubbles are because it''s not water but something carbonated, because it seems a lot of people didn''t read that ''not water'' clause... I like the tunneling effect at the bottom, but overall this is far too abstract for my tastes, though it does convey the ''liquid'' portion of the challenge well (it''s just the ''not water'' part I''m not sure on).</td>', 'I''m hoping the bubbles are because it''s not water but something carbonated, because it seems a lot of people didn''t read that ''not water'' clause... I like the tunneling effect at the bottom, but overall this is far too abstract for my tastes, though it does convey the ''liquid'' portion of the challenge well (it''s just the ''not water'' part I''m not sure on).', '2003-06-08 05:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318704, 23169, 8530, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred the focus reversed -- sharp on the foreground, blurred on the back, that is. This version is rather distracting, since the focus is on the man but the eyes keep getting drawn to the blurry, bright yellow whic hI presume is another glass of liquid -- not even positive of that due to the amount of blur, just guessing from topic and title.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred the focus reversed -- sharp on the foreground, blurred on the back, that is. This version is rather distracting, since the focus is on the man but the eyes keep getting drawn to the blurry, bright yellow whic hI presume is another glass of liquid -- not even positive of that due to the amount of blur, just guessing from topic and title.', '2003-06-08 05:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(318705, 23330, 5822, '<td valign="top">Image quality appears poor, probably from resizing and the harsh lighting from above gives that distracting specular highlight on the bottle, although, I do like the way the lighting lends itself to the gradient of tones you obtained with the background.</td>', 'Image quality appears poor, probably from resizing and the harsh lighting from above gives that distracting specular highlight on the bottle, although, I do like the way the lighting lends itself to the gradient of tones you obtained with the background.', '2003-06-08 05:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(318706, 23482, 8530, '<td valign="top">I realize people prefer to set up shots like this with no visible human intervention but it looks a bit odd to me like the pitcher is suspended in mid-air rather than being poured. I think with more of a tilt downwards this impression would be reduced without introducing the hand. I also personally would not have minded the hand showing.<br/> <br/>I like the choice of mug/pitcher in terms of their attractiveness, and the pale but slightly patterned (if only by shadow) background, and the contrast between them. The concept is sound. There''s maybe a little too much negative space below the cup to balance the top out well.</td>', 'I realize people prefer to set up shots like this with no visible human intervention but it looks a bit odd to me like the pitcher is suspended in mid-air rather than being poured. I think with more of a tilt downwards this impression would be reduced without introducing the hand. I also personally would not have minded the hand showing. I like the choice of mug/pitcher in terms of their attractiveness, and the pale but slightly patterned (if only by shadow) background, and the contrast between them. The concept is sound. There''s maybe a little too much negative space below the cup to balance the top out well.', '2003-06-08 05:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(318709, 23662, 8530, '<td valign="top">Is this actually quicksilver? Huh, yeah, it looks like it is. I wasn''t sure what I was looking at until I looked up what your photo title meant, though I might have gotten it in time.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure how I feel about the use of stop-motion in this case; I think I''d rather have seen more of the quicksilver itself the flying droplets. But I do like how the shadows ended up, it''s kinda neat.</td>', 'Is this actually quicksilver? Huh, yeah, it looks like it is. I wasn''t sure what I was looking at until I looked up what your photo title meant, though I might have gotten it in time. I''m not sure how I feel about the use of stop-motion in this case; I think I''d rather have seen more of the quicksilver itself the flying droplets. But I do like how the shadows ended up, it''s kinda neat.', '2003-06-08 05:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(318710, 23310, 8530, '<td valign="top">Due to the very close-up shot this ends up too busy with lime, straw, and ice drawing the eye from the liquid. I also think a bit more distance or coming in from a bit higher would have been more attractive; there''s this refraction thing going on with the lime that is a bit eye-watering for me.</td>', 'Due to the very close-up shot this ends up too busy with lime, straw, and ice drawing the eye from the liquid. I also think a bit more distance or coming in from a bit higher would have been more attractive; there''s this refraction thing going on with the lime that is a bit eye-watering for me.', '2003-06-08 05:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(318711, 23752, 5822, '<td valign="top">You''ve really captured the color of the chocolate well and I like your idea here, but just find it not to be very convincing.</td>', 'You''ve really captured the color of the chocolate well and I like your idea here, but just find it not to be very convincing.', '2003-06-08 05:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(318712, 23642, 8530, '<td valign="top">If the flame were somewhat less bright -- er, I hope that''s meant to be flame, but I presume it is -- I think this would have worked better. Interesting use of focus so the bottle is clear; I think that''s feeding into the brightness, though.</td>', 'If the flame were somewhat less bright -- er, I hope that''s meant to be flame, but I presume it is -- I think this would have worked better. Interesting use of focus so the bottle is clear; I think that''s feeding into the brightness, though.', '2003-06-08 05:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(318713, 23833, 8530, '<td valign="top">Although this is a very nice shot overall, very attractive, and I agree that nail polish constitutes a ''liquid'', the focus seems to be "pretty woman''s foot and shoe", and not "liquid", so in terms of a challenge entry it loses a bit. I do like the use of tone in this quite a lot.</td>', 'Although this is a very nice shot overall, very attractive, and I agree that nail polish constitutes a ''liquid'', the focus seems to be "pretty woman''s foot and shoe", and not "liquid", so in terms of a challenge entry it loses a bit. I do like the use of tone in this quite a lot.', '2003-06-08 05:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(318715, 23835, 8530, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this and the colour spread to the foam thereby, as well as the tons of little bubbles. My one nit might be the bubbles represent ''gas'' more than they do ''liquid'', though I get the ''liquid'' feel from it anyhow.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this and the colour spread to the foam thereby, as well as the tons of little bubbles. My one nit might be the bubbles represent ''gas'' more than they do ''liquid'', though I get the ''liquid'' feel from it anyhow.', '2003-06-08 05:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(318716, 23215, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Completely off topic as far as I can tell. If there''s liquid here I am not seeing it.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Completely off topic as far as I can tell. If there''s liquid here I am not seeing it.', '2003-06-08 05:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(318717, 23701, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and I like the cropping of the composition so that you can''t see the tops of the bottles which creates a semi-abstract. Lighting may be a bit too harsh but it works here and I do find the lone label in the bottom right to be a little too distracting. But fine capture overall.</td>', 'Very nice colors and I like the cropping of the composition so that you can''t see the tops of the bottles which creates a semi-abstract. Lighting may be a bit too harsh but it works here and I do find the lone label in the bottom right to be a little too distracting. But fine capture overall.', '2003-06-08 05:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(318718, 23784, 8862, '<td valign="top">looks like it''s a little to blurred...</td>', 'looks like it''s a little to blurred...', '2003-06-08 05:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(318719, 23733, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, while this conveys a liquidy feel, I don''t care for the motion-capture lightning storm effect, quite honestly. And I can''t tell it''s ''syrup'' as per your title; the colour gives it much more of a watery feel, which is a shame given the topic specifications.</td>', 'Okay, while this conveys a liquidy feel, I don''t care for the motion-capture lightning storm effect, quite honestly. And I can''t tell it''s ''syrup'' as per your title; the colour gives it much more of a watery feel, which is a shame given the topic specifications.', '2003-06-08 05:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(318720, 23462, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish the reflection in the glass of the bottle weren''t there.</td>', 'I wish the reflection in the glass of the bottle weren''t there.', '2003-06-08 05:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(318721, 23678, 8530, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the pen is gorgeous. The semi-candid look is a nice touch. Just a touch more focus on the wet ink (or a touch more wet ink) would have helped in terms of challenge-meeting.</td>', 'I like the idea and the pen is gorgeous. The semi-candid look is a nice touch. Just a touch more focus on the wet ink (or a touch more wet ink) would have helped in terms of challenge-meeting.', '2003-06-08 05:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(318722, 23700, 8530, '<td valign="top">Refraction on the test tube is very startling. Interesting idea but I honestly think I would have liked it better without the test tube.</td>', 'Refraction on the test tube is very startling. Interesting idea but I honestly think I would have liked it better without the test tube.', '2003-06-08 05:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(318723, 23823, 8530, '<td valign="top">I agree your photo contains liquid. But when I look at it, I think, "Blood pressure", not "liquid", in other words, I have to work to make it on topic in my head. it was an interesting idea, and you''re the second person who has sent me to a dictionary to look up part of what their title meant, so I learned something from it.</td>', 'I agree your photo contains liquid. But when I look at it, I think, "Blood pressure", not "liquid", in other words, I have to work to make it on topic in my head. it was an interesting idea, and you''re the second person who has sent me to a dictionary to look up part of what their title meant, so I learned something from it.', '2003-06-08 06:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(318724, 23510, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''m afraid I don''t care for the lighting effects on this. Everything looks blurry and grainy as well. It''s definitely on-topic, I have no trouble with a sense of liqiud.</td>', 'Hmm, I''m afraid I don''t care for the lighting effects on this. Everything looks blurry and grainy as well. It''s definitely on-topic, I have no trouble with a sense of liqiud.', '2003-06-08 06:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(318725, 23796, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hehe. Nice shot, I really like the setup, the basic composition, and the moment of capture. I really don''t like the backdrop colour, I''m afraid; it''s a good contrast to the liquid colour but it''s extremely bright and somewhat jarring, and not really on my favorite list of colours anyhow. I''m wondering if you could have acheived as good a contrast with something a little less well-lit or a little less saturated in terms of colour... well, it''s a trade-off, maybe. Still, excellent overall.<br/> <br/>I''m assuming it''s inadvertant you have an eye-nose-eye shape in the mixer''s foundation, but you do, which is kinda neat.</td>', 'Hehe. Nice shot, I really like the setup, the basic composition, and the moment of capture. I really don''t like the backdrop colour, I''m afraid; it''s a good contrast to the liquid colour but it''s extremely bright and somewhat jarring, and not really on my favorite list of colours anyhow. I''m wondering if you could have acheived as good a contrast with something a little less well-lit or a little less saturated in terms of colour... well, it''s a trade-off, maybe. Still, excellent overall. I''m assuming it''s inadvertant you have an eye-nose-eye shape in the mixer''s foundation, but you do, which is kinda neat.', '2003-06-08 06:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(318726, 23173, 8862, '<td valign="top">1 grade adde dfor the guts of actullt licking it!</td>', '1 grade adde dfor the guts of actullt licking it!', '2003-06-08 06:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(318727, 23795, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice creamy/foamy effect, and I like the way the liquid comes off the ice. Maybe a bit too much ice -- ''on the rocks'' doesn''t have to mean ''completely full of ice cubes'', and it means we get to see less liquid. The folds in the backdrop are slightly distracting.</td>', 'Nice creamy/foamy effect, and I like the way the liquid comes off the ice. Maybe a bit too much ice -- ''on the rocks'' doesn''t have to mean ''completely full of ice cubes'', and it means we get to see less liquid. The folds in the backdrop are slightly distracting.', '2003-06-08 06:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(318728, 23228, 5822, '<td valign="top">The shadow really makes this shot for me along with the red color of the paint,  and I like the way the brush, bottle and shadow are all laid out here in an interesting arrangement of composition. I just think the lighting is too bright and the shadows should be darker. You may have been able to accomplish both by moving the light further from the bottle.</td>', 'The shadow really makes this shot for me along with the red color of the paint,  and I like the way the brush, bottle and shadow are all laid out here in an interesting arrangement of composition. I just think the lighting is too bright and the shadows should be darker. You may have been able to accomplish both by moving the light further from the bottle.', '2003-06-08 06:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(318729, 23809, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the back lighting here and the gradient background here. Composition is not all that interesting though.</td>', 'I like the back lighting here and the gradient background here. Composition is not all that interesting though.', '2003-06-08 06:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(318732, 23510, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and I like the different yellow/gold tones here. Lots of noise but it doesn''t detract from the shot.</td>', 'Nice abstract and I like the different yellow/gold tones here. Lots of noise but it doesn''t detract from the shot.', '2003-06-08 06:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(318735, 23771, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you''ve gotten here with the white milk on bottom and the blue bubbles on top.  Also like the blue cast you''ve achieved but am not crazy about the way the milk is lit with it being bright on the left side and in dark shadow on the right. Maybe more diffuse lighting would have been better.</td>', 'I like the effect you''ve gotten here with the white milk on bottom and the blue bubbles on top.  Also like the blue cast you''ve achieved but am not crazy about the way the milk is lit with it being bright on the left side and in dark shadow on the right. Maybe more diffuse lighting would have been better.', '2003-06-08 06:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(318738, 23817, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the directional lighting here and the red/purple area of the background that then fades to the dark blue in the background. Just wish that red/purple area was larger with more of a fade. Also, I find the flower''s color to be a bit bland and wish it were more saturated and a deeper color. Overall, I like this shot and the way the flower meets that honey thing. Good job!</td>', 'I like the directional lighting here and the red/purple area of the background that then fades to the dark blue in the background. Just wish that red/purple area was larger with more of a fade. Also, I find the flower''s color to be a bit bland and wish it were more saturated and a deeper color. Overall, I like this shot and the way the flower meets that honey thing. Good job!', '2003-06-08 06:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(318739, 23678, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the pen. I think this could have been more effective if the pen were lying next to, instead of on top of, the ink blots, which kind of blends in with the dark blue of the pen.</td>', 'Nice detail in the pen. I think this could have been more effective if the pen were lying next to, instead of on top of, the ink blots, which kind of blends in with the dark blue of the pen.', '2003-06-08 06:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318740, 23346, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstact design, I like the picture alot but I think it''s a stretch to say it satisfies the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice abstact design, I like the picture alot but I think it''s a stretch to say it satisfies the challenge.', '2003-06-08 06:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(318744, 23825, 5822, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition or viewpoint of this shot and the specular hightlight on the top of the bottle is very distracting.  I think it would have been more effective had the bottle been laying on it''s side with maybe some seaweed around to suggest it had been washed up on shore.  I also think a close up of the bottle would have been better so that you don''t see all those rocks. You''ve also lost detail in the top of the bottle which is as distracting as the highlight below it.</td>', 'I don''t like the composition or viewpoint of this shot and the specular hightlight on the top of the bottle is very distracting.  I think it would have been more effective had the bottle been laying on it''s side with maybe some seaweed around to suggest it had been washed up on shore.  I also think a close up of the bottle would have been better so that you don''t see all those rocks. You''ve also lost detail in the top of the bottle which is as distracting as the highlight below it.', '2003-06-08 06:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(318746, 23688, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish the shot had a more defined and well lit background.  Also, I think you could have directed more light on the taps. I find the mug a bit too bright. Good idea that could have been better executed with a little more thought.</td>', 'I wish the shot had a more defined and well lit background.  Also, I think you could have directed more light on the taps. I find the mug a bit too bright. Good idea that could have been better executed with a little more thought.', '2003-06-08 06:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(318753, 23508, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the crop dusting plane and of the effluent it''s emitting. I like the open feeling you get and the aerial perspective provided in the background. Also, I like the flatness of the foreground against the rising mountain in the background. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice capture of the crop dusting plane and of the effluent it''s emitting. I like the open feeling you get and the aerial perspective provided in the background. Also, I like the flatness of the foreground against the rising mountain in the background. Well done.', '2003-06-08 07:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(318755, 23629, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.....not sure what a mud pot is, but this is very interesting to look at and the picture even has an abstract quality I like.  The composition is wonderful with it''s triangular quadrants whose points meet in the middle.  I love that you could see the bubbles and hot steam rising from the foreground and core (volcano?) liquid. Colors are rich and the gold/rust color at the top adds even more interest.  Very well done and I"m rooting for you to finish high.</td>', 'Excellent photo.....not sure what a mud pot is, but this is very interesting to look at and the picture even has an abstract quality I like.  The composition is wonderful with it''s triangular quadrants whose points meet in the middle.  I love that you could see the bubbles and hot steam rising from the foreground and core (volcano?) liquid. Colors are rich and the gold/rust color at the top adds even more interest.  Very well done and I"m rooting for you to finish high.', '2003-06-08 07:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(318756, 23813, 9083, '<td valign="top">Imaginative, lovely shot</td>', 'Imaginative, lovely shot', '2003-06-08 07:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(318757, 23396, 5822, '<td valign="top">This photo is uninteresting and appears that not much thought went into it''s taking. Here''s some suggestion to improve it: First, a nice big head of beer dripping down the side of the glass would add more interest. Also, while I like the background, the fact that it ends and the beer is sitting on an ugly table makes this look like a snapshot. Get rid of the table by using  muslin, canvas or other type of cloth for your background and have it extend down on top of the table and have your glass of beer sit on it. Also, backlighting of the glass of beer would have given you more interesting colors in the beer and a seperate light for the background would have added depth and an overall better effect.  Good luck in future challenges and I hope this has been helpful to you.</td>', 'This photo is uninteresting and appears that not much thought went into it''s taking. Here''s some suggestion to improve it: First, a nice big head of beer dripping down the side of the glass would add more interest. Also, while I like the background, the fact that it ends and the beer is sitting on an ugly table makes this look like a snapshot. Get rid of the table by using  muslin, canvas or other type of cloth for your background and have it extend down on top of the table and have your glass of beer sit on it. Also, backlighting of the glass of beer would have given you more interesting colors in the beer and a seperate light for the background would have added depth and an overall better effect.  Good luck in future challenges and I hope this has been helpful to you.', '2003-06-08 07:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(318758, 23775, 5822, '<td valign="top">You''re being too cheap with the drip! Can hardly see it.</td>', 'You''re being too cheap with the drip! Can hardly see it.', '2003-06-08 07:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(318759, 23619, 7570, '<td valign="top">less DOF would be even better</td>', 'less DOF would be even better', '2003-06-08 07:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(318760, 23642, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very good idea!  The flame is blown out and overexposed and lacking in detail. Also, I would have liked to have seen the bottle from the side, and not head on.  The black background goes very well with the flame and I think you can have a very effective photo if you improve your technique.</td>', 'Very good idea!  The flame is blown out and overexposed and lacking in detail. Also, I would have liked to have seen the bottle from the side, and not head on.  The black background goes very well with the flame and I think you can have a very effective photo if you improve your technique.', '2003-06-08 07:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(318761, 23839, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and I like the indistinctness of the bottom of the glass and the way the blue appears to glow.  I do find the orange light at the bottom to be distracting.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and I like the indistinctness of the bottom of the glass and the way the blue appears to glow.  I do find the orange light at the bottom to be distracting.', '2003-06-08 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(318763, 23806, 5822, '<td valign="top">Absolutely disgusting and gross. Get this kid to a doctor!</td>', 'Absolutely disgusting and gross. Get this kid to a doctor!', '2003-06-08 08:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(318779, 23666, 3084, '<td valign="top">Superb image.  Tied for my pick of the week.  I am looking forward to hear how you were able to create this image.  How did you synchronize the triggering of the camera with the instant that the milk crown appeared?  10 Morgan</td>', 'Superb image.  Tied for my pick of the week.  I am looking forward to hear how you were able to create this image.  How did you synchronize the triggering of the camera with the instant that the milk crown appeared?  10 Morgan', '2003-06-08 09:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318780, 23317, 4090, '<td valign="top">the best of the bunch ... 10/10 ( the only this that spoils it is the wee bubble in the honey)</td>', 'the best of the bunch ... 10/10 ( the only this that spoils it is the wee bubble in the honey)', '2003-06-08 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(318781, 23834, 4090, '<td valign="top">LOL .... 8/10</td>', 'LOL .... 8/10', '2003-06-08 09:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(318782, 23560, 3084, '<td valign="top">Yea Tim''s.  I remember when they opened the very first store in Hamilton.  Also, I vividly recall the night that he crashed his sports car on the QEW Highway very near my home.  You get a 9 for being Canadian.  Where are you, BC, QC or ON?  9  Morgan</td>', 'Yea Tim''s.  I remember when they opened the very first store in Hamilton.  Also, I vividly recall the night that he crashed his sports car on the QEW Highway very near my home.  You get a 9 for being Canadian.  Where are you, BC, QC or ON?  9  Morgan', '2003-06-08 09:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318783, 23761, 3084, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  9  Morgan</td>', 'Very nice image.  9  Morgan', '2003-06-08 09:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(318784, 23721, 3084, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like it.  I was going to give you a 9, but now that I look at it again, I think that you will get a 10 because it is FUN to look at.  10  Morgan</td>', 'Nice image.  I like it.  I was going to give you a 9, but now that I look at it again, I think that you will get a 10 because it is FUN to look at.  10  Morgan', '2003-06-08 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(318785, 23554, 4090, '<td valign="top">WOW..... 10/10</td>', 'WOW..... 10/10', '2003-06-08 09:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(318787, 23666, 4090, '<td valign="top">this has the wow factor 9/10 -</td>', 'this has the wow factor 9/10 -', '2003-06-08 09:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(318788, 23761, 8274, '<td valign="top">Quite unusual - it has me guessing</td>', 'Quite unusual - it has me guessing', '2003-06-08 09:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(318789, 23454, 8274, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of B/W. Perfect exposure, even the look of the girl is...mmm</td>', 'Excellent use of B/W. Perfect exposure, even the look of the girl is...mmm', '2003-06-08 09:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(318790, 23629, 8274, '<td valign="top">Quite interesting, would have made a nice close up if possible</td>', 'Quite interesting, would have made a nice close up if possible', '2003-06-08 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(318793, 23709, 8274, '<td valign="top">I can''t look at this without squinting myself...</td>', 'I can''t look at this without squinting myself...', '2003-06-08 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(318796, 23173, 8274, '<td valign="top">OK, I''ll give you a good mark for orginality!</td>', 'OK, I''ll give you a good mark for orginality!', '2003-06-08 10:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(318807, 23685, 1664, '<td valign="top">My apologies, but I don''t understand it.</td>', 'My apologies, but I don''t understand it.', '2003-06-08 11:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(318809, 23454, 1664, '<td valign="top">Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo.', '2003-06-08 11:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(318825, 23173, 5869, '<td valign="top">Very British ....unfortunately most of the US viewers on this site just won''t get it</td>', 'Very British ....unfortunately most of the US viewers on this site just won''t get it', '2003-06-08 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(318830, 23128, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the combinations of colors and the reflections in the liquid.  I''d have cropped on the left.  Wish the DOF was a bit larger so the scrubber was all in focus.</td>', 'I like the combinations of colors and the reflections in the liquid.  I''d have cropped on the left.  Wish the DOF was a bit larger so the scrubber was all in focus.', '2003-06-08 12:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(318832, 23667, 7628, '<td valign="top">The focus here is the flame, although it is surrounded by liquid (melted wax or cadle floating in water?) It is a busy composition - wish it has a little more cohesion.</td>', 'The focus here is the flame, although it is surrounded by liquid (melted wax or cadle floating in water?) It is a busy composition - wish it has a little more cohesion.', '2003-06-08 12:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(318833, 23317, 5869, '<td valign="top">I just wish I had thought of this.  Fantastic.  Crisp Focus ...how many times in this challenge have people missed focus. ?</td>', 'I just wish I had thought of this.  Fantastic.  Crisp Focus ...how many times in this challenge have people missed focus. ?', '2003-06-08 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(318834, 23522, 5869, '<td valign="top">Really well chosen colour...gets the best from the liquid movement</td>', 'Really well chosen colour...gets the best from the liquid movement', '2003-06-08 12:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(318835, 23690, 5869, '<td valign="top">Great Image, good colour banding...oh by the way what is Mongolian fire oil (other that what it says)?</td>', 'Great Image, good colour banding...oh by the way what is Mongolian fire oil (other that what it says)?', '2003-06-08 12:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(318836, 23317, 7628, '<td valign="top">A fun idea - simple and effective.  The liquid really "pops" out.  The small DOF exagerates what the honey drop does - brings the eye to focus on the honey and the words it magnifies.  I wonder if an off-center crop would work better? Something on the "thirds" line?</td>', 'A fun idea - simple and effective.  The liquid really "pops" out.  The small DOF exagerates what the honey drop does - brings the eye to focus on the honey and the words it magnifies.  I wonder if an off-center crop would work better? Something on the "thirds" line?', '2003-06-08 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318837, 23700, 5869, '<td valign="top">Great colours, great setting, crystal clear ...just what I like.  Well done.</td>', 'Great colours, great setting, crystal clear ...just what I like.  Well done.', '2003-06-08 12:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(318838, 23699, 5869, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, perhaps a bit of additional lighting would have highlighted the water droplets a bit more</td>', 'Lovely image, perhaps a bit of additional lighting would have highlighted the water droplets a bit more', '2003-06-08 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(318839, 23666, 5869, '<td valign="top">OK how did you get the white splash from apparent blue liquid.  Would be a great ad for Cadbury''s Milk chocolate ...the colours are just right.</td>', 'OK how did you get the white splash from apparent blue liquid.  Would be a great ad for Cadbury''s Milk chocolate ...the colours are just right.', '2003-06-08 13:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(318840, 23583, 5869, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colour, the background is great for this as well.  Well chosen and shot</td>', 'Fantastic colour, the background is great for this as well.  Well chosen and shot', '2003-06-08 13:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(318841, 23689, 7628, '<td valign="top">The shaow of the spoon (the handle disappearing into the top left) gives an interesting depth - wish you could have featured it more in the composition.  The shadow under the dripping honey workes well to highlight the dibble.  The sides of the photo are uninteresting, maybe crop closer to the "action."  Perhaps some deeper gold tone would work well with the subject and title.</td>', 'The shaow of the spoon (the handle disappearing into the top left) gives an interesting depth - wish you could have featured it more in the composition.  The shadow under the dripping honey workes well to highlight the dibble.  The sides of the photo are uninteresting, maybe crop closer to the "action."  Perhaps some deeper gold tone would work well with the subject and title.', '2003-06-08 13:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(318843, 23187, 7628, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught that beautiful evening blue sky after sunset!  My favorite color.  Was it a long exposure?  the moon seems to have moved a bit.  But the star and planet are sharp.  Very pretty and peaceful image.  To be literal - it isn;t liquid, but as a metaphore it works fine - the sun has "melted"</td>', 'You''ve caught that beautiful evening blue sky after sunset!  My favorite color.  Was it a long exposure?  the moon seems to have moved a bit.  But the star and planet are sharp.  Very pretty and peaceful image.  To be literal - it isn;t liquid, but as a metaphore it works fine - the sun has "melted"', '2003-06-08 13:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(318845, 23715, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the glow of the olive oil - just the right color.  The distortion/magnification of the olive is very thematic - show the density of this liquid.  The sloping sides of the glass are a bit jarring to the eye, and that bit of blue reflection in the bottom right.  I''d like to see how it would be cropped tighter to the olive - maybe cutting out the background entirely - only leaving the bottom bit of the glass to provide some context.</td>', 'I like the glow of the olive oil - just the right color.  The distortion/magnification of the olive is very thematic - show the density of this liquid.  The sloping sides of the glass are a bit jarring to the eye, and that bit of blue reflection in the bottom right.  I''d like to see how it would be cropped tighter to the olive - maybe cutting out the background entirely - only leaving the bottom bit of the glass to provide some context.', '2003-06-08 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(318850, 23828, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice froston the glass, and great glow of amber color in the beer.  I wish there wasn''t glare on the bottle lable.</td>', 'Nice froston the glass, and great glow of amber color in the beer.  I wish there wasn''t glare on the bottle lable.', '2003-06-08 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(318852, 23740, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see the texture of the surface through the honey.  Good diagonal composition, bursts if highlights and dark corner to dark corner.  Well done.</td>', 'I like how you can see the texture of the surface through the honey.  Good diagonal composition, bursts if highlights and dark corner to dark corner.  Well done.', '2003-06-08 13:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(318854, 23758, 7628, '<td valign="top">Adorable kid!  I like the gray wardrobe, and the gray sky - makes the red of the powerade stand out.  I think it would be a stronger photo if the bottle didn''t have a lable - just the simple red liquid</td>', 'Adorable kid!  I like the gray wardrobe, and the gray sky - makes the red of the powerade stand out.  I think it would be a stronger photo if the bottle didn''t have a lable - just the simple red liquid', '2003-06-08 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(318861, 23796, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great action catch. The strongly coloured background actually detracts from it for me, but still a great idea and good shot. What is the liquid?</td>', 'Great action catch. The strongly coloured background actually detracts from it for me, but still a great idea and good shot. What is the liquid?', '2003-06-08 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(318862, 23506, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract/</td>', 'Nice abstract/', '2003-06-08 13:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(318863, 23620, 3290, '<td valign="top">A little bright on the highlights and a little more DOF would have helped. Caught the glossy colour of the honey well.</td>', 'A little bright on the highlights and a little more DOF would have helped. Caught the glossy colour of the honey well.', '2003-06-08 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(318864, 23754, 3290, '<td valign="top">Yum. Nice high-key effect. Bit of a large one though, isn''t it? :-)</td>', 'Yum. Nice high-key effect. Bit of a large one though, isn''t it? :-)', '2003-06-08 13:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(318867, 23808, 7628, '<td valign="top">One wild looking liquid! I like the glow. Strange refelctions off to the left.  I''m not sure how you did this so I can''t begin to suggest what to do about them, but ot would look better if the glass were against an entirely black background.  Maybe compose on a glass surface with the light below?</td>', 'One wild looking liquid! I like the glow. Strange refelctions off to the left.  I''m not sure how you did this so I can''t begin to suggest what to do about them, but ot would look better if the glass were against an entirely black background.  Maybe compose on a glass surface with the light below?', '2003-06-08 13:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(318871, 23690, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colours - I like the composition too.</td>', 'Very pretty colours - I like the composition too.', '2003-06-08 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(318882, 23222, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Very creative!  Made me laugh .  Jacko.  10</td>', 'lol.  Very creative!  Made me laugh .  Jacko.  10', '2003-06-08 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(318886, 23666, 2716, '<td valign="top">wo!  That is awesome.  Very nice capture.  My pick for #1 this week.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'wo!  That is awesome.  Very nice capture.  My pick for #1 this week.  Jacko.  10', '2003-06-08 14:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(318890, 23834, 2716, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the chuckles.  Very creative.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Thanks for the chuckles.  Very creative.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-08 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(318893, 23774, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love the negative space.  Good work.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Love the negative space.  Good work.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-08 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(318904, 23497, 6900, '<td valign="top">I have no clue what this is.</td>', 'I have no clue what this is.', '2003-06-08 15:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(318905, 23820, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting movement and lighting - The face should have either been more blurred or less, though.</td>', 'Interesting movement and lighting - The face should have either been more blurred or less, though.', '2003-06-08 15:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(318907, 23756, 6900, '<td valign="top">Seems very blurry - Auto focus hates shiny objects.</td>', 'Seems very blurry - Auto focus hates shiny objects.', '2003-06-08 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(318908, 23806, 6900, '<td valign="top">This kid looks SO sad!</td>', 'This kid looks SO sad!', '2003-06-08 15:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(318910, 23738, 6900, '<td valign="top">A good subject choice, but the stray reflections and noise/dirt detract from an interesting abstract.</td>', 'A good subject choice, but the stray reflections and noise/dirt detract from an interesting abstract.', '2003-06-08 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(318913, 23784, 6900, '<td valign="top">The white dots are a bit distracting, but otherwise an interesting abstract composition - nice work.</td>', 'The white dots are a bit distracting, but otherwise an interesting abstract composition - nice work.', '2003-06-08 15:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(318914, 23508, 6900, '<td valign="top">The sky looks painted!  What interesting colors and a great grab of the pesticides/fertilizers.</td>', 'The sky looks painted!  What interesting colors and a great grab of the pesticides/fertilizers.', '2003-06-08 15:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(318915, 23228, 6900, '<td valign="top">The top of the bottle blends a bit with the paint, but I like this.  The shadow is a bit grainy, but not much you can do about that other than process it out.  Good job overall.  I like this shot.</td>', 'The top of the bottle blends a bit with the paint, but I like this.  The shadow is a bit grainy, but not much you can do about that other than process it out.  Good job overall.  I like this shot.', '2003-06-08 15:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(318917, 23574, 6900, '<td valign="top">The left side is a bit too dark, the right a lot too bright - at least for being in the same picture.  I love the condensation and the "texture" of this shot.  I don''t like the marketing - wouldn''t love to see this in the top 3 and starbucks to get a free dpc ad for a week, though.</td>', 'The left side is a bit too dark, the right a lot too bright - at least for being in the same picture.  I love the condensation and the "texture" of this shot.  I don''t like the marketing - wouldn''t love to see this in the top 3 and starbucks to get a free dpc ad for a week, though.', '2003-06-08 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(318919, 23740, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture on the background - nice straight lines can be difficult to do.  Good work.</td>', 'Interesting texture on the background - nice straight lines can be difficult to do.  Good work.', '2003-06-08 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(318920, 23824, 5333, '<td valign="top">I like the addition of the strawberry, it kinda offset the photo.</td>', 'I like the addition of the strawberry, it kinda offset the photo.', '2003-06-08 15:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(318921, 23557, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting from below composition - I would have preferred some light on this side, however.</td>', 'Interesting from below composition - I would have preferred some light on this side, however.', '2003-06-08 15:08:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(318922, 23475, 6900, '<td valign="top">Oooh  the thin line of honey pouring into the spoon is great.  One of the best I''ve seen for this challenge.  I wish the end of the drop in the coffee was more clear.</td>', 'Oooh  the thin line of honey pouring into the spoon is great.  One of the best I''ve seen for this challenge.  I wish the end of the drop in the coffee was more clear.', '2003-06-08 15:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(318923, 23787, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract - not sure exactly what it is.</td>', 'Interesting abstract - not sure exactly what it is.', '2003-06-08 15:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(318924, 23552, 6900, '<td valign="top">Focus seems off here.  Try to diffuse the lighting to avoid those reflections as well.</td>', 'Focus seems off here.  Try to diffuse the lighting to avoid those reflections as well.', '2003-06-08 15:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(318926, 23624, 6900, '<td valign="top">I don''t like whatever you''re pouring from - the colors are very distracting.  The way the light is playing on this at the top is great, though!</td>', 'I don''t like whatever you''re pouring from - the colors are very distracting.  The way the light is playing on this at the top is great, though!', '2003-06-08 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(318927, 23636, 6900, '<td valign="top">WHOA whoops!  Excellent capture.  I bet he was saying "put your gd camera down and CALL 911!!"  8</td>', 'WHOA whoops!  Excellent capture.  I bet he was saying "put your gd camera down and CALL 911!!"  8', '2003-06-08 15:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(318928, 23700, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors - one of the best of the week.  I like the back/top lighting that causes the shadows to come at us.  10</td>', 'Wonderful colors - one of the best of the week.  I like the back/top lighting that causes the shadows to come at us.  10', '2003-06-08 15:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(318930, 23800, 6900, '<td valign="top">Very bright whites on the sides - they almost wash out the edges of the shot.</td>', 'Very bright whites on the sides - they almost wash out the edges of the shot.', '2003-06-08 15:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(318931, 23803, 6900, '<td valign="top">An interesting liquid abstract - Not sure the b/w helps this shot.</td>', 'An interesting liquid abstract - Not sure the b/w helps this shot.', '2003-06-08 15:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(318932, 23393, 6900, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to realize what I was looking at - I don''t think you have enough light here and your shadows fall in strange places - what about lighting this from above, and diffusing the light?  Good composition.</td>', 'Took me a second to realize what I was looking at - I don''t think you have enough light here and your shadows fall in strange places - what about lighting this from above, and diffusing the light?  Good composition.', '2003-06-08 15:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(318933, 23619, 6900, '<td valign="top">I wish we were a little closer or there were more of them.</td>', 'I wish we were a little closer or there were more of them.', '2003-06-08 15:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(318934, 23731, 6900, '<td valign="top">Shot seems a little blurry and the colors are a bit too muted.   Excellent composition.</td>', 'Shot seems a little blurry and the colors are a bit too muted.   Excellent composition.', '2003-06-08 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(318935, 23576, 6900, '<td valign="top">Kickass pic.  I hate the border but LOVE the picture.  9</td>', 'Kickass pic.  I hate the border but LOVE the picture.  9', '2003-06-08 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(318937, 23490, 6900, '<td valign="top">Only occassionally does a border make a picture less pleasing to look at - but that''s what is going on here.  I see the Coors and get the "liquid" connection, but your pic of liquid is one of water.</td>', 'Only occassionally does a border make a picture less pleasing to look at - but that''s what is going on here.  I see the Coors and get the "liquid" connection, but your pic of liquid is one of water.', '2003-06-08 15:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(318939, 23835, 6900, '<td valign="top">Good, fast capture, before the bubbles flew off the berry.</td>', 'Good, fast capture, before the bubbles flew off the berry.', '2003-06-08 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(318940, 23125, 6900, '<td valign="top">Haha  I splashed too this week.  It''s harder than people make it look. I like the green in the shadow, but your light is too far away or too diffused - you can make that shadow stand out even more.  Glass is hard to photograph.  Good job.</td>', 'Haha  I splashed too this week.  It''s harder than people make it look. I like the green in the shadow, but your light is too far away or too diffused - you can make that shadow stand out even more.  Glass is hard to photograph.  Good job.', '2003-06-08 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(318941, 23715, 6900, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting and composition.  9</td>', 'Fabulous lighting and composition.  9', '2003-06-08 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(318942, 23779, 6900, '<td valign="top">Good composition - the candle holder is a bit cracked or dirty and the wax is far from perfect.  This would have looked better with a really clean/new candle and a bit of color.</td>', 'Good composition - the candle holder is a bit cracked or dirty and the wax is far from perfect.  This would have looked better with a really clean/new candle and a bit of color.', '2003-06-08 15:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(318943, 23620, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent minus that one very very bright and annoying spot of light.</td>', 'Excellent minus that one very very bright and annoying spot of light.', '2003-06-08 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(318944, 23824, 6900, '<td valign="top">Good color, but the syrup looks strange and we can barely see the syrup that''s dripped onto the plate.  Great idea - originality scores here.  8</td>', 'Good color, but the syrup looks strange and we can barely see the syrup that''s dripped onto the plate.  Great idea - originality scores here.  8', '2003-06-08 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(318946, 23709, 6900, '<td valign="top">Aren''t tears saltwater?  Good composition and accent on the tear.  7</td>', 'Aren''t tears saltwater?  Good composition and accent on the tear.  7', '2003-06-08 15:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(318947, 23346, 6900, '<td valign="top">I don''t see liquid.</td>', 'I don''t see liquid.', '2003-06-08 15:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(318948, 23666, 6900, '<td valign="top">Obvious best of the week.  Can''t wait to read the details - extraordinary capture.  10</td>', 'Obvious best of the week.  Can''t wait to read the details - extraordinary capture.  10', '2003-06-08 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(318949, 23765, 6900, '<td valign="top">Very busy composition - not sure what i''m looking at.</td>', 'Very busy composition - not sure what i''m looking at.', '2003-06-08 15:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(318950, 23733, 6900, '<td valign="top">Fancy lighting - you moved it around?  good shot.</td>', 'Fancy lighting - you moved it around?  good shot.', '2003-06-08 15:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(318951, 23823, 6900, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo of a somewhat uninteresting subject - the liquid is there, but ... I don''t know.  Maybe if you were closer or further back, or changed something overall.</td>', 'It''s a good photo of a somewhat uninteresting subject - the liquid is there, but ... I don''t know.  Maybe if you were closer or further back, or changed something overall.', '2003-06-08 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(318953, 23631, 6900, '<td valign="top">The stray oil droplets are a bit much, but the color is great - it''s unfortunate that those dark dots are in there.</td>', 'The stray oil droplets are a bit much, but the color is great - it''s unfortunate that those dark dots are in there.', '2003-06-08 15:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(318954, 23633, 6900, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look very appetizing!</td>', 'This doesn''t look very appetizing!', '2003-06-08 15:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(318955, 23442, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract - not sure what I''m looking at though!</td>', 'Interesting abstract - not sure what I''m looking at though!', '2003-06-08 15:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(318956, 23811, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract - I wish it were a bit lighter.</td>', 'Nice abstract - I wish it were a bit lighter.', '2003-06-08 15:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(318957, 23813, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  The lighting is a bit harsh and direct, but otherwise what a great superb shot.  A wonderful idea and composition - 9 despite the lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  The lighting is a bit harsh and direct, but otherwise what a great superb shot.  A wonderful idea and composition - 9 despite the lighting.', '2003-06-08 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(318959, 23662, 5333, '<td valign="top">Mercury?  Where do you find so much?</td>', 'Mercury?  Where do you find so much?', '2003-06-08 15:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
