(319143, 23228, 7628, '<td valign="top">That is a nice liquid.  A bit much saturation - the red leaking into the shadow.  I wish the paint spill were a bit larger, more splattered perhaps.  Id like a closer crop.<br/></td>', 'That is a nice liquid.  A bit much saturation - the red leaking into the shadow.  I wish the paint spill were a bit larger, more splattered perhaps.  Id like a closer crop.', '2003-06-08 22:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(319144, 23694, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea - reflections of bottles of liquid  - figurative mixing in the glass of what would literally mix well.  I don''t know how but I would wish the composition could be more clean - the surface all black, no distracting highlights of of the bottle caps, and no glare down the front of the glass.  But since I''ve never tried this I have to give you credit - looks like you worked hard at it.</td>', 'An interesting idea - reflections of bottles of liquid  - figurative mixing in the glass of what would literally mix well.  I don''t know how but I would wish the composition could be more clean - the surface all black, no distracting highlights of of the bottle caps, and no glare down the front of the glass.  But since I''ve never tried this I have to give you credit - looks like you worked hard at it.', '2003-06-08 22:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
