(319375, 23093, 9247, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the contrast in the black and white paint from that one stream in the middle.  The balance could be better. There''s too much empty space to the right IMHO., but thats hard to controll if the paint was flowing.<br/> <br/>Overall, it has very good detail and tones.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the contrast in the black and white paint from that one stream in the middle.  The balance could be better. There''s too much empty space to the right IMHO., but thats hard to controll if the paint was flowing. Overall, it has very good detail and tones.', '2003-06-09 02:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(319398, 23309, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Popcorn.<br/> <br/>I don''t know. The shot makes me hungry, that suggests it''s at least a good shot of popcorn, but it''s not really the world''s most interesting topic. Plus for being on topic and the butter being seriously visible.</td>', 'Mmm. Popcorn. I don''t know. The shot makes me hungry, that suggests it''s at least a good shot of popcorn, but it''s not really the world''s most interesting topic. Plus for being on topic and the butter being seriously visible.', '2003-06-09 03:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319399, 23805, 8530, '<td valign="top">Man, all you people with your food shots are just CRUEL.<br/> <br/>I like this, the pouring caramel, the pretty caramel on the ice cream... would be interesting to see it in a classier bowl but it''s fine as is.</td>', 'Man, all you people with your food shots are just CRUEL. I like this, the pouring caramel, the pretty caramel on the ice cream... would be interesting to see it in a classier bowl but it''s fine as is.', '2003-06-09 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(319400, 23786, 8530, '<td valign="top">Eh. I know, it says ''film developer'' up there, so I won''t say anything about the water-looking part, though I still would have wished for a more obvious non-water subject. But this isn''t really interesting. Now, a shot of a home-developing lab with this as the prominent foreground object might have worked better.</td>', 'Eh. I know, it says ''film developer'' up there, so I won''t say anything about the water-looking part, though I still would have wished for a more obvious non-water subject. But this isn''t really interesting. Now, a shot of a home-developing lab with this as the prominent foreground object might have worked better.', '2003-06-09 03:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319402, 23312, 8530, '<td valign="top">Oh, hey, neat. I don''t think I''ve seen any other bath products, so so far it''s more original than many of the shots, and I like the shot of gold floating in the bath oil, and the tilt of the bottle. It''d make a good ad shot.</td>', 'Oh, hey, neat. I don''t think I''ve seen any other bath products, so so far it''s more original than many of the shots, and I like the shot of gold floating in the bath oil, and the tilt of the bottle. It''d make a good ad shot.', '2003-06-09 03:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(319403, 23711, 8530, '<td valign="top">Very clinical and ominous. I wish you''d not included the border as it''s distracting. The lighting goes with the clinical setting but feels a bit bright on the left.</td>', 'Very clinical and ominous. I wish you''d not included the border as it''s distracting. The lighting goes with the clinical setting but feels a bit bright on the left.', '2003-06-09 03:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(319404, 23763, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific! Has that wow effect. Very nice colors and I like the color in the ice cubes and the way the color is confined to their individual cubes and don\''t bleed out to the others.  Very rich looking blues here too.</td>', 'Terrific! Has that wow effect. Very nice colors and I like the color in the ice cubes and the way the color is confined to their individual cubes and don\''t bleed out to the others.  Very rich looking blues here too.', '2003-06-09 03:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(319405, 23449, 8530, '<td valign="top">water = off-topic.<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting idea. Can''t tell how you did that quite but I like the thought.</td>', 'water = off-topic. It''s an interesting idea. Can''t tell how you did that quite but I like the thought.', '2003-06-09 03:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(319407, 23770, 8530, '<td valign="top">There''s a distracting reflection on the tile, and I think it''s a bit too close-up on the spoon, a bit too much light on it too. The idea is not a bad one but I think the composition suffers from a too-distracting background in general.</td>', 'There''s a distracting reflection on the tile, and I think it''s a bit too close-up on the spoon, a bit too much light on it too. The idea is not a bad one but I think the composition suffers from a too-distracting background in general.', '2003-06-09 03:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(319408, 23839, 8530, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool, a little strange, though. Is that milk? Nice lighting.</td>', 'Kind of cool, a little strange, though. Is that milk? Nice lighting.', '2003-06-09 03:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(319409, 23699, 8530, '<td valign="top">water = off-topic.<br/> <br/>The idea''s fine aside from that.</td>', 'water = off-topic. The idea''s fine aside from that.', '2003-06-09 03:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(319411, 23553, 8530, '<td valign="top">Oo, very nice shot. Very nice subject -- much prettier a french press than I have, that''s for sure -- and good setup, with the plant in the background to break up what might otherwise be a little too homogenous a colour scheme. I like the lighting on this, and the composition in general.</td>', 'Oo, very nice shot. Very nice subject -- much prettier a french press than I have, that''s for sure -- and good setup, with the plant in the background to break up what might otherwise be a little too homogenous a colour scheme. I like the lighting on this, and the composition in general.', '2003-06-09 03:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(319413, 23633, 8530, '<td valign="top">Er, hrm. I don''t know what it is but the sausages end up looking really unappealing in this shot. I like the idea, it''s the whole congealed-grease thing that detracts.</td>', 'Er, hrm. I don''t know what it is but the sausages end up looking really unappealing in this shot. I like the idea, it''s the whole congealed-grease thing that detracts.', '2003-06-09 04:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(319414, 23744, 8530, '<td valign="top">The only real problem with the subject is those bottles really don''t spill like this in my experience -- that''s half the point of squeeze bottles. The basic idea is sound. I think I would have liked it better at a slightly top-down angle to emphasize the liquid.</td>', 'The only real problem with the subject is those bottles really don''t spill like this in my experience -- that''s half the point of squeeze bottles. The basic idea is sound. I think I would have liked it better at a slightly top-down angle to emphasize the liquid.', '2003-06-09 04:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(319415, 23317, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm, well, kind of overly-arty for my tastes. I''m fine with the use of honey and I do like the word refraction but I think there''s way too much emphasis on the printout and not enough on the liquid; to some degree it''s de-emphasized because of the focal blur but it''s still a bit much.</td>', 'Hmm, well, kind of overly-arty for my tastes. I''m fine with the use of honey and I do like the word refraction but I think there''s way too much emphasis on the printout and not enough on the liquid; to some degree it''s de-emphasized because of the focal blur but it''s still a bit much.', '2003-06-09 04:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(319416, 23712, 8530, '<td valign="top">Honestly I think I would have preferred this without the front shell half being present, as I like the idea but that sort of takes focus (in the viewing sense) from the liquid part of this. I do like it against a black background, really makes it stand out as no doubt was the point.</td>', 'Honestly I think I would have preferred this without the front shell half being present, as I like the idea but that sort of takes focus (in the viewing sense) from the liquid part of this. I do like it against a black background, really makes it stand out as no doubt was the point.', '2003-06-09 04:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(319417, 23607, 8530, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the angle sort of emphasizes the nostrils, not my favorite thing to be looking at. The idea''s fine, it fits the challenge, and at least it''s not Coke (too many of those).</td>', 'Unfortunately the angle sort of emphasizes the nostrils, not my favorite thing to be looking at. The idea''s fine, it fits the challenge, and at least it''s not Coke (too many of those).', '2003-06-09 04:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
