(319564, 23817, 326, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot!  Nice job!</td>', 'Sweet shot!  Nice job!', '2003-06-09 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(319569, 23169, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot! Well done.</td>', 'Nice candid shot! Well done.', '2003-06-09 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(319570, 23759, 1041, '<td valign="top">My interpretation of the challenge is that the liquid actually has to be visible in the photo ... your doesn''t meet that, sorry.  As for the photo itself, I like the unusual angel and crop, there are some reflections on the label that make it hard to read, I wonder whether it''s possible to change the lighting so that those go away ...</td>', 'My interpretation of the challenge is that the liquid actually has to be visible in the photo ... your doesn''t meet that, sorry.  As for the photo itself, I like the unusual angel and crop, there are some reflections on the label that make it hard to read, I wonder whether it''s possible to change the lighting so that those go away ...', '2003-06-09 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(319572, 23771, 326, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool... Interesting effect!</td>', 'This is pretty cool... Interesting effect!', '2003-06-09 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(319574, 23824, 1041, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  I like the composition a lot, a second strawberry would''ve made it more complete for me though.  Like the cropped off fork in the background, it rounds things off nicely.  I think you deliberately went for those warm orangey hues, for my personal taste they are a little too much, almost as if your white balance is off.  Still, overall, I kinda like your shot :)</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  I like the composition a lot, a second strawberry would''ve made it more complete for me though.  Like the cropped off fork in the background, it rounds things off nicely.  I think you deliberately went for those warm orangey hues, for my personal taste they are a little too much, almost as if your white balance is off.  Still, overall, I kinda like your shot :)', '2003-06-09 11:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(319576, 23806, 1041, '<td valign="top">Eeeewwww!  LOL.  CHallenge definitely met, love the close crop.  Now, someone hand me a tissue so I can clean up the mess :)</td>', 'Eeeewwww!  LOL.  CHallenge definitely met, love the close crop.  Now, someone hand me a tissue so I can clean up the mess :)', '2003-06-09 11:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(319578, 23761, 326, '<td valign="top">This is pretty neat.... Not sure what it is....lol but I like it.</td>', 'This is pretty neat.... Not sure what it is....lol but I like it.', '2003-06-09 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(319580, 23727, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Nice close crop really focuses the viewer in on the mug and the coffee.  It''s pretty straight on, I wonder if there were other angles that would''ve been a little more interesting ...  There are some blown out highlights on the handle and the rim of the mug, but overall not bad.  The towel gives the photo on the mug a somewhat greenish feel to it ...</td>', 'Challenge met.  Nice close crop really focuses the viewer in on the mug and the coffee.  It''s pretty straight on, I wonder if there were other angles that would''ve been a little more interesting ...  There are some blown out highlights on the handle and the rim of the mug, but overall not bad.  The towel gives the photo on the mug a somewhat greenish feel to it ...', '2003-06-09 11:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(319581, 23312, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Unusual angle and crop.  I think cropping a little more off the top to get rid of the airbubble would help.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Unusual angle and crop.  I think cropping a little more off the top to get rid of the airbubble would help.', '2003-06-09 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(319585, 23684, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Cool concept.  Flames are hard to photograph because they always blow out, this one is borderline, but I guess you couldn''t have reduced the shutterspeed more, you would''ve lost the rest of the image.  I really like the wick coiling through the container.  Two things that I think would improve your photo are fully centering or moving the lamp further off-center and filling the lamp all the way with oil to remove the line where it currently ends.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Cool concept.  Flames are hard to photograph because they always blow out, this one is borderline, but I guess you couldn''t have reduced the shutterspeed more, you would''ve lost the rest of the image.  I really like the wick coiling through the container.  Two things that I think would improve your photo are fully centering or moving the lamp further off-center and filling the lamp all the way with oil to remove the line where it currently ends.', '2003-06-09 12:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(319586, 23574, 1041, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmm ... yummy.  Challenge met.  Nice crop.  I like that the logo isn''t fully visible.  The lighting is a little uneven, too dark on the left, too light on the right.</td>', 'Mmmmmm ... yummy.  Challenge met.  Nice crop.  I like that the logo isn''t fully visible.  The lighting is a little uneven, too dark on the left, too light on the right.', '2003-06-09 12:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(319588, 23764, 1041, '<td valign="top">Funky.  No idea what liquid I''m looking at.  I''m assuming it''s not water, so challenge met.  The only thing that distracts is the white at the edges at the bottom.  Since I''m not sure what I''m looking at I can''t give any advice.  I do love the colors and the vortex plus all the bubbles.  Will have to check out your comments after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Funky.  No idea what liquid I''m looking at.  I''m assuming it''s not water, so challenge met.  The only thing that distracts is the white at the edges at the bottom.  Since I''m not sure what I''m looking at I can''t give any advice.  I do love the colors and the vortex plus all the bubbles.  Will have to check out your comments after the challenge is over.', '2003-06-09 12:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
