(319652, 23222, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun! Unique!  You get alot of action into this shot - is it real or an illusion?  Milk or whipped egg whites? Either way a succesful photo. 9</td>', 'Fun! Unique!  You get alot of action into this shot - is it real or an illusion?  Milk or whipped egg whites? Either way a succesful photo. 9', '2003-06-09 12:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(319655, 23721, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  great that you captured the bubbles against the band of white clouds.  You can see all the cool colors.  Wish there wasn''t glare on the upper right. 6</td>', 'nice composition.  great that you captured the bubbles against the band of white clouds.  You can see all the cool colors.  Wish there wasn''t glare on the upper right. 6', '2003-06-09 13:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(319658, 23385, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice color, different liquid.  I''d crop the bottom (and a bit on the top) and make the background black for more impact.</td>', 'nice color, different liquid.  I''d crop the bottom (and a bit on the top) and make the background black for more impact.', '2003-06-09 13:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(319669, 23796, 1176, '<td valign="top">Creat stop motion</td>', 'Creat stop motion', '2003-06-09 13:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319670, 23813, 7628, '<td valign="top">A creative way to present bubbles.  Nice touches of the horn and the confetti.  Wish things were a bit sharper.</td>', 'A creative way to present bubbles.  Nice touches of the horn and the confetti.  Wish things were a bit sharper.', '2003-06-09 13:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(319675, 23173, 7628, '<td valign="top">points for creativity!  Well composed.  I''d wish for better sharpness.  I like the pun -and if you want to be literal - hey!  That IS saliva there. 8</td>', 'points for creativity!  Well composed.  I''d wish for better sharpness.  I like the pun -and if you want to be literal - hey!  That IS saliva there. 8', '2003-06-09 13:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(319681, 23834, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very amusing, and yet another unique liquid.  I like the shoes in the foreground.  I think it would be more focused if you could get a dark backdrop behind the toilet to block out the bathtub, and crop out the cupboard above the toilet.</td>', 'Very amusing, and yet another unique liquid.  I like the shoes in the foreground.  I think it would be more focused if you could get a dark backdrop behind the toilet to block out the bathtub, and crop out the cupboard above the toilet.', '2003-06-09 13:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(319684, 23765, 7628, '<td valign="top">alchemy - nice abstract.</td>', 'alchemy - nice abstract.', '2003-06-09 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(319686, 23490, 2000, '<td valign="top">Challenge is not met here, as the liquid shown is water (the challenge specifically said NOT water).  However, the concept is understood, and the pic isn''t bad.</td>', 'Challenge is not met here, as the liquid shown is water (the challenge specifically said NOT water).  However, the concept is understood, and the pic isn''t bad.', '2003-06-09 13:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(319689, 23180, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very nice b&amp;w.  Nice story about a liquid.  Composition is wonderful with the dark cruving roof above the mans white hair.  The light making tha shadow of the glass on the barrels is a little out of place in this otherwise softly lit scene.  I''d crop the bottom a bit.  Nevertheless - very enjoyable, one of my favorites. 9</td>', 'Very nice b&w.  Nice story about a liquid.  Composition is wonderful with the dark cruving roof above the mans white hair.  The light making tha shadow of the glass on the barrels is a little out of place in this otherwise softly lit scene.  I''d crop the bottom a bit.  Nevertheless - very enjoyable, one of my favorites. 9', '2003-06-09 13:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(319692, 23693, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the change from solid to liquid this photo shows.  The creamy color of the butter and the bubbles at the edges.  The lighting is a bit bright.</td>', 'I like the change from solid to liquid this photo shows.  The creamy color of the butter and the bubbles at the edges.  The lighting is a bit bright.', '2003-06-09 13:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(319694, 23720, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the photo captues the moment of mixing of the milk and coffee.  I wish you had turned the cup so as not to include the handle in the composition.  otherwise I like the composition</td>', 'I like how the photo captues the moment of mixing of the milk and coffee.  I wish you had turned the cup so as not to include the handle in the composition.  otherwise I like the composition', '2003-06-09 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319695, 23160, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice color and shine.  would have cropped closer to the lips, perhaps change the composition to see the lips more from the side/silouette.  needs to be sharper.</td>', 'nice color and shine.  would have cropped closer to the lips, perhaps change the composition to see the lips more from the side/silouette.  needs to be sharper.', '2003-06-09 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(319699, 23733, 7628, '<td valign="top">very abstract syrup - I like the blue light - how did you get those funny light lines - they are intriguing go against the form of the liquid oozing.</td>', 'very abstract syrup - I like the blue light - how did you get those funny light lines - they are intriguing go against the form of the liquid oozing.', '2003-06-09 13:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(319706, 23709, 7628, '<td valign="top">You git great detail in the eye - what a retina!  The unforgiving sadness of your subject has been caught perfectly - wish it were a little less bright, a little more defined.  But this isone of my favorites. 9</td>', 'You git great detail in the eye - what a retina!  The unforgiving sadness of your subject has been caught perfectly - wish it were a little less bright, a little more defined.  But this isone of my favorites. 9', '2003-06-09 13:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(319715, 23690, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What colors - what is mongolian fire oil?  that is likely to be a unique liquid in the challenge. I wonder a little at your choice of composition - but perhaps the cropping of all but one bubble makes the viewer wonder what lies beyond the edges of the photo.  It works!  9</td>', 'Wow!  What colors - what is mongolian fire oil?  that is likely to be a unique liquid in the challenge. I wonder a little at your choice of composition - but perhaps the cropping of all but one bubble makes the viewer wonder what lies beyond the edges of the photo.  It works!  9', '2003-06-09 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(319740, 23834, 7554, '<td valign="top">haha... very humorous picture. good setup, good choice of b&amp;w too.</td>', 'haha... very humorous picture. good setup, good choice of b&w too.', '2003-06-09 14:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(319789, 23762, 326, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what bubble jelly is....lol but this is a awesome shot!</td>', 'I don''t know what bubble jelly is....lol but this is a awesome shot!', '2003-06-09 14:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(319818, 23661, 326, '<td valign="top">Very very nice!! Love it!!</td>', 'Very very nice!! Love it!!', '2003-06-09 15:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(319873, 23690, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Stunning saturated colors.  This is definitely an image that grabs the viewer.  10</td>', 'Beautiful.  Stunning saturated colors.  This is definitely an image that grabs the viewer.  10', '2003-06-09 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(319875, 23317, 5391, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of really good shots this challenge, and this is one of my favorites.  I love how you''ve used the drop of honey as a mini magnifying glass to make the one word stand out.  Using the sheet printed with "honey honey honey..." made a great backdrop that really added interest to the honey itself.  10</td>', 'There are a lot of really good shots this challenge, and this is one of my favorites.  I love how you''ve used the drop of honey as a mini magnifying glass to make the one word stand out.  Using the sheet printed with "honey honey honey..." made a great backdrop that really added interest to the honey itself.  10', '2003-06-09 17:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(319876, 23180, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  I can almost feel warm tones rising from this image, even though its black and white.  Wonderful portrait that would look great in any winery.  Creative idea for this challenge.  It works very well.  9</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  I can almost feel warm tones rising from this image, even though its black and white.  Wonderful portrait that would look great in any winery.  Creative idea for this challenge.  It works very well.  9', '2003-06-09 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(319878, 23393, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors of this shot. Too bad about the object in the lower right hand corner!</td>', 'I like the composition and colors of this shot. Too bad about the object in the lower right hand corner!', '2003-06-09 17:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(319879, 23786, 4753, '<td valign="top">fabulously interesting and original.  i love the pictures with actual thought put into them.  less fancy camera work more brainpower!</td>', 'fabulously interesting and original.  i love the pictures with actual thought put into them.  less fancy camera work more brainpower!', '2003-06-09 17:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319880, 23809, 4753, '<td valign="top">nice to see an off-center picture... i like the non-standard format</td>', 'nice to see an off-center picture... i like the non-standard format', '2003-06-09 17:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319881, 23678, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like the blots and scribbles.  Nice shot</td>', 'I like the blots and scribbles.  Nice shot', '2003-06-09 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(319882, 23228, 9262, '<td valign="top">A little too much white/light in this shot. Nice idea though!</td>', 'A little too much white/light in this shot. Nice idea though!', '2003-06-09 17:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(319883, 23735, 9262, '<td valign="top">I like how the glass is tipped and not just shown standing straight. Nice work</td>', 'I like how the glass is tipped and not just shown standing straight. Nice work', '2003-06-09 17:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(319884, 23756, 9262, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to see what this shot is without the title. A little blury. Good try.</td>', 'It''s hard to see what this shot is without the title. A little blury. Good try.', '2003-06-09 17:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(319885, 23449, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here, and you''ve accomplished it pretty well. The challenge did specify that the liquid should not be water, though.</td>', 'I love the idea here, and you''ve accomplished it pretty well. The challenge did specify that the liquid should not be water, though.', '2003-06-09 17:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(319886, 23760, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the lines here and the sparse composition,but I''m wondering what I''m looking at and where liquid fits in...</td>', 'I love the lines here and the sparse composition,but I''m wondering what I''m looking at and where liquid fits in...', '2003-06-09 17:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319887, 23474, 9262, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed.</td>', 'A little overexposed.', '2003-06-09 17:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(319888, 23449, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice creative intepretation.</td>', 'Nice creative intepretation.', '2003-06-09 17:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(319889, 23215, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot with the lines going off dramatically and everything. Really fun angles and point of view. I am wondering, however, where the liquid is....</td>', 'This is a really cool shot with the lines going off dramatically and everything. Really fun angles and point of view. I am wondering, however, where the liquid is....', '2003-06-09 17:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(319892, 23710, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and use of angles for composition. I''m wondering where the liquid is,though....</td>', 'Very nice lighting and use of angles for composition. I''m wondering where the liquid is,though....', '2003-06-09 17:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(319893, 23211, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good choice of subject. I like the contrast of the white milk/sap and the green leaf. A little blurry though.</td>', 'Nice shot, good choice of subject. I like the contrast of the white milk/sap and the green leaf. A little blurry though.', '2003-06-09 17:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(319894, 23690, 9262, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well shot</td>', 'Very creative and well shot', '2003-06-09 17:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(319895, 23748, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good lighting and composition</td>', 'Nice shot, good lighting and composition', '2003-06-09 17:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(319896, 23747, 6870, '<td valign="top">This frog does indeed look like liquid. I like how the light plays inside it. I feel it does not strongly represent the Liquid topic, though....</td>', 'This frog does indeed look like liquid. I like how the light plays inside it. I feel it does not strongly represent the Liquid topic, though....', '2003-06-09 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(319897, 23822, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection!</td>', 'Nice reflection!', '2003-06-09 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
