(319903, 23294, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I like the bleak feel this image has. This is a photo of a can or bottle, but that seems to be the extent of it. I''m wondering what to do next and what to think next, but I can''t find many clues.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I like the bleak feel this image has. This is a photo of a can or bottle, but that seems to be the extent of it. I''m wondering what to do next and what to think next, but I can''t find many clues.', '2003-06-09 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
