(319909, 23685, 4753, '<td valign="top">lovely allusion... lilacs are powerful.</td>', 'lovely allusion... lilacs are powerful.', '2003-06-09 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(319910, 23774, 9262, '<td valign="top">Good composition, not sure about lighting, I think the shadow on top of the soup is a little distracting but gives depth to the pic.</td>', 'Good composition, not sure about lighting, I think the shadow on top of the soup is a little distracting but gives depth to the pic.', '2003-06-09 17:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(319911, 23187, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and tones captured here. The title implies, perhaps, that the sunset resembles liquid,and I suppose it does, but it doesn''t seem strongly tied to the Liquid theme.</td>', 'Very nice colors and tones captured here. The title implies, perhaps, that the sunset resembles liquid,and I suppose it does, but it doesn''t seem strongly tied to the Liquid theme.', '2003-06-09 17:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(319912, 23354, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, as stop-motion liquid photos go, this one interests me more than once simply due to the height of the splash and the refraction in the shadow, the latter of which is particularly neat. I suspect you were trying to catch the whole shadow and that''s why you didn''t crop closer to it but it leaves the negative space a bit unbalanced-feeling; maybe a closer crop to the main part of the splash?</td>', 'Okay, as stop-motion liquid photos go, this one interests me more than once simply due to the height of the splash and the refraction in the shadow, the latter of which is particularly neat. I suspect you were trying to catch the whole shadow and that''s why you didn''t crop closer to it but it leaves the negative space a bit unbalanced-feeling; maybe a closer crop to the main part of the splash?', '2003-06-09 17:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(319913, 23282, 9262, '<td valign="top">creative!</td>', 'creative!', '2003-06-09 17:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(319914, 23826, 4753, '<td valign="top">nothing like originality.</td>', 'nothing like originality.', '2003-06-09 17:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(319915, 23200, 9262, '<td valign="top">alittle overexposed, good composition</td>', 'alittle overexposed, good composition', '2003-06-09 17:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(319916, 23576, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big abstract fan (you''ll probably see this a lot in my comments) but I have no problems with this topically and I like that the shapes are distinct enough to view things in them a la Rorshach but flow enough to mix the colours and give that liquid sense. I kind of wish you''d either omitted the border or made it less bright.</td>', 'I''m not a big abstract fan (you''ll probably see this a lot in my comments) but I have no problems with this topically and I like that the shapes are distinct enough to view things in them a la Rorshach but flow enough to mix the colours and give that liquid sense. I kind of wish you''d either omitted the border or made it less bright.', '2003-06-09 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(319917, 23490, 6870, '<td valign="top">Snow melt is water.... but if you wanted to hint that is was beer, or an ingredient in beer, I suppose a different point of view or concept might work better. As it is, this is a river of water near a building, even with your title. All that aside, I think this image works. The river acts as leading lines, taking our eye to the building and finally ending with the COORS sign.</td>', 'Snow melt is water.... but if you wanted to hint that is was beer, or an ingredient in beer, I suppose a different point of view or concept might work better. As it is, this is a river of water near a building, even with your title. All that aside, I think this image works. The river acts as leading lines, taking our eye to the building and finally ending with the COORS sign.', '2003-06-09 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(319918, 23147, 9262, '<td valign="top">great shot, good lighting</td>', 'great shot, good lighting', '2003-06-09 17:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(319919, 23699, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, even though it posits water as the liquid, despite the "NOT water" specification  in the challenge. The composition is great, focus is sharp and colors are saturated. Very nice photo; it just doesn''t fit th challenge very well.</td>', 'I really like this shot, even though it posits water as the liquid, despite the "NOT water" specification  in the challenge. The composition is great, focus is sharp and colors are saturated. Very nice photo; it just doesn''t fit th challenge very well.', '2003-06-09 17:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(319920, 23802, 9262, '<td valign="top">like the reflection!</td>', 'like the reflection!', '2003-06-09 17:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319921, 23173, 9262, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation of the theme!</td>', 'interesting interpretation of the theme!', '2003-06-09 17:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(319922, 23375, 6870, '<td valign="top">I see you''ve gotten the dictionary out and are trying to be creative, so I''ll reward you! And I like the idea of this shot. I wonder if there was a way to really capture the "gently flowing" aspects of this cloth. Softer light? softer focus? Point of view from underneath? Closer crop? I''m not sure, but the "gently flowing": isn''t selling itself here IMO.</td>', 'I see you''ve gotten the dictionary out and are trying to be creative, so I''ll reward you! And I like the idea of this shot. I wonder if there was a way to really capture the "gently flowing" aspects of this cloth. Softer light? softer focus? Point of view from underneath? Closer crop? I''m not sure, but the "gently flowing": isn''t selling itself here IMO.', '2003-06-09 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(319923, 23408, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, I can perhaps be convinced that tears are not water, especially when your shadows and hightlights are used so well to make this photo engaging and interesting.</td>', 'Okay, I can perhaps be convinced that tears are not water, especially when your shadows and hightlights are used so well to make this photo engaging and interesting.', '2003-06-09 17:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(319924, 23346, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, let''s see if I''m right. The building and its shadow are "like" waves? Otherwise, this doesn''t look like liquid. That said, I do indeed like the patterns you''ve created here with lines and angles.</td>', 'Okay, let''s see if I''m right. The building and its shadow are "like" waves? Otherwise, this doesn''t look like liquid. That said, I do indeed like the patterns you''ve created here with lines and angles.', '2003-06-09 18:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(319926, 23642, 9262, '<td valign="top">creative interpretation</td>', 'creative interpretation', '2003-06-09 18:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(319927, 23828, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the crop and close up perspective. The lighting seems quite harsh, though.</td>', 'I love the crop and close up perspective. The lighting seems quite harsh, though.', '2003-06-09 18:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(319928, 23721, 6870, '<td valign="top">I suppose bubbles ARE indeed liquid, and I like it floating in the sky like that. Fun idea. If it were in sharper focus, it would really pop and contrast well with the clouds behind it.</td>', 'I suppose bubbles ARE indeed liquid, and I like it floating in the sky like that. Fun idea. If it were in sharper focus, it would really pop and contrast well with the clouds behind it.', '2003-06-09 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(319929, 23783, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like how Pooh''s rear end looks like his head is in the sink! Fun idea that would improve, I feel, with a little more interesting (dramatic, engaging, etc.) light.</td>', 'I really like how Pooh''s rear end looks like his head is in the sink! Fun idea that would improve, I feel, with a little more interesting (dramatic, engaging, etc.) light.', '2003-06-09 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(319930, 23689, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yum. Corn syrup? I like the way you''ve closed in on that drip from the spoon. This image would be enhanced even further with more interesting light (more dramatic, angled, etc.?).</td>', 'Yum. Corn syrup? I like the way you''ve closed in on that drip from the spoon. This image would be enhanced even further with more interesting light (more dramatic, angled, etc.?).', '2003-06-09 18:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(319931, 23817, 9262, '<td valign="top">great shot, good color and lighting</td>', 'great shot, good color and lighting', '2003-06-09 18:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(319933, 23385, 6870, '<td valign="top">Gloop is right! I''m not sure what this is, and I don''t really care all that much. You''ve just managed to make it interesting with the lines and light you''ve used. It might be nice if more were in focus, though.</td>', 'Gloop is right! I''m not sure what this is, and I don''t really care all that much. You''ve just managed to make it interesting with the lines and light you''ve used. It might be nice if more were in focus, though.', '2003-06-09 18:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
