(319949, 23745, 2178, '<td valign="top">Love the dramatic lighting here, could use a little more fill light on the milk drops themselves, a little brighter and it makes it more special.</td>', 'Love the dramatic lighting here, could use a little more fill light on the milk drops themselves, a little brighter and it makes it more special.', '2003-06-09 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(319950, 23454, 9262, '<td valign="top">good lighting, nice composition &amp; capture!</td>', 'good lighting, nice composition & capture!', '2003-06-09 18:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(319951, 23733, 2178, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, but its kinda hypnotic, love the blue color and the swirls of light thru it.</td>', 'Not sure what it is, but its kinda hypnotic, love the blue color and the swirls of light thru it.', '2003-06-09 18:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319952, 23712, 9262, '<td valign="top">a little undexposed, otherwise good shot</td>', 'a little undexposed, otherwise good shot', '2003-06-09 18:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(319953, 23814, 2178, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here, and the color. A big help would be to keep the glass vertical, the tilting to the left frame hurts this shot. The lighting from behind really makes it glow.</td>', 'I like your idea here, and the color. A big help would be to keep the glass vertical, the tilting to the left frame hurts this shot. The lighting from behind really makes it glow.', '2003-06-09 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(319954, 23754, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple, forthright composition works well. For me, I think it would enhance the shot to have both the glass and the bottle in focus to bring more attention to the liquid pouring out.</td>', 'Simple, forthright composition works well. For me, I think it would enhance the shot to have both the glass and the bottle in focus to bring more attention to the liquid pouring out.', '2003-06-09 18:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(319955, 23694, 2178, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept, but more depth of field is needed so your glass stays in focus along with the bottles in the background. A tricky shot to light, more direct light on the background bottles would make a big difference.</td>', 'Not a bad concept, but more depth of field is needed so your glass stays in focus along with the bottles in the background. A tricky shot to light, more direct light on the background bottles would make a big difference.', '2003-06-09 18:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(319956, 23535, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view and lighting. I like the swirls in the yogurt (?). Most of the shot seems slightly out of focus except for the read edge of the bottle; it may enhance the shot to bring more into focus, especially the swirls.</td>', 'Nice point of view and lighting. I like the swirls in the yogurt (?). Most of the shot seems slightly out of focus except for the read edge of the bottle; it may enhance the shot to bring more into focus, especially the swirls.', '2003-06-09 18:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(319957, 23828, 2178, '<td valign="top">Nice color coming from the ale in the glass, the killer reflection on the ale bottle lable hurts here though. Maybe try moving the light to another angle, using a polarizer, or even softening the light with some difuusion material would be some tips I would try. I do wanna a beer right now though..lol ;)</td>', 'Nice color coming from the ale in the glass, the killer reflection on the ale bottle lable hurts here though. Maybe try moving the light to another angle, using a polarizer, or even softening the light with some difuusion material would be some tips I would try. I do wanna a beer right now though..lol ;)', '2003-06-09 18:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(319960, 23731, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the forthright nature of this shot. I also enjoy the reflections, though I wish they reflected something interesting (not that YOU are not interesting, since that seems to be your reflection there, maybe!). By the way, I drink the same stuff!</td>', 'I like the forthright nature of this shot. I also enjoy the reflections, though I wish they reflected something interesting (not that YOU are not interesting, since that seems to be your reflection there, maybe!). By the way, I drink the same stuff!', '2003-06-09 18:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(319962, 23699, 6900, '<td valign="top">Revoted - 6.</td>', 'Revoted - 6.', '2003-06-09 18:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(319963, 23383, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, the first time I looked at this shot, I was wondering where the liquid was. Now it appears I know! Your point of view isn''t the greatest here, I feel, though it is a more sanitized one!</td>', 'Okay, the first time I looked at this shot, I was wondering where the liquid was. Now it appears I know! Your point of view isn''t the greatest here, I feel, though it is a more sanitized one!', '2003-06-09 18:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
