(319968, 23721, 6900, '<td valign="top">WOW.  How did you get these bubbles to do this!?  Excellent shot, great background, tho I would love to see them in the blue area, too.  Wonderful!  9</td>', 'WOW.  How did you get these bubbles to do this!?  Excellent shot, great background, tho I would love to see them in the blue area, too.  Wonderful!  9', '2003-06-09 18:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
