(319970, 23650, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you whited out the background and everything but the cola.  The straw should either be there or not IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting how you whited out the background and everything but the cola.  The straw should either be there or not IMHO.', '2003-06-09 18:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
