(320229, 23725, 3540, '<td valign="top">This isn''t portrayed really well from this far back.  In order for we dumb viewers to understand this photo, it should''ve been shot much closer or at least cropped closer.  It''s that or I''m missing the point completely which is entirely possible.  Are we looking for the sap?</td>', 'This isn''t portrayed really well from this far back.  In order for we dumb viewers to understand this photo, it should''ve been shot much closer or at least cropped closer.  It''s that or I''m missing the point completely which is entirely possible.  Are we looking for the sap?', '2003-06-10 00:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
