(320271, 23701, 7711, '<td valign="top">two kinds of liquid (at least!) well done, I like the crowded composition-- gives a factory/assembly line feel.</td>', 'two kinds of liquid (at least!) well done, I like the crowded composition-- gives a factory/assembly line feel.', '2003-06-10 00:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(320276, 23522, 6900, '<td valign="top">What a superb color of blue.  Now take the harsh reflections off the front, give us a solid color bg and this is a 10.  :)</td>', 'What a superb color of blue.  Now take the harsh reflections off the front, give us a solid color bg and this is a 10.  :)', '2003-06-10 00:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(320278, 23560, 8653, '<td valign="top">Love the BG. Looks like it should be a commercial. Great idea!</td>', 'Love the BG. Looks like it should be a commercial. Great idea!', '2003-06-10 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(320279, 23833, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of b/w, it keeps the repetition of the straps of her shoes and of her bracelets prominent, and the polish keeps you within the theme. Very nice composition. And nice model for letting you take a shot of her feet! :)</td>', 'I like the choice of b/w, it keeps the repetition of the straps of her shoes and of her bracelets prominent, and the polish keeps you within the theme. Very nice composition. And nice model for letting you take a shot of her feet! :)', '2003-06-10 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(320280, 23822, 6900, '<td valign="top">Very nice - finally a picture that I say "yes, this is good!"  I like that the liquid is DOING something here - causing this type of reflection.</td>', 'Very nice - finally a picture that I say "yes, this is good!"  I like that the liquid is DOING something here - causing this type of reflection.', '2003-06-10 00:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(320282, 23726, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, but I don''t think the motion blur adds to the shot, seems a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like your composition, but I don''t think the motion blur adds to the shot, seems a bit distracting.', '2003-06-10 00:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(320283, 23662, 6900, '<td valign="top">AKA Mercury - hope you were ok after dealing with this.  What a SUPERB shot and great edges/splatters!  9</td>', 'AKA Mercury - hope you were ok after dealing with this.  What a SUPERB shot and great edges/splatters!  9', '2003-06-10 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(320287, 23624, 8653, '<td valign="top">Great colors. I like the swirls you caught as it was pouring. Nice capture!</td>', 'Great colors. I like the swirls you caught as it was pouring. Nice capture!', '2003-06-10 00:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(320288, 23836, 6900, '<td valign="top">What is the purple there for?  Otherwise I love this shot.</td>', 'What is the purple there for?  Otherwise I love this shot.', '2003-06-10 00:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(320290, 23715, 7711, '<td valign="top">great colours on this, I love the choice of backlighting, you''ve lit this just perfectly!</td>', 'great colours on this, I love the choice of backlighting, you''ve lit this just perfectly!', '2003-06-10 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(320291, 23330, 6900, '<td valign="top">Decent soft effects here.  One of the few times I''m left wondering where the border is tho - would have helped.  8</td>', 'Decent soft effects here.  One of the few times I''m left wondering where the border is tho - would have helped.  8', '2003-06-10 00:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(320292, 23798, 7969, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice colors and shapes.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice colors and shapes.', '2003-06-10 00:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(320296, 23756, 7711, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate blur for effect, but I can''t see how it helps here. I think I would have preferred this subject to be more in focus.</td>', 'I can appreciate blur for effect, but I can''t see how it helps here. I think I would have preferred this subject to be more in focus.', '2003-06-10 00:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(320298, 23317, 6900, '<td valign="top">Loving the focus here.  I think you got a litttttttle too much blur at the top, but that''s ok - an excellent shot.  9</td>', 'Loving the focus here.  I think you got a litttttttle too much blur at the top, but that''s ok - an excellent shot.  9', '2003-06-10 00:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(320299, 23408, 6900, '<td valign="top">Feels too dark to me.  Good composition.</td>', 'Feels too dark to me.  Good composition.', '2003-06-10 00:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(320301, 23662, 7711, '<td valign="top">now that''s a dangerous subject, but VERY nice composition. Extremely well done.</td>', 'now that''s a dangerous subject, but VERY nice composition. Extremely well done.', '2003-06-10 00:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(320302, 23796, 6900, '<td valign="top">Uhhuh yeah that''s a 10.  Strange yellow bg, but otherwise insanely perfect.</td>', 'Uhhuh yeah that''s a 10.  Strange yellow bg, but otherwise insanely perfect.', '2003-06-10 00:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(320305, 23751, 6900, '<td valign="top">This is blue milk.  I think it''s called skim, but ... unnatural looking.</td>', 'This is blue milk.  I think it''s called skim, but ... unnatural looking.', '2003-06-10 00:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(320307, 23763, 8653, '<td valign="top">Very nice color combo illustrated. Glowing effect.................</td>', 'Very nice color combo illustrated. Glowing effect.................', '2003-06-10 00:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(320309, 23690, 8653, '<td valign="top">Good colors and composition. Has an excellent abstract look.</td>', 'Good colors and composition. Has an excellent abstract look.', '2003-06-10 01:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(320310, 23687, 7711, '<td valign="top">I can''t really find what part of this shot is in focus, and I think it really would have benefitted if some part of it was in focus, maybe more than just a small portion of the rim.</td>', 'I can''t really find what part of this shot is in focus, and I think it really would have benefitted if some part of it was in focus, maybe more than just a small portion of the rim.', '2003-06-10 01:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(320312, 23661, 6900, '<td valign="top">"I got some ice cream, I got some ice cream and you don''t got none cuz ..."<br/>"You dropped your ice cream, you dropped your ice cream!"<br/>(From Eddie Murphy, Delirious)</td>', '"I got some ice cream, I got some ice cream and you don''t got none cuz ...""You dropped your ice cream, you dropped your ice cream!"(From Eddie Murphy, Delirious)', '2003-06-10 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(320314, 23828, 6900, '<td valign="top">Direct lighting?  Seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'Direct lighting?  Seems a bit harsh.', '2003-06-10 01:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(320315, 23778, 6900, '<td valign="top">Dayum.  Give that a good, clean background and it''s a top shot.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Dayum.  Give that a good, clean background and it''s a top shot.  Excellent work.', '2003-06-10 01:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(320316, 23805, 8653, '<td valign="top">Yummy looks good enough to eat right now. Nice display of colors</td>', 'Yummy looks good enough to eat right now. Nice display of colors', '2003-06-10 01:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(320318, 23758, 6900, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look sunny enough for an "ahhhhh" :)  Good shot anyway.</td>', 'Doesn''t look sunny enough for an "ahhhhh" :)  Good shot anyway.', '2003-06-10 01:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(320321, 23817, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful idea. I like the gradient colours of your background and your lightsource on the left.</td>', 'beautiful idea. I like the gradient colours of your background and your lightsource on the left.', '2003-06-10 01:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(320322, 23817, 8653, '<td valign="top">Nice catch on the drip. Like the blue BG. makes the ccolors pop.</td>', 'Nice catch on the drip. Like the blue BG. makes the ccolors pop.', '2003-06-10 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(320325, 23752, 6900, '<td valign="top">The glass disappears in your background - otherwise a wonderful shot.  9</td>', 'The glass disappears in your background - otherwise a wonderful shot.  9', '2003-06-10 01:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(320326, 23317, 7711, '<td valign="top">great way to get us realize what your liquid is! I like the tiny bubble too, and the smoothness of the drop.</td>', 'great way to get us realize what your liquid is! I like the tiny bubble too, and the smoothness of the drop.', '2003-06-10 01:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(320327, 23817, 6900, '<td valign="top">Ooooooohhhhh one of the few shots this week that makes voting interesting and fun - good shot, wonderful pre-drip catch.  10</td>', 'Ooooooohhhhh one of the few shots this week that makes voting interesting and fun - good shot, wonderful pre-drip catch.  10', '2003-06-10 01:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(320328, 23758, 8653, '<td valign="top">I like the subject with the blurred BG.  Plus the fact he is such a citie!</td>', 'I like the subject with the blurred BG.  Plus the fact he is such a citie!', '2003-06-10 01:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(320330, 23317, 8653, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Like how it magnified. Good depth displayed.</td>', 'Great idea. Like how it magnified. Good depth displayed.', '2003-06-10 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(320339, 23396, 6900, '<td valign="top">Mmmm after voting on 202 of these liquid shots, I''d take one of yours.</td>', 'Mmmm after voting on 202 of these liquid shots, I''d take one of yours.', '2003-06-10 01:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(320344, 23418, 6900, '<td valign="top">Fine, don''t listen.  :P<br/> <br/>I like the composition of this shot overall - don''t like the (now) stray liquid drops.</td>', 'Fine, don''t listen.  :P I like the composition of this shot overall - don''t like the (now) stray liquid drops.', '2003-06-10 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(320366, 23829, 7151, '<td valign="top">Who says you can''t be creative and still stick with the theme???  Great idea.  The set-up is very good, I like the composition.  The focus seems a bit soft.  The lighting, I can''t decide - it''s sort of interesting, but I can''t get past it being a bit dark.  Overall, great shot.</td>', 'Who says you can''t be creative and still stick with the theme???  Great idea.  The set-up is very good, I like the composition.  The focus seems a bit soft.  The lighting, I can''t decide - it''s sort of interesting, but I can''t get past it being a bit dark.  Overall, great shot.', '2003-06-10 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(320371, 23454, 7151, '<td valign="top">OK idea.  The blur of the blown bubble is OK.  Wish the focus was more on the bubbles than the person.</td>', 'OK idea.  The blur of the blown bubble is OK.  Wish the focus was more on the bubbles than the person.', '2003-06-10 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(320372, 23583, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Utlimately, I''m not sure what I''m looking at (beside oil).</td>', 'Nice colors.  Utlimately, I''m not sure what I''m looking at (beside oil).', '2003-06-10 01:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(320376, 23316, 8530, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly a very different idea. (Or was it just a way to sneak a flower shot in?) I suppose the combination makes some sense, both being lover''s tools, and I can''t argue with the choice of liquid (yummy, chocolat).<br/> <br/>The colouring on the rose has the side effect of making it look somewhat wilted or aged, which is a pity (the petals are slightly wilted, it looks like, but with a different colour it might have not ''felt'' that way). I''m okay with the large amounts of negative space but it makes the focal blur stand out quite a bit which is slightly (but only slightly) distracting.</td>', 'It''s certainly a very different idea. (Or was it just a way to sneak a flower shot in?) I suppose the combination makes some sense, both being lover''s tools, and I can''t argue with the choice of liquid (yummy, chocolat). The colouring on the rose has the side effect of making it look somewhat wilted or aged, which is a pity (the petals are slightly wilted, it looks like, but with a different colour it might have not ''felt'' that way). I''m okay with the large amounts of negative space but it makes the focal blur stand out quite a bit which is slightly (but only slightly) distracting.', '2003-06-10 01:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(320377, 23763, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, use of colour. Ultimately too much blue on blue for me but a nice idea anyhow.</td>', 'Interesting angle, use of colour. Ultimately too much blue on blue for me but a nice idea anyhow.', '2003-06-10 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(320379, 23761, 8530, '<td valign="top">Your title, she is a pun, no?<br/> <br/>Okay -- good choice for the topic. A bit too much homogenity in shade gives it a slightly blander look than ideal, but the striations help with that some.</td>', 'Your title, she is a pun, no? Okay -- good choice for the topic. A bit too much homogenity in shade gives it a slightly blander look than ideal, but the striations help with that some.', '2003-06-10 01:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(320380, 23186, 8530, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like a shot of litter. Not the most appealing. Reasonable thought.</td>', 'Kinda looks like a shot of litter. Not the most appealing. Reasonable thought.', '2003-06-10 01:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(320382, 23294, 8530, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter in the background for me. Okay in terms of topic, but the cut-off bottle probably wasn''t the ideal choice. Maybe with a bigger spill.</td>', 'Too much clutter in the background for me. Okay in terms of topic, but the cut-off bottle probably wasn''t the ideal choice. Maybe with a bigger spill.', '2003-06-10 01:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(320385, 23660, 8530, '<td valign="top">EXTREME CLOSEUP! (This Wayne''s World moment brought to you by...)<br/> <br/>Sorta liquidy, yeah, very moist at least. I think the extreme closeup is, well, a bit extreme; more attractive to me would have been tomato slices that were ''bleeding'', so to speak.</td>', 'EXTREME CLOSEUP! (This Wayne''s World moment brought to you by...) Sorta liquidy, yeah, very moist at least. I think the extreme closeup is, well, a bit extreme; more attractive to me would have been tomato slices that were ''bleeding'', so to speak.', '2003-06-10 01:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(320387, 23683, 8530, '<td valign="top">Focus is so tight on the label and seal that you sort of lose the liquid behind it even though I know quite wel lit''s there.</td>', 'Focus is so tight on the label and seal that you sort of lose the liquid behind it even though I know quite wel lit''s there.', '2003-06-10 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(320388, 23180, 8682, '<td valign="top">beatiful composition</td>', 'beatiful composition', '2003-06-10 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(320389, 23689, 8530, '<td valign="top">I think this is the third picture I''ve seen with this title. Also a fair number with the topic. Lighting seems odd -- either that''s a very dark-coloured spoon or it really is on a bit of a strange angle. If the spoon is actually dark-coloured, it''s a good choice to give contrast. Not terribly interesting to me overall but it does meet the topic just fine.</td>', 'I think this is the third picture I''ve seen with this title. Also a fair number with the topic. Lighting seems odd -- either that''s a very dark-coloured spoon or it really is on a bit of a strange angle. If the spoon is actually dark-coloured, it''s a good choice to give contrast. Not terribly interesting to me overall but it does meet the topic just fine.', '2003-06-10 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(320391, 23418, 8530, '<td valign="top">The very intensely yellow background''s a bit distracting to me. The idea''s fine, though I''m not sure why you chose to have the bottle cut off as you did -- not bad, just feels slightly awkward.</td>', 'The very intensely yellow background''s a bit distracting to me. The idea''s fine, though I''m not sure why you chose to have the bottle cut off as you did -- not bad, just feels slightly awkward.', '2003-06-10 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(320392, 23760, 8530, '<td valign="top">Er. Where''s the liquid? Oh. Wait. Is the whole blue the liquid? Water? It''s so placid and still it doesn''t feel liquidy and water was off topic by declaration...</td>', 'Er. Where''s the liquid? Oh. Wait. Is the whole blue the liquid? Water? It''s so placid and still it doesn''t feel liquidy and water was off topic by declaration...', '2003-06-10 01:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(320393, 23147, 8530, '<td valign="top">As I''m sure you''ve seen by now, this was a popular topic. Interesting to focus on the drip itself, but I think in that case I would have preferred the spoon be absent.</td>', 'As I''m sure you''ve seen by now, this was a popular topic. Interesting to focus on the drip itself, but I think in that case I would have preferred the spoon be absent.', '2003-06-10 01:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(320396, 23748, 8530, '<td valign="top">soap is liquid, that''s fine. top-down shot, more interesting than some. I still am hung up on the "squeeze bottles really don''t spill that easily" thing. Refraction is cool.</td>', 'soap is liquid, that''s fine. top-down shot, more interesting than some. I still am hung up on the "squeeze bottles really don''t spill that easily" thing. Refraction is cool.', '2003-06-10 01:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(320397, 23822, 8530, '<td valign="top">Oh, hey, look, it''s NOT SOAP. It''s  Windex, that''s different.<br/> <br/>I like the reflection, the bubbly liquid, the dry in the back to highlight the liquid.</td>', 'Oh, hey, look, it''s NOT SOAP. It''s  Windex, that''s different. I like the reflection, the bubbly liquid, the dry in the back to highlight the liquid.', '2003-06-10 02:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(320398, 23727, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay. Mug of coffee = definitely liqiud. Interesting mug. Nice colour for the backdrop (towel or rug?). Reasonably interesting, on topic.</td>', 'Okay. Mug of coffee = definitely liqiud. Interesting mug. Nice colour for the backdrop (towel or rug?). Reasonably interesting, on topic.', '2003-06-10 02:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(320399, 23128, 8530, '<td valign="top">As soap pictures go, considerably more interesting than the ''spilled soap'' idea so many others have gone with. I like the inclusion of the scrubbing pad for interest level and colour contrast alike.</td>', 'As soap pictures go, considerably more interesting than the ''spilled soap'' idea so many others have gone with. I like the inclusion of the scrubbing pad for interest level and colour contrast alike.', '2003-06-10 02:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(320400, 23787, 8530, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure what this is but it''s a pretty combination of colours. Is the graininess intentional? It does add a bit of depth.</td>', 'Not entirely sure what this is but it''s a pretty combination of colours. Is the graininess intentional? It does add a bit of depth.', '2003-06-10 02:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(320401, 23554, 8530, '<td valign="top">Interesting bubble effect, makes it more interesting. I presume the red on the bottom is the vinegar (wine vinegar?) but the colour goes so dark it''s hard to tell. Still, it does convey ''liquid''. I seem to be running out of adjectives, by the way; ''interesting'' really is a good thing here.</td>', 'Interesting bubble effect, makes it more interesting. I presume the red on the bottom is the vinegar (wine vinegar?) but the colour goes so dark it''s hard to tell. Still, it does convey ''liquid''. I seem to be running out of adjectives, by the way; ''interesting'' really is a good thing here.', '2003-06-10 02:06:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(320404, 23221, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, interesting take on the liquor-bottle idea. The lighting in this seems somewhat dim (probably because of how dark the tequila in the bottle looks). I like the lipstick on the glass.</td>', 'Okay, interesting take on the liquor-bottle idea. The lighting in this seems somewhat dim (probably because of how dark the tequila in the bottle looks). I like the lipstick on the glass.', '2003-06-10 02:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(320405, 23636, 8530, '<td valign="top">''not water''. Which is a pity as this is an interesting idea -- good photojournalism type. One could argue about the ''mud'' making it more on topic but I''m dubious mud qualifies as ''not water'' even if I count it as ''liquid''. I hope this was candid and not staged, er, well, no... I mean... well, I hope no one was hurt?</td>', '''not water''. Which is a pity as this is an interesting idea -- good photojournalism type. One could argue about the ''mud'' making it more on topic but I''m dubious mud qualifies as ''not water'' even if I count it as ''liquid''. I hope this was candid and not staged, er, well, no... I mean... well, I hope no one was hurt?', '2003-06-10 02:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(320406, 23687, 8530, '<td valign="top">Way too many things with this title, and anyhow coffee (or dark tea?) does not say ''gold'' to me. That having been said...<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting shot. I think the addition of the newspaper was good, but whatever is at the top I think should have been omitted as it tends to draw the eye more than you probably want. I like your tablecloth, it makes a great backdrop.</td>', 'Way too many things with this title, and anyhow coffee (or dark tea?) does not say ''gold'' to me. That having been said... It''s an interesting shot. I think the addition of the newspaper was good, but whatever is at the top I think should have been omitted as it tends to draw the eye more than you probably want. I like your tablecloth, it makes a great backdrop.', '2003-06-10 02:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(320407, 23157, 8530, '<td valign="top">Neat take on the egg idea. The dark background sets it off well but has the side effect of making it a little too staged-looking, sort of a trade-off. The egg-holder is itself interesting to look at, and makes a good contrast for the egg yolk.</td>', 'Neat take on the egg idea. The dark background sets it off well but has the side effect of making it a little too staged-looking, sort of a trade-off. The egg-holder is itself interesting to look at, and makes a good contrast for the egg yolk.', '2003-06-10 02:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(320408, 23726, 8530, '<td valign="top">Now I''m curious what this is. The use of lots of neutral tones emphasizes the liquid, which is good. The stop-motion of the drop about to hit avoids the splash stop-motion cliche, for which I thank you. Because of how much light tone there is, I might have suggested dropping the lighting down just slightly although it is not "too" bright.</td>', 'Now I''m curious what this is. The use of lots of neutral tones emphasizes the liquid, which is good. The stop-motion of the drop about to hit avoids the splash stop-motion cliche, for which I thank you. Because of how much light tone there is, I might have suggested dropping the lighting down just slightly although it is not "too" bright.', '2003-06-10 02:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(320409, 23224, 8530, '<td valign="top">Well, very nice iridescence, at least, though I''m a little less fond of the use of a CD. I can''t tell what your liquid is, but it does look too thick to be water. Bright dots to the right are distracting; might have been better to crop those babies out. Otherwise good use of negative space.</td>', 'Well, very nice iridescence, at least, though I''m a little less fond of the use of a CD. I can''t tell what your liquid is, but it does look too thick to be water. Bright dots to the right are distracting; might have been better to crop those babies out. Otherwise good use of negative space.', '2003-06-10 02:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(320410, 23222, 8530, '<td valign="top">What an AMAZINGLY unexpected subject! That''s worth a point right there.<br/> <br/>Not the most... visually appealing thing, but it''s interesting, a good joke photo. I like how the milk is swirling over the mouth of the fish and the way it looks as if it is just now being pulled out, which seems to be the case as I''ve just spotted the fishing line (hard to see, of course). With the neutrality and the coolth of the majority of the colours, the bright fishing lure is a bit jarring, though I guess they don''t come in non-bright colours exactly.</td>', 'What an AMAZINGLY unexpected subject! That''s worth a point right there. Not the most... visually appealing thing, but it''s interesting, a good joke photo. I like how the milk is swirling over the mouth of the fish and the way it looks as if it is just now being pulled out, which seems to be the case as I''ve just spotted the fishing line (hard to see, of course). With the neutrality and the coolth of the majority of the colours, the bright fishing lure is a bit jarring, though I guess they don''t come in non-bright colours exactly.', '2003-06-10 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(320411, 23745, 8530, '<td valign="top">More natural looking than many spilled f00 shots. The milk inside the pitcher is tough to see due to colour of the pitcher, but the trade-off there of course is the use of a contrasting colour against the background. Lighting is interesting although given the choice of a set of contrasting objects perhaps giving a little more light to the right side of the pitcher would''ve been a little better? I don''t dislike it as is.</td>', 'More natural looking than many spilled f00 shots. The milk inside the pitcher is tough to see due to colour of the pitcher, but the trade-off there of course is the use of a contrasting colour against the background. Lighting is interesting although given the choice of a set of contrasting objects perhaps giving a little more light to the right side of the pitcher would''ve been a little better? I don''t dislike it as is.', '2003-06-10 02:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(320412, 23791, 8530, '<td valign="top">Er, eww. On-topic, yeah. Interesting expression. Skin tone very bright, lighting too bright overall I think. However those things with colours contrast which helps a bit.</td>', 'Er, eww. On-topic, yeah. Interesting expression. Skin tone very bright, lighting too bright overall I think. However those things with colours contrast which helps a bit.', '2003-06-10 02:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(320413, 23583, 8530, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit hard to tell there''s oil there; I can see at the top left some dry vs wet, though.</td>', 'It''s a bit hard to tell there''s oil there; I can see at the top left some dry vs wet, though.', '2003-06-10 02:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(320414, 23686, 8530, '<td valign="top">On topic, but not terribly interesting as-is. Sometimes less is, well, less.</td>', 'On topic, but not terribly interesting as-is. Sometimes less is, well, less.', '2003-06-10 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(320415, 23837, 8530, '<td valign="top">Nice swirl effect you''ve captured. Interesting close-up shot, too, as it almost fills the shot with the liquid, which is very topical.</td>', 'Nice swirl effect you''ve captured. Interesting close-up shot, too, as it almost fills the shot with the liquid, which is very topical.', '2003-06-10 02:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(320416, 23093, 8530, '<td valign="top">Why black and white? I like the swirly paint effect but think it would have been much more effective in colour (unless, I suppose, you are using black and white paints, in which case a coloured background would have been nice; this renders it a bit bland).</td>', 'Why black and white? I like the swirly paint effect but think it would have been much more effective in colour (unless, I suppose, you are using black and white paints, in which case a coloured background would have been nice; this renders it a bit bland).', '2003-06-10 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(320417, 23774, 8530, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of topic and the basic setup of the soup/bowl/spoon, but there''s far too much negative space here; a tighter focus on the bowl would have been preferable.</td>', 'I like your choice of topic and the basic setup of the soup/bowl/spoon, but there''s far too much negative space here; a tighter focus on the bowl would have been preferable.', '2003-06-10 02:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(320418, 23752, 8530, '<td valign="top">I suspect I know how you did this but you make it very seamless -- a very good idea and well done. My only complaint, if any, is the white-on-beige; a tinted cup might have been better, though you''d lose some of the chocolate-on-white. I like the foam in the cup, too, helps with the interest level. Would make a good commercial art shot.</td>', 'I suspect I know how you did this but you make it very seamless -- a very good idea and well done. My only complaint, if any, is the white-on-beige; a tinted cup might have been better, though you''d lose some of the chocolate-on-white. I like the foam in the cup, too, helps with the interest level. Would make a good commercial art shot.', '2003-06-10 02:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(320419, 23700, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity and focus! The colors add alot of interest as well.</td>', 'Excellent clarity and focus! The colors add alot of interest as well.', '2003-06-10 02:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
