(320672, 23811, 8530, '<td valign="top">I suppose this could be liquid but there''s no context or differences to make it obvious. It could also be a closeup of something highly-textured. It''s also a fairly unattractive colour, so having the entire picture be that colour does nothing for me.</td>', 'I suppose this could be liquid but there''s no context or differences to make it obvious. It could also be a closeup of something highly-textured. It''s also a fairly unattractive colour, so having the entire picture be that colour does nothing for me.', '2003-06-10 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
