(320680, 23770, 7711, '<td valign="top">the lighting on this is very harsh, and there are strange shapes/reflections above the spoon, as well, much of it is out of focus, perhaps you were too close to the subject or should have used a macro function/lens? Just a few ideas! Keep shooting! :)</td>', 'the lighting on this is very harsh, and there are strange shapes/reflections above the spoon, as well, much of it is out of focus, perhaps you were too close to the subject or should have used a macro function/lens? Just a few ideas! Keep shooting! :)', '2003-06-10 13:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(320681, 23506, 326, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did this..... but it''s neat and I like it! was it a painting or did you take this?</td>', 'Not sure how you did this..... but it''s neat and I like it! was it a painting or did you take this?', '2003-06-10 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(320686, 23834, 326, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is strange.....LOL good job!</td>', 'Ok, this is strange.....LOL good job!', '2003-06-10 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(320688, 23751, 8530, '<td valign="top">Milk, it does a body good? Well, it''s a different angle than some of the others I''ve seen, and you''ve captured a nice splash effect. I don''t know if it''s the reflection from the bowl or what but it seems overly blue, and a bit on the dim side.</td>', 'Milk, it does a body good? Well, it''s a different angle than some of the others I''ve seen, and you''ve captured a nice splash effect. I don''t know if it''s the reflection from the bowl or what but it seems overly blue, and a bit on the dim side.', '2003-06-10 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(320689, 23154, 8530, '<td valign="top">I have no clue what your liquid is other than it''s obviously highly reflective. I kind of like the fact the face is visible, it gives it a bit more interest. I think just having those drops would have actually been a better shot, as the ones without an obvious reflection don''t add as much to the shot for me.</td>', 'I have no clue what your liquid is other than it''s obviously highly reflective. I kind of like the fact the face is visible, it gives it a bit more interest. I think just having those drops would have actually been a better shot, as the ones without an obvious reflection don''t add as much to the shot for me.', '2003-06-10 14:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(320691, 23798, 8530, '<td valign="top">I do like the pattern of bubbles. The blurred background being so much brighter is very distracting -- I think it would have been better with more light on the foreground.</td>', 'I do like the pattern of bubbles. The blurred background being so much brighter is very distracting -- I think it would have been better with more light on the foreground.', '2003-06-10 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(320693, 23817, 8530, '<td valign="top">A little different, including both the utensil and the flower; better than just dripping honey from either. The solid background helps make both stand out, but the lighting on the side fades the background in an odd way. Very nice sharp focus on the flower petals.</td>', 'A little different, including both the utensil and the flower; better than just dripping honey from either. The solid background helps make both stand out, but the lighting on the side fades the background in an odd way. Very nice sharp focus on the flower petals.', '2003-06-10 14:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(320694, 23606, 8530, '<td valign="top">On the plus side, I''ve yet to see anyone else use perfume this round. Good going!<br/> <br/>On the minus, I don''t care for the background this is set against at all. It''s very distracting, and doesn''t really do much to set off the bottle.</td>', 'On the plus side, I''ve yet to see anyone else use perfume this round. Good going! On the minus, I don''t care for the background this is set against at all. It''s very distracting, and doesn''t really do much to set off the bottle.', '2003-06-10 14:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(320695, 23619, 8530, '<td valign="top">If you drip it... ?<br/> <br/>Well, it looks too viscous to be water, that''s good. I''m guessing honey or sap or something in that range. The focal blur at the foreground is very distracting, takes the eyes away from the focal point; raising the angle just slightly might have helped with that. Good close-up shot.</td>', 'If you drip it... ? Well, it looks too viscous to be water, that''s good. I''m guessing honey or sap or something in that range. The focal blur at the foreground is very distracting, takes the eyes away from the focal point; raising the angle just slightly might have helped with that. Good close-up shot.', '2003-06-10 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(320696, 23701, 8530, '<td valign="top">I think I like the basic idea, but this ends up very cluttered and noisy on a colour level. More even rows of bottles, maybe set off slightly each row, might have helped. Alternating colours might have helped; right now they''re kind of grouped. Fewer bottles would have been the other choice.</td>', 'I think I like the basic idea, but this ends up very cluttered and noisy on a colour level. More even rows of bottles, maybe set off slightly each row, might have helped. Alternating colours might have helped; right now they''re kind of grouped. Fewer bottles would have been the other choice.', '2003-06-10 14:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(320697, 23778, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you tossed alcohol in there and set it aflame? That''s a great idea! Hot chocolate flambe''. :)<br/> <br/>I expect you wanted the light level lower than not to ensure the flames were easily visible, but unfortunately having that dark background emphasizes that somewhat more highly than I''d prefer. Also, while as usual I know that "shoot your subject off center" is the big trope, I disagree when it comes to single-image-vs-plain-background shots, as significantly uneven use of negative space just makes me want to start editing... but you''d probably get as many people telling you the opposite. The compromise would probably be facing the handle the other direction.</td>', 'I''m guessing you tossed alcohol in there and set it aflame? That''s a great idea! Hot chocolate flambe''. :) I expect you wanted the light level lower than not to ensure the flames were easily visible, but unfortunately having that dark background emphasizes that somewhat more highly than I''d prefer. Also, while as usual I know that "shoot your subject off center" is the big trope, I disagree when it comes to single-image-vs-plain-background shots, as significantly uneven use of negative space just makes me want to start editing... but you''d probably get as many people telling you the opposite. The compromise would probably be facing the handle the other direction.', '2003-06-10 14:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(320699, 23826, 8530, '<td valign="top">This will make a lot more sense to people who have seen the ads. Luckily for you, I have.<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting idea, but to mimic the ads you would have needed somewhat different lighting. Having the colour-on-B&amp;W helps with the impression but it''s too bright to meet my expectations.<br/> <br/>Hmm. Now that I think about it, maybe you''ll be better off with the people who do NOT know the ad campaign....</td>', 'This will make a lot more sense to people who have seen the ads. Luckily for you, I have. It''s an interesting idea, but to mimic the ads you would have needed somewhat different lighting. Having the colour-on-B&W helps with the impression but it''s too bright to meet my expectations. Hmm. Now that I think about it, maybe you''ll be better off with the people who do NOT know the ad campaign....', '2003-06-10 14:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(320700, 23522, 8530, '<td valign="top">Good use of gold at the bottom for contrast. Top contrast is not as vivid but the tight focus helps with that. Topic is fine. Maybe a bit too clean and neat.</td>', 'Good use of gold at the bottom for contrast. Top contrast is not as vivid but the tight focus helps with that. Topic is fine. Maybe a bit too clean and neat.', '2003-06-10 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(320702, 23490, 8530, '<td valign="top">The actual visible liquid in this is water. Water was off-topic. A beer factory is not liquid, even if it produces it. The bright red border is very distracting. The photo is fine in terms of focus but as it''s of a muddy river and a factory it doesn''t do much for me attractiveness.</td>', 'The actual visible liquid in this is water. Water was off-topic. A beer factory is not liquid, even if it produces it. The bright red border is very distracting. The photo is fine in terms of focus but as it''s of a muddy river and a factory it doesn''t do much for me attractiveness.', '2003-06-10 14:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(320704, 23713, 8530, '<td valign="top">Skim milk. Ick. <br/> <br/>Considering how much of the required elements of your photo (milk, milk carton) are white, I think I would have chosen a different, even if not terribly darker, coloured stuffed animal. Also the lighting in this seems rather bright but it may be an artifact of teh chosen colours.<br/> <br/>I like the basic idea, and the framing is not bad though maybe shifting the center just a bit downwards so the glass isn''t almost sitting on the edge would have been nicer... some of that''s a reaction to the homogenous colour scheme, though.</td>', 'Skim milk. Ick.  Considering how much of the required elements of your photo (milk, milk carton) are white, I think I would have chosen a different, even if not terribly darker, coloured stuffed animal. Also the lighting in this seems rather bright but it may be an artifact of teh chosen colours. I like the basic idea, and the framing is not bad though maybe shifting the center just a bit downwards so the glass isn''t almost sitting on the edge would have been nicer... some of that''s a reaction to the homogenous colour scheme, though.', '2003-06-10 14:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(320731, 23559, 6900, '<td valign="top">Cleanup aisle 9 cleanup aisle 9.... Interesting perspective on a splash.  Lighting seems a bit harsh and flash-like.</td>', 'Cleanup aisle 9 cleanup aisle 9.... Interesting perspective on a splash.  Lighting seems a bit harsh and flash-like.', '2003-06-10 15:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
