(320863, 23583, 2764, '<td valign="top">Perfect except for the border - it just doesn''t shine - maybe a single border would have been better becasue I expect to seee those neon colors between the two layers.</td>', 'Perfect except for the border - it just doesn''t shine - maybe a single border would have been better becasue I expect to seee those neon colors between the two layers.', '2003-06-10 17:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
