(320869, 23760, 2764, '<td valign="top">Why am I so stupid - I saved this one for last but I still don''t know where the liquid is.  What to do?  Flip a coin, heads I give a great score because I love the image, tails I give a low score because what the heck is it?  ....Heads - you win.</td>', 'Why am I so stupid - I saved this one for last but I still don''t know where the liquid is.  What to do?  Flip a coin, heads I give a great score because I love the image, tails I give a low score because what the heck is it?  ....Heads - you win.', '2003-06-10 17:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
