(321369, 23820, 2586, '<td valign="top">I liked your theme a lot. What i didn''t like, and therefore didn''t score it terribly high, was: the double-exposure arms - they are so blurry that they almost look masculinely hairy :) - the uneven lighting, knee and the left foot that as a result takes on a bit of an gawdy shape. Furthermore, i question the pose of the model. She is obviously very attractive - is that you? - but her ribs (never the most graceful part of the female body - seem very pronounced and also higher than the breasts. Maybe that''s the result of the pose or the model just tucking in her stomach too much. Anyway, i liked your effort and was amused by the title. Hope you''ll do more nudes and don''t let the anti-nudity crowd here get to you :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-11 01:13:04.</i></td>', 'I liked your theme a lot. What i didn''t like, and therefore didn''t score it terribly high, was: the double-exposure arms - they are so blurry that they almost look masculinely hairy :) - the uneven lighting, knee and the left foot that as a result takes on a bit of an gawdy shape. Furthermore, i question the pose of the model. She is obviously very attractive - is that you? - but her ribs (never the most graceful part of the female body - seem very pronounced and also higher than the breasts. Maybe that''s the result of the pose or the model just tucking in her stomach too much. Anyway, i liked your effort and was amused by the title. Hope you''ll do more nudes and don''t let the anti-nudity crowd here get to you :)', '2003-06-11 02:12:05.000000', '2003-06-11 02:13:04.000000', 0),
(321502, 23817, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Very nicely done.  The texture and the focus are very good even the smallest droplets of honey stand out on the petals.  It definately meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>About the only thing that might improve this is a little more light on the flower, it just appears to be a little to dark.<br/> <br/>In all this is a really nice composition and well thought out.  <br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Very nicely done.  The texture and the focus are very good even the smallest droplets of honey stand out on the petals.  It definately meets the challenge. About the only thing that might improve this is a little more light on the flower, it just appears to be a little to dark. In all this is a really nice composition and well thought out.   Anna', '2003-06-11 03:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(321531, 23834, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I simply adored this shot when I first saw it during the voting.  Its very well thought out.  Someone mentioned the shoes being set up, need to come to my house there is usually at least one pair of shoes near there and usually little boy''s clothes too.<br/> <br/>It is in relatively good focus, the dof is good.  The only thing that really could be better is the lighting, but I know bathrooms aren''t always the best of places for good lighting near the floor.<br/> <br/>Definately meets the challenge.  Well done and remember to put the seat down when you finish...sorry I couldn''t help myself...I have to agree I would have loved to see this finish higher!<br/> <br/>Anna<br/></td>', '*Critique Club* I simply adored this shot when I first saw it during the voting.  Its very well thought out.  Someone mentioned the shoes being set up, need to come to my house there is usually at least one pair of shoes near there and usually little boy''s clothes too. It is in relatively good focus, the dof is good.  The only thing that really could be better is the lighting, but I know bathrooms aren''t always the best of places for good lighting near the floor. Definately meets the challenge.  Well done and remember to put the seat down when you finish...sorry I couldn''t help myself...I have to agree I would have loved to see this finish higher! Anna', '2003-06-11 03:25:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(321611, 23745, 6172, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, not much I could suggest for improvements.  The focus and lighting (the lighting makes this shot) seem perfect to me.  The composition also doesn''t seem to need any improvement.  The only suggestion I could give that would be an improvement would be to emphasize the spilt milk with more brightness.  This could be done with pre-processing lighting or post-processing adjustment of some type (select the milk only and crank up the brightness, or any better method).<br/> <br/>One other comment.  I''m sure you are talking about "Don''t cry over spilt milk" in your title, but what about the "Please?".  I have no idea what you mean by this part of the title.  Of course, I could be missing something, but I can only tell you my feeling.<br/> <br/>Nice shot, keep up the good work.)</td>', 'I really like this shot, not much I could suggest for improvements.  The focus and lighting (the lighting makes this shot) seem perfect to me.  The composition also doesn''t seem to need any improvement.  The only suggestion I could give that would be an improvement would be to emphasize the spilt milk with more brightness.  This could be done with pre-processing lighting or post-processing adjustment of some type (select the milk only and crank up the brightness, or any better method). One other comment.  I''m sure you are talking about "Don''t cry over spilt milk" in your title, but what about the "Please?".  I have no idea what you mean by this part of the title.  Of course, I could be missing something, but I can only tell you my feeling. Nice shot, keep up the good work.)', '2003-06-11 04:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
