(321755, 23836, 7510, '<td valign="top">For anyone who comes back for a second look...<br/> <br/>Again I left things to the last minute, or in this case 90 minutes.  I set up this shot, and took about 70 photos of Canada Dry in different ways.  Copied them to the computer and played with about 5 images I liked.  Finally chose this one and uploaded it all within the last 90 minutes before the deadline.<br/> <br/>By the time I noticed the Pinkish/purple refection from the BlackLight, there wasn''t enough time to reshoot it.<br/> <br/>After, I topped this one up with some Gin, and drank it down.  =o)</td>', 'For anyone who comes back for a second look... Again I left things to the last minute, or in this case 90 minutes.  I set up this shot, and took about 70 photos of Canada Dry in different ways.  Copied them to the computer and played with about 5 images I liked.  Finally chose this one and uploaded it all within the last 90 minutes before the deadline. By the time I noticed the Pinkish/purple refection from the BlackLight, there wasn''t enough time to reshoot it. After, I topped this one up with some Gin, and drank it down.  =o)', '2003-06-11 07:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
