(322187, 23791, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique CLub*<br/> <br/>The colors are interesting but I have a big problem with the lips themselves.  For being the main focus of the image they are very soft and the focus just isn''t there.  Part of it could be the lipstick bleeding but if you are going to do a photo so concentrated on a pair of lips make sure your model has lip liner on to stop the lipstick bleeding.  <br/> <br/>You stated you used lots of neatimage to get the plastic look to it, it just doesn''t work for me.  The purpose for plastic surgery and collogen injections is not to look like plastic it is to look real without imprefections. <br/> <br/>I can''t stop being distracted by the right side of the mouth even though your focus is to the left top, the right bottom is so out of focus and bright it takes all the attention from the needle and upperlip.<br/> <br/>As for meeting the challenge, doesn''t to me.  Had there been a drop of liquid even if it was water or cooking oil visible from around the needle then it would but without the title all it is is a photo of vanity. <br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique CLub* The colors are interesting but I have a big problem with the lips themselves.  For being the main focus of the image they are very soft and the focus just isn''t there.  Part of it could be the lipstick bleeding but if you are going to do a photo so concentrated on a pair of lips make sure your model has lip liner on to stop the lipstick bleeding.   You stated you used lots of neatimage to get the plastic look to it, it just doesn''t work for me.  The purpose for plastic surgery and collogen injections is not to look like plastic it is to look real without imprefections.  I can''t stop being distracted by the right side of the mouth even though your focus is to the left top, the right bottom is so out of focus and bright it takes all the attention from the needle and upperlip. As for meeting the challenge, doesn''t to me.  Had there been a drop of liquid even if it was water or cooking oil visible from around the needle then it would but without the title all it is is a photo of vanity.  Anna', '2003-06-11 13:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
