(323277, 23721, 8758, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the encouraging comments and good advice, it does a first timer a lot of good.....thank you people.<br/> <br/>The graininess, lens flash and sunflare where all positive choices...I liked the way the colours of the bubble where mirrored by the colour of the graininess in the sky...I liked the strong diagonal that, together with highlight on the top right of bubble, the flash and flare created...I felt it led the eye in and out of the picture and added a sense of movement to the bubble...the lack of sharp focus on the bubble was because I don''t no what the hell I''m doing..........ooooh a bit of self-justification does you good!</td>', 'Thanks for all the encouraging comments and good advice, it does a first timer a lot of good.....thank you people. The graininess, lens flash and sunflare where all positive choices...I liked the way the colours of the bubble where mirrored by the colour of the graininess in the sky...I liked the strong diagonal that, together with highlight on the top right of bubble, the flash and flare created...I felt it led the eye in and out of the picture and added a sense of movement to the bubble...the lack of sharp focus on the bubble was because I don''t no what the hell I''m doing..........ooooh a bit of self-justification does you good!', '2003-06-12 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
